<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- Miwera</book>
  <para style="toc3">Bik</para>
  <para style="toc2">BIKƆMELI BI BA PƆSOLU</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buku e Bikɔmeli bi Bapɔsɔlu</para>
  <para style="mt2">Bikɔmeli bi BAPƆSƆLU</para>
  <para style="mt1">Bikɔmeli bi Bapɔsɔlu</para>
  <para style="imt">Bokwea ta buku</para>
  <para style="ip">Buku e Bikɔmeli bi Bapɔsɔlu edii buku e babae e Luka. Ta bwɛndi bopele bo nde bo boso, Luka asukea oko ta bomɔ bo Yesu iya ta kpɔtɔ. Bobanga ta boangɔdjɔmɔ bo Yesu ta busa 1, 1-11, bodaa bo Kilito ta dii batingami ba nde mosɔmbɔtɔnɔke: batamoɛnɛbi naikina na miso ma mokuku. Iyena edii mondomba moinedjakaea buku e Bikɔmeli ehole e Ekelesa: Yesu akadikame ena na ndjea e Mwembo mo nde imua mokapingedje batingami. Isolo ilumake na bomɔ. Idii ena na bobotama bo maputo ma bakilito ta bisika bi Bayudha (na mopɔsɔlu ekombedjake Petelo), ondingo ta Yelusalɛmɛ kaoko ta bisika bi bato badii pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha ondingo Atiosi, Kolito kaoko Pilipe. Ta tei buku emina, etubanakadea pongono mɛɛngɔ mi Polo ta elomu e Ndjakomba. Ta tei e eyu einedjakdea minɔngɔ mi Ekelesa iye e yeene ko na mondumba modjeba na yu bosidja minɔngɔ na ekamoli e Mwembo mo Kumu. Luka abolodja makpi makina ta tei mokanda mokabee ibo «djulunale e Luka». Luka akomakadea bɛngi ainedje bo iyo mɛnɛ pongono adii o tei ta mɔɔngɔ mo Toloasi ta Pilipe («lohombaki tomba ta…» (16, 5-21, 18), ko mbunoko ta Yelusalɛmɛ ta esika epeama Polo (20, 5-21, 18), ko tomba Sedjale mbunoko ta Loma, ta esika eambaka Polo asambedjame boso bo bianga bibae (ekenge enɛnɛ e 27-28). Ta mbangi buku einedjakadea popa e yu na bohu mɛnɛ (1, 8): ngɔngɔ dji boangɔdjɔmɔ bo Yesu (1, 1-8, 3), mbangi e Ekelesa e boso, ta Yelusalɛmɛ; bonanganedja bo Bwɛndi Bopele ta bisika bikina bidikaka ta ekomi (8, 4-12; 25), ko na ta bikomi bidaka mbuti na dua enɛnɛ e Meditelane mbunoko ta Loma, ngando enɛnɛ adikamaka Kaisala (13, 1-28, 31). Na tina emina bwɛngi bonangana pamba djisusu ta ngondo bodjebama ta ehole iyena, bobalami na bokue ta bileho ko na mibalo mi bapɔsɔlu. Einedjakadea ta o tei bo Yesu oinedjama na bato basusu, edae Bayudha na bato badii pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha, edii wɛtoko moto iyona ehelama ta Palesitine. Mwembo molomaka batingami ba nde bamodjebe na pɛpɛ boembɛ, na mibalo mi nde ko na mokɔ mi nde. Midjɔ mitubani ibo iya ta buku e Bikɔmeli midipoakadea ndjea ta midjɔ misusu mi bwani bokɔmɔ ta Ekelesa e dikamadea tina e seko: botɔndea Bwɛndi Bopele bo Yesu Kilito ta dii bato basusu, mbunoko ta mɔɔngɔ masusu ma ndondo.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ndikano e Mwembo Mosɛnɔke ta dii bapɔsɔlu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Teopile,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 1:1">Ta buku e mbi e boso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Luka 1, 1-4; buku e Bikɔmeli edii ekenge ekina e bwendi bopele bo Luka.</char></note> natubana mɛko misusu mikɔkɔ Yesu ko mileha iyo, bobanga ta mbangi <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />mbunoko ta busa ibua boiwea iyo ta busa. Boso aiwee ta busa, apa mitindo mi nde, na ndjea e Mwembo Mosɛnɔke, ta dii ibia bahɔɔ iyo ondingo bapɔsɔlu. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Na tina emina, ngɔngɔ dji bogwa bo nde, asainedja na bu na bimbete binɛnɛ bobainedja bo adaaka na bomɔ: masu tuku inɛi, abaimanea ko ababalea tina etingi na Bokumu bo Ndjakomba. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Busa bomɔti boyaka iyo mia na bu, abapa motindo ibo: «Pɛpɛ boimanani ta Yelusalɛmɛ, endelo ambani eka eodikanani na Sesa, ikabo idia diotɔndeakani mbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ayakaka mia na bu: ta mohombedja mokina adaaka na bu. Ta mobalo imua mo Yesu, boindja Luka 24, 49.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Modjɔ mo Yoane abatisa na madiba, endelo ino, ngɔngɔ dji masu makɛkɛ, odadeani babatisamake na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yoane, epalakadea bobala Yoane Mobatisi. Boindja Mat 3, 11; Malako 11:8; Luka 3, 16; Yoane 1, 33.</char></note>.»<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aiwei ta busa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Iboa ibia baputoanaka mbuti na Yesu bamowadja bo: «Kumu, ta ehole iye osɔmbedjadea bokondji bo Isalɛlɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Ams 9, 11-12; Luka 19; 11.</char></note>?»<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Yesu abasombedja bo: «Ta modjɔ moindji ehole kaoko busa eindjitini ino, modjɔ mo Sesa aebɔngedja na ndenge ekapale iyo mɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Malako 13, 32.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Ekahia obolodjadeani ngulu emɔti, ehole etitadea Mwembo Mosɛnɔke ta dii ino. Iboa odaadeani ba temo ba mbi ta Yelusalɛmɛ, ta Yudhea itombo ko na Samalia, ko mbunoko ta suka e ngondo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ ta Mat 28, 19; Malako 16, 15; Luka 24, 47-48.</char></note>.» <verse eid="ACT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Ngɔngɔ dji mɛko imia, Yesu aiwea ta busa ta ehole emina ibo basusu bamoindjaka ko itute dimɔti dimodipa ta miso ma bobo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ ta Malako 16, 19; Luka 24, 50-51.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Iyana adaaka oko bakokoledja ta busa ta polo eiweaka Yesu, na mbala emɔti baami babae balwali bisendja bipu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Luka 24, 4.</char></note> baema mbuti na bu <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />ko babala na bu bo: «Baami ba Galileya, odikini iyana ko oindjakadeani o diko tina nda? Yesu iyona, osaiwea ta busa, asɔmbɔbi oko mondumba momɔti mosa moɛnɛ ino akɛkɛdea akɛe.»<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moto osulungana Yudhasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Iboa batingami basɔmbɔ ta Yelusalɛmɛ ta ngomba e mele mi Olive. Ngomba emina edii mbuti na ngando enɛnɛ, bokimana ekenge e ngonga ta bodala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta Malako 11, 1 ko na nase.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Ehole eimea bo ta Yelusalɛmɛ, baiwea ta ekenge e ndako iyena edaka ibo mandɛli mandɛli ta ekpalaka o diko. Edaka Petelo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Petelo… Djake: boɛngɛ Mat 10, 2-4; Malako 3, 16-19; Luka 6, 14-16.</char></note>, Yoane, Djake na Andele, Pilipo na Tomasi, Batelemi na Matayo, Djake mwana o Alipe, Simona Djeloti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta Mat 10, 4 ko na nase; Mal 3.18; Luk 6, 15.</char></note> ko Yudhasi mwana moomi o Djake. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Ibo basusu baputoanaka engi ndelo bɛngi baangɔne, na bali, na Malia nange Yesu, ko na baangi Yesu ba baami.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Busa bomɔti bo masu mamina imia, motswiya mo badhimi baputoana mokimanaka mokama na tuku djibae. Petelo aema ta ndanda e bobo ko abala na bu bo: <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />«Baangi mbi, eka ebala Mwembo Mosɛnɔke ta Makomi etungi ekokedjame: abala na ndjea e Dhapiti, ko ta tina e Yudhasi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ ta Ndjem 41, 10.</char></note>, iyona oimei modaledji o bato ibia bapea Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Yudhasi adaaka omɔti ta tei e biso ko abolodja mo nde mosala ta elomu e biso. <verse eid="ACT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />Na palanga dji moputea bo ta bobe bonɛnɛ bo nde, asasombea gbie emɔti; ko akwa boso na molo, ko mokuku mo nde mobatoa ndanda ko misɔpɔ mi nde milusoa. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Bato basusu ba Yelusalɛmɛ baoka modjɔ momina, na tina emina babea gbie emina na monɔkɔ mo bobo mo ngando, “Hakelɛdama”, etingodji bo “gbie e makiya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta molɔngɔ mo 18-19, boindja Mat 27, 3-8.</char></note>”. <verse eid="ACT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Enakoboa, indja eka edii ekomamake ta buku e Ndjembo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">“Kina bo ndako ende edike ngasa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">ko pɛpɛ nongo omɔti adae pɛpɛ bodaa iyana.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Ko ekomama naikina bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">“Kina bo okina moto atombe mosala mo nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndjem 69, 26; 109, 8.</char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21-22" />Na tina emina etungi na moto omɔti bodoa aputoana na su bɛngi abale tati e bosisoa ta bogwa bo Kumu Yesu. Moto omina atungi adae ta tei e ibia badalaka na su ndelo esusu edalaka iso na Kumu Yesu ta bikomi, donga ehole emobatisa Yoane mbunoko busa ibua boiwea iyo bɛngi akɛe ta busa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 21-22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Esika e mobatisa Yoane: ta mohombe mokina esika ebatisaka Yoane. Boindja ta Mat 3:16; Malako 1, 9; Luka 3, 21. Bɛngi akɛe ta busa: boindja 1, 9 ko na nase.</char></note>.»<verse eid="ACT 1:21-22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Iboa bahɔɔ bato babae: Yosepu, abeamaka Balasabasi, adjebanaka pongono Yusitusi, ko na Matsiasi <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Ngɔngɔ djimina ibo basusu baso baangɔnɔ bo: «Kumu, wɛ moto okadjebe milema mi bato basusu, loinedja moto ohɔi wɛ ta tei e bato ibibi babae <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />tina e botomba mosala mo mopɔsɔlu, ta polo e Yudhasi mokini iyo tina e bokɛ ta dɔɔngɔ dihɔkɔbi iyo.» <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Iboa baboma djeke ko djonga ekwa ta dii Matsiasi, iyona oisama ta liputo di bapɔsɔlu doomi na omɔti.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Bodoa bo Mwembo Mosɛnɔke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Ehole eimia isu di Patekote<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Lew 23, 15-21; Det 16:9-11.</char></note>, badhimi baputoanaka ibo basusu esika emɔti. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Na mbala emɔti, dhaka emɔti edonga ta busa, ondingo ekumbaki emɔti e poeya, eluma ndako esusu iyena edaka bo na mobondo. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Iboa baso baɛnɛ leka lomɔti lobaimanea ondingo mosa; lonangana ko lodaaka ondingo yeemi ko lodoa adaa ta molo mo moto omɔti omɔti o bobo. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Ibo basusu baluma na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke ko babanga bobala na minɔkɔ mikina, bobwana na mondumba momopaka Mwembo abale.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Ta Yelusalɛmɛ Bayudha basapaka na Ndjakomba badaaka ena, badonga ta bikomi bisusu bi ngondo. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Ehole eokama dhaka emina, emumu e bato eputoana. Ko ibo basusu baluma na bokamoa, modjɔ mo omɔti omɔti o bobo aokaka badhimi babala na monɔko mo bobo mo ngando. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Bakamoaka bobuke mɛnɛ, ko basawadjaka bo: «Bato ibi babalakadea, ibo basusu badiiti bato ba Galileya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ ta 1, 11.</char></note>? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Ndenge ndani ekɔmɔkɔdea bɛngi omɔti omɔti o biso aoke babala na monɔkɔ mo nde mo ngando? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Ta tei e biso, edii na bato badongi ta ekomi e Palate, e Mede, ko Elame. Edii na bato ba Medjopotami, e Yudhea ko na Kapadose, ta Poti ko na ta ekenge e mokili mo Adjia, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />ta Pilidji ko na Papili, e Edjipito ko na telitoale e Silɛne ta Libi; edaka pongono na bakɛndɛli ibia badonga ta Loma, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />ta Kɛlɛte ko Alabi; bato bamɔti babotama Bayudha, ko bakina badhimeaka Ndjakomba o Bayudha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mat 23, 15 ko na nase.</char></note>. Ko na tina emina lobaokakadea batɔndea misala minɛnɛ mi Ndjakomba na minɔkɔ mi biso mi ngando!» <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Ibo basusu balumaka na bokamoa ko basayekea bobuke mɛnɛ; basawadjanaka bo: «Modjɔ momina imu mopalakadea bobala bo?» <verse eid="ACT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Endelo bakina bataaka badhimi bo: «Balangoi vino e yeene!»<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo alehakadea emumu e bato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Iboa Petelo aso aema na Doomi na omɔti; ko abala na emumu e bato na moholi mo diko bo: «Ino Bayudha ko ino bato basusu bakadikame ta Yelusalɛmɛ, hokamedjani bopele mɛnɛ mibalo mi mbi ko sipoani midjɔ imi minɔmɔkɔdea. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Bato ibibi balangoiti mondumba molɛnɛkɛdea ino modjɔ mo edii oko ngonga e ibua e ehuma. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Ekahia edɛdiyeye eka ebala motɛli Yoɛlɛ ekokedjami:<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />“Ndjakomba abala bo: Ta masu ma suka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">nasopabi Mwembo mo mbi ta dii bato basusu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">bana ba bino ba baami ko na ba bali baimeabi batɛli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">bakandoli baɛnɛbi ndjɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">ko basuku ba bino baitabi ndjɔti.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Sooti mɛnɛ, ta masu imia, nasopabi Mwembo mo mbi ta dii basali baami na bali</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:18">ko baimeadea batɛli.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Nakɔɔdea bingengo ta busa o diko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">ko bimbete bibokamoa ta kpɔtɔ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">edabi na makiya, na mosa ko na matute ma mididi,<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Modaakabusa moimeabi modidi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">ko songe aimeabi mokpetu ondingo makiya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">boso bo busa bo Kumu boimee, busa bonɛnɛ bo ekumu.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Iboa, moto na moto iyona obeabi kombe e Kumu ahelabi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yl 3, 1-5, elangama ta buku eyou ekomama na monɔkɔ mo gɛlɛki.</char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />«Bana ba Isalɛlɛ, okani midjɔ mipalakadea mbi naotɔndeeni: Ndjakomba aoinedjani bokondji bo Yesu o Nadjalɛtɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ ta Mat 2, 23; Luka 18, 37.</char></note> iyana akɔɔ iyo ta ndanda e bino midjɔ mibokamoa, ko bingengo na bimbete mondumba modjebakadea ino bɛnɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Moto iyo akabama bobwana na meko etomba Ndjakomba ko na mbuno ebwanedja iyo tomba ehele. Omoowabini na bomobaka ta ekulusu engbanga emɔti na bato babe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta Mat 27, 35; Mal 15:24; Luka 23, 33; Yoane 19, 18.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Iboa Ndjakomba amosisodjabi ta bogwa, amodongedji ta saya e yogo, modjɔ mo yogo ebwanakiti bomopea tina e seko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Mat 28, 5-6; Malako 16, 6; Luka 24, 5.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Na tina emina, Dhapiti abala ta tina e nde bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">“Naɛnɛkɛ ndelo esusu Kumu ta boso bo mbi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">adii mbuti na mbi bɛngi nadae pɛpɛ bongongoma.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Na tina emina molema mo mbi molumi na mosepi ko mibalo mi mbi milumi na mongandi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">mokuku mo mbi mɛnɛ mohemadea na elɛndɛ,<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />modjɔ mo, otakinadeani ta ngondo e bato bago,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:27">otadhimadea bo mbi Mosɛnɔke o wɛ, napɔe ta tei e mombɔndɔ mo ikila.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Oinedjini ndjea e bomɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:28">olumedjadeani na sepi ta miso ma wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta molɔngɔ mo 25-28, boindja ta Ndjem 16, 8-11, elangama ta monɔkɔ mo gɛlɛki.</char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />«Baningani, ebɔngedjami tina e mbi bɛngi naotɔndeeni na bohu mɛnɛ ta tina e kɔkɔ Dhapiti bo: agwa, apuseama, ko ikila di nde idii na su teee mbunoko busa bu. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Endelo iyo adaaka motɛli ko adjebaka bo Ndjakomba amodikana na ndjea e seleka bo omɔti o batitani ba nde amotitanabi ta kiti e nde e bokumu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta Ndjem 132, 11; 2 Sam 7, 12-13.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Dhapiti asia boɛnɛ ehele modjɔ mokɛkɛdea adoe; na boa abala tina e bosisoa ta bogwa bo Masiya ehole ebala iyo bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:31">“Iyo aidika ta ngondo e bato bago,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:31">ko mokuku mo nde moipɔ ta tei e mombɔndɔ mo ikila.”<verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Ndjakomba asisodja Yesu ta tei e bato bago, ko iso lodii ba temo ba modjɔ momina. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Adii ta ebɔ e baami e Ndjakomba, ko abolodji Mwembo Mosɛnɔke imu modikana iyo; ko amosopa ta diko di biso, ko edii mɛko imi miɛnɛkɛdea ino ko miokakadea ino edɛdiyeye. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Modjɔ mo Dhapiti iyo mɛnɛ aiiwea ta busa, endelo abala bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">“Kumu abala na Kumu o mbi bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">doa adae ta ebɔ e mbi e baami,<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />napalakadea naise baloni ba wɛ ta nase dji mako ma wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndjem 110, 1.</char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />Bato basusu ba Isalɛlɛ batungi bodjeba sooti bo: Yesu iyo obaka ino ta ekulusu, iyo yona Ndjakomba amoimedja Kumu ko Masiya!»<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Ngɔngɔ dji booka mɛko mimina imia ibo baso babenea ta milema. Bawadja Petelo kona bapɔsɔlu bakina bo: «Baningani, lotungi lokɔeni bo?» <verse eid="ACT 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Petelo abasɔmbedja bo: «Hombedjani milema mi bino, ko engi moto atombe batisimo na kombe e Yesu Kilito, bɛngi pekato dji bino djikutubane. Iboa, obolodjadeani ikabo di Mwembo Mosɛnɔke. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Modjɔ mo ndikano e Ndjakomba epami tina e bino ko na bana ba bino, ko na ibia badii bohali, bato basusu ibia babeadea Kumu Ndjakomba o biso.» <verse eid="ACT 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Petelo abatɔndea naikina mɛko mikina minɛnɛ bɛngi ababolodje ko na bobapingedja, ko abalaka bo: «Dhimani mohelo osakadiani bobe bo bato ibia babungedjama!» <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Ndambo e bato ta tei e bobo badhima mobalo mo nde ko batomba batisimo. Bato babakeama busa ibua, bokimana bato koto djisato ta iputo di badhimi.<verse eid="ACT 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bomɔ bo iputo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Bato basusu basapaka na bosusu booka bileho bipaka bapɔsɔlu, bohelama ta tei e iputo ko bayakaka esika emɔti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bayakaka esika emɔti: ebwanaka bodaa ndelo ekina Mesa e Kumu. kaoko Komiyo, kaoko mia ma boyaka mɛnɛ engbanga emɔti na Mesa e Kumu.</char></note> ko bakweaka ta tei e miɔngɔnɔ. <verse eid="ACT 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Engi moto aokaka bɔɔ, modjɔ mo Ndjakomba akɔkɔ bingengo na midjɔ mi bokamoa minɛnɛ na ndjea e bapɔsɔlu. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Badhimi basusu badaaka omɔti. Leka losusu lopeaka bo lodaaka esika emɔti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ ta 4, 32-35.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Batɛkɛkɛ leka lo bobo na mapango ma bobo ko bakabanaka palanga djibolodja bo djisusu bobwana na botaka bo moto na moto. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Engi busa, baputoanaka ta tepelo, bayakaka ipa esika emɔti ta ndako ko bayayaka mia ma bobo na mongandi ko na bosatitedja ta milema. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Bakumedjaka Ndjakomba ko bapalamaka na bato basusu. Ko Kumu abakeaka masu na masu ta iputo di bobo bato ibia bapaka iyo mohelo.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Moomi omɔti o mako makatatake aheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Busa bomɔti ngɔngɔ dji midi, Petelo na Yoane baiweaka aangɔnɔ ta tepelo ta ngonga e basato e ngɔngɔ dji midi. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Edaka na moto omɔti o mako makatatake donga ta bobotama bo nde, adaaka mbuti na modipe mo tepelo, mobeaka bo «Modipe Mopele.» Engi busa badoaka na nde ko bamodedjaka ena bɛngi asɛngɛke leka ta dii bato ibia badaaka bakwea ta tepelo. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Aɛnɛ yo Petelo na Yoane bakɛkɛ akwee ta tepelo ko abasɛngɛ makota. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Petelo na Yoane bamotingea miso ko petelo abala na nde bo: «Lokokoledja!» <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Moto omina aso abaindja bopele mɛnɛ, modjɔ mo alɛnɛkɛ bo abwani bodia moeka ta dii bo. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Iboa Petelo abala na nde bo: «Mbi napeliti palanga, kaoko wolo, endelo edɛdiyeye naopakadea eka edii na mbi ta kombe e Yesu Kilito o Nadjalɛtɛ, angɔ ko dala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mikanda mikina midiiti na ango.</char></note>!» <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Ngɔngɔ djimina amopea na ebɔ e baami, bɛngi amoangɔdje. Na mbala emɔti, mako ma nde na gaga dji nde djininoa; <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Na mbala emɔti aema diko, apimboa na mako ma nde ko aso abanga bodala. Akwea engbanga emɔti na bu ta tepelo akɛkɛ adale, apimboe ko na bokumedja Ndjakomba. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Emumu e bato basusu bamoɛnɛ akɛkɛdea adale ko akumedje Ndjakomba. <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />Ehole emodjeba bo edii wɛtoko iyo moto iyona odaaka na mobondo ta Modipe Mopele mo tepelo bɛngi asɛngɛke leka, ibo basusu baluma na bɔɔ ko na bokamoa ta tina e modjɔ imua mokɔmɔ na nde.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo atingodji modjɔ momina mobokamoa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Moto omina aipalaka bokina Petelo na Yoane, bato basusu balumaka na bokamoa, bapota mbuti na bu ta mbalasani ebeaka bo «Mbalasani e Sɔlɔmɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbalasani emina adaaka ta pamba e boso iyena edhimeanaka bato ibia badaaka pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha ta tepelo e Yelusalɛmɛ. Boɛngɛ 5, 12; Yoane 10, 23.</char></note>». <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Ndelo eɛnɛ Petelo modjɔ momina, abala na emumu e bato bo: «Ino bana ba Isalɛlɛ, tina ndani okamwakadeani na modjɔ momina? Oloindjakadeani iboa ondingo moto yo adali mɔndɔ na ngulu e biso bɛnɛ kaoko edii wɛtoko bosapa bo biso na Ndjakomba? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Ndjakomba o Abalayama, o Isaka ko o Yakobo, Ndjakomba o bakɔkɔ ba biso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Boi 3, 15.</char></note>, ainedja ekumu e mosali onde Yesu. Ino bɛnɛ omokabakani ko omolonani ta boso bo Pilato, iboa iyo atombaka meko e bomotingoa. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Olonani moto iyona odaaka Mosɛnɔke ko iyona odaaka Moto o Bodju ko ohɔni baotingoeni mooweli o bato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta Mat 27, 15-23; Malako 15, 6-14; Luk 23, 13-23; Yoane 18, 38-40; 19, 12-15.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Iboa oowedjani Kumu o bomɔ. Endelo Ndjakomba amosisodja ta tei e bato bago ta modjɔ momina iso lodii ba temo. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Moto iyo oɛnɛkɛdeano ko odjebakadeano, edii wɛtoko kombe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na ngulu e kombe e nde: mondumba mokabalame ta Bibilia, kombe ekabwane oko na moswa yu. Momɛsɛno momina midii monɛnɛ ta Bikɔmeli (boindja ta 4:10) ko ekainedje seko Yesu oyona osisoa ta bogwa.</char></note> e Yesu ko na edhimeli e nde adii iyo. Edii edhimeli ta dii Yesu eka ekɔi bo ahele na bosusu mɛnɛ mondumba moɛnɛkɛdea ino basusu.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />«Ekahia, dengani, mbi nadjebakadea bopele bo ino na bakondji ba bino okɔkini modjɔ momina na taka e bodjeba. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Endelo Ndjakomba akokedja iboa midjɔ misia iyo botɔndɔ ehele ta minɔkɔ mi batɛli basusu; abalaka bo Masiya o nde aokabi saya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Luka 24, 26-27.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Na boa, hombedjani mida ko doani ta dii Ndjakomba bɛngi akutubanedje pekato dji bino. <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />Iboa Kumu alomadea ehole e eheme ko aolomeadeani Yesu, Masiya iyona ohɔɔ iyo ehele ta tina e bino. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Edɛdiyeye, etungi na nde adae ta busa mbunoko ehole eimeadea midjɔ misusu yeene mondumba motɔndeaka Ndjakomba ta minɔkɔ mi batɛli ba nde basɛnɔke donga ehele. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Na tina emina Mose abala bo: “Kumu Ndjakomba aolomeadeani motɛli omɔti oko ondingo mbi, iyo odadea omɔti ta ndanda e ekomi e bino. Ookadeani midjɔ misusu mibaladea iyo na nu. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Moto mosusu o dadea pɛpɛ bookea motɛli omina adongedjamadea ta tei e bato ko aowamadea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta molɔngɔ mo 22-23, boindja Dit 18, 15,18,19.</char></note>.” <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Batɛli basusu babalaka bobanga ta ehole e Samwɛlɛ, ko na batitani ba nde batɛlɛkɛ midjɔ mi masu imi. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Ndikano ekɔɔ Ndjakomba na batɛli edii tina e bino, ko odiini na ibondo ta mokongo mokɔɔ Ndjakomba na bakɔkɔ ba bino ehole ebala iyo na Abalayama bo: “Nadjongoadea mabota masusu ma ngondo na ndjea e batitani ba wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mba 22, 18.</char></note>”. <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Na tina emina, Ndjakomba aimedji boso Mosali o nde tina e bino, amolomi bɛngi aodjongoeni ko na adongedja moto mosusu ta tei e bino ta ndanda e mikɔ mibe.»<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Petelo na Yoane boso bo Ikita dinɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Petelo na Yoane babalaka naikina na bato, ehole eimea banganga ba Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Banganga ba Ndjakomba: mikanda mikina midii Bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ.</char></note>, mokondji o basindjili ba tepelo ko na Basadukai. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Badaaka mɛnɛ na kɛlɛ modjɔ mo ibo babae badoi na bileho bi bobo ta dii bato ko balehi bo Yesu asioaka ta bogwa, ko na tina emina badhimedja bo bato bago babwani bosisoa. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Babapea ko babaisa ta bɔlɔkɔ na bulu, modjɔ mo busa bosiaka. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Ekahia, ta tei e bato ibia baokaka bwɛndi bo bapɔsɔlu, banɛnɛ badhima, ko motswuya mo badhimi moiwea bokimana bato koto djitano. <verse eid="ACT 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Ngɔngɔ dji busa bomɔti, bakondji ba Bayudha, basuku ko na balehi ba mobeko baputoana ta Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Edaka: Ane, nganga o ndjakomba o monɛnɛ, Kaipa, Yoane, Alɛkɛdjandɛlɛ ko na bato basusu ba libota di nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Baemedja bapɔsɔlu ta boso bo bobo ko babawadja bo: «Ino okɔini modjɔ imia na ngulu e nda kaoko na kombe e nda?» <verse eid="ACT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Iboa Petelo aluma na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke ko abala na bu bo: «Babanei ko na basuku: <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />olowadjakadeani busa bu eloketingi na bopele bokɔi iso na moto iyo o mako makatatake, olowadjakadeani mondumba ndani moheli na moto iyo. <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />Bopele, etungi odjebeni ino basusu, ko na bato basusu ba Isalɛlɛ bo: moto iyo akaema boso bo bino na mokuku mopele, edii wɛtoko na bopilo bo kombe e Yesu Kilito o Nadjalɛtɛ, iyona obaka ino ta ekulusu ko Ndjakomba amosisodja ta tei e bato bago. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Yesu adii iyona obalakadea Makomi bo: “Ibanga idumba ino batongi ba ndako, imei ikwee di ndonga idia dipeli ndako esusu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndjem 118, 22.</char></note>.” <verse eid="ACT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Bato babwani bohela oko na ndjea e nde, modjɔ mo pɛpɛ nongo esika emɔti ta ngondo mobimba, Ndjakomba aipa bato kombe ekina ebuki ebwani boloheledja.» <verse eid="ACT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Bato ba Ikita baluma na bokamoa, modjɔ mo baɛnɛkɛ swueya e Petelo na Yoane ko badjebaka bo badaaka bato ngasa bato badaa pɛpɛ bokwea kalasi. Badjebaka naikina bo badaaka bato ibia badalaka na Yesu engbanga emɔti. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Endelo baɛnɛkɛ pongono moto iyona ohela aemi mbuti na bu ko baidiaka eka e bosɔmbedja. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Babapa motindo baimane sokolu e Ikita dinɛnɛ ko babanga boisana kitɛ ta tei e bobo. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Babalaka bo: «Ebwani so bokɔɔ na bato ibibi nde? Modjɔ mo bato basusu ba Yelusalɛmɛ badjebakadea bopele bo edii ibo bato bakɔi midjɔ mi bokamoa imi minɛnɛ ko lobwaniti bomidimbodja. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Endelo gala e modjɔ imu ebwaniti bonangana ta dii bato basusu. Lobagamee ko lobasie badae pɛpɛ bobalea nongo moto omɔti kombe e Yesu.» <verse eid="ACT 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Iboa, basɔmbɔ bobabea ko babasia na ngulu mɛnɛ bobala kaoko boleha na kombe e Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Endelo Petelo na Yoane babasɔmbedja bo: «Ino bɛnɛ pete indjani bopele eka edii epele ta boso bo Ndjakomba, iso loosumeni kaoko losume Ndjaokomba. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Oto ta tina e biso lobwaniti bokina bobala modjɔ moɛni iso ko mooki iso.» <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Bato ba Ikita babagamea na ikina ko babakina. Baidiaka mwɛngi mo bobapa etumbu, modjɔ mo bato basusu bakumedjaka Ndjakomba ta tina e modjɔ imua mokɔɔmɔ. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Moomi omina iyona ohela na midjɔ mi bokamoa adaaka na bianga bonɔ tuku inɛi.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Miɔngɔnɔ mi badhimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Ehole ekina bo Petelo na Yoane, basɔmbɔ ta iputo di binabu ko babatubana midjɔ misusu mibalaka bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba ko na basuku. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Ngɔngɔ dji booka isolo dimina, badhimi baso baputoana bangɔnɔ Ndjakomba bo: «Kumu, wɛ moto oyoa diko na kpɔtɔ, dua ko na leka losusu lodii ena<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Boi 20, 11; Ndjem 146:6.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Na ngulu e Mwembo Mosɛnɔke obala na ndjea e kɔkɔ o biso Dhapiti mosali o wɛ bo: “Tina ndani bikomi bisusu bimei boleloa? Bato baimei akɔɔkɔke mikɔ mi ngasa! <verse eid="ACT 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Bakondji ba ngondo baleloi, babanei baimei bookana bɛngi balone Kumu ko na Kilito ohɔi iyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndjem 2, 1-2, ebalama ta monɔkɔ mo gɛlɛki.</char></note>.” <verse eid="ACT 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Modjɔ mo sooti mɛnɛ, Elode na Pɔsɔ Pilato baputoani ta ngando iyeye enɛnɛ, na bato ba bikomi djibuki ko na bana ba Isalɛlɛ tina e bolona Yesu, Mosali o wɛ Mosɛnɔke, iyo ohɔɔ wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Luka 23, 7-11; Mat 27, 1-2; Isa 61, 1.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Oko boa bakokedji midjɔ misusu mikana wɛ donga ehele na ngulu ko na malɛno ma wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Ko edɛdiyeye, Kumu, oka mondumba mo logameakadea bo ko pa basali ba wɛ swueya e botɔndea mobalo mo wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Inedja ngulu e wɛ bɛngi mohelo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mohelo: mohelo imumu, modii mo mokuku.</char></note>, bimbete ko na bingengo bikɔɔme na kombe e Yesu, Mosali o wɛ Mosɛnɔke.» <verse eid="ACT 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Ehole e sidja bo boangɔnɔ, esika edaka bo baboli ekumana. Ibo basusu baluma na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke ko babanga botɔndea mobalo mo Ndjakomba na swueya.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Badhimi bakabani leka lo bobo ta tei e bu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Badhimi basusu badaaka mɛnɛ omɔti, na molema ko na malɛno mamɔti. Pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti osalongeaka na eka ende iyo mɛnɛ, endelo ta tei e bobo, leka losusu lodaaka na bu loda polo emɔti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ ta 2, 44-45.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Bapɔsɔlu babalaka tati e bosisoa ta bogwa bo Kumu Yesu na ngulu enɛnɛ ko ngɔlu enɛnɛ edaka ta tei e bobo basusu. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti ta tei e bobo otakaka eka emɔti. Modjɔ mo moto mosusu odaaka na gbie kaoko ndako badjitɛkɛkɛ, badoaka na palanga djimina <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />ko badjisambeaka ta mako ma bapɔsɔlu; ko bakabanaka palanga bobwana na ikamba di moto na moto. <verse eid="ACT 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Embete na Yosepu, moto o libota di molewi o botama ta Sipele, iyona obeaka bapɔsɔlu Balanabasi, epali bobala bo «Moto okapingedje», <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />atɛkɛ gbie edaka na nde, adoa na palanga ko aisambea ta mako ma bapɔsɔlu.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ananiasi na Sapila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Enakoboa edaka na moomi omɔti na kombe e Ananiasi, aokana na mwali o nde Sapila, batɛkɛ opango bo bobo bodaaka na bu. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Iyo adongedja ndambo ekina e palanga tina e nde mɛnɛ ko akɛɛ asambea palanga idjia djidika ta mako ma bapɔsɔlu. Mwali o nde adjebaka modjɔ momina. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Iboa Petelo amowadja bo: «Ananiasi, tina ndani Satana akwei ta molema mo wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Yoane 13, 2.</char></note>? Okosei Mwembo Mosɛnɔke na bobomba ndambo e palanga djitɛki na wɛ opango. <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Boso bo botɛkɛ opango, bodaki bo wɛ, ko ndelo ekaki wɛ botɛkɛ, palanga djikaki daa oko dji wɛ, ediiti iboa? Tina elɛdji na wɛ bokɔ modjɔ mondumba imu nda? Okosei Ndjakomba, endelo okoseiti bato.» <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Iyana aoka Ananiasi modjɔ momina, akwa ta kpɔtɔ ko agwa. Ko bato basusu ibia baoka modjɔ momina baluma na bɔɔ bonɛnɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Bandjenga baami badoa ahua ebembe na esendja, ko baso baeandoa ko baepusea. <verse eid="ACT 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Ngɔngɔ dji bokimana ngonga djisato, mwali o Anania akwea ko aidjebaka modjɔ nongo momɔti monɔmɔkɔ. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Petelo amowadja bo: «Tɔndeani, otɛkini opango bo bino na palanga motuya imu?» Ko iyo asɔmbedja bo: «Sooti, oko na motuya imua.» <verse eid="ACT 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Iboa Petelo abala na nde bo: «Tina ndani ino babae ookanakini bɛngi omekeni Mwembo mo Kumu? Indja, bato ibia bapuseaki moomi o wɛ badii ta modipe, bandoadea pongono na wɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Oko ta ehole emina, akwa ta mako ma Petelo ko aso agwa. Bandjenga baami bakwea ko bamotanea mogo; bamoandoa ko bamopusea mbuti na muma nde. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Ekelesa esusu ko bato basusu ibia baoka midjɔ mimina, baluma na bɔɔ bonɛnɛ mɛnɛ.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bapɔsɔlu baheledji bato ba bego banɛnɛ.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Bapɔsɔlu bakɔkɔ bimbete ko na bingengo binɛnɛ ta tei e bato. Badhimi baputoanaka na molema momɔti ta mbalasani e Sɔlɔmɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 3, 11 ko na nase.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti omekaka bokɛ ta dii ibo, na nongo abakumedjaka bato bobuke. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Emumu e bato banɛnɛ baami na bali badhimeaka Kumu ko babakeamaka ta iputo di bobo. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Ko babanga bodoa na bato ba bipeko na ndjea: babasambeaka ta ngaka kaoko matɔkɔ bɛngi ehole ebwani Petelo bonɔ, oto esii e nde pɛ ekunde omɔti kaoko okina ta tei e bobo. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Emumu e bato badongaka pongono ta ngando dji mbuti na mbuti na Yelusalɛmɛ; badoaka na bato ba bego ko na bato batungeamaka na membo mi pita, ko ibo basusu bahelaka.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bapɔsɔlu banɔngɔmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Iboa nganga o ndjakomba o monɛnɛ ko na bato basusu ibia badaaka na nde, edii wɛtoko bato ba iputo di Basadukai, baluma na ikua adii bapɔsɔlu; baso batomba meko. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Bapea bapɔsɔlu ko babaisa ta bɔlɔkɔ bo bato basusu. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Endelo na bulu obwɛndi omɔti o Kumu adipoa midipe mi bɔlɔkɔ, abaimedja ko aso abala na bu: <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />«Kɛɛni ta tepelo ko tɔndeani bato mɛko misusu mi bomɔ bo yeene.» <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Bapɔsɔlu baso basuma: ehuma e bhu, bakɛɛ ta tepelo ko bolehaka. Nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ ko na ibia basalaka na nde babea basuku ba bana ba Isalɛlɛ bɛngi bakɔe Ikita dinɛnɛ. Ngɔngɔ djimina baloma bato bakɛe ahomba bapɔsɔlu ta bɔlɔkɔ. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Endelo ehole eimea ba sindjili ta bɔlɔkɔ, baibatanea ta esika edaka ibo. Basɔmbɔ atɔndea ta Ikita ko babala bo: <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />«Lotanei bɔlɔkɔ bodipamake bopele mɛnɛ, ko ba sindjili badii ta midipe. Endelo ehole edipoi iso midipe, lotaneiti nongo moto omɔti o tei.» <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Ndelo eoka mokondji o ba sindjili ibia babaneaka tepelo, ko na banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ, basayekea bobuke mɛnɛ tina bapɔsɔlu baiɛnɛmɛkɛ, iboa basawadja imi mɛko midongi djɔ. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Oko ta ndelo emina moto omɔti adoi ko abali bo: «Bato ibia baisaki ino ta bɔlɔkɔ badii ta tepelo, badii edɛdiyeye baleha bato.» <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Iboa mokondji o basodha akɛɛ na bato ba nde ko apea bapɔsɔlu, endelo na bwela mɛnɛ, modjɔ mo badaaka na bɔɔ bo bato basusu, ibia babwanaka bobala mabɔkɔ. <verse eid="ACT 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Bahula na bu, ko babaimedja ta boso bo Ikita dinɛnɛ ko nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ abawadja. <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />Abala na bu bo: «Iso loosiani na ngulu mɛnɛ boleha na kombe e moto yona. Ko eka ekɔi ino nda? Onanganedjini bileho bi bino ta Yelusalɛmɛ ko opalakadeani ohuledjeni lindo e makiya ma yogo ende ta dii iso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Mat 27, 25.</char></note>!» <verse eid="ACT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Petelo na bapɔsɔlu bakina basɔmbedja bo: «Etungi bosuma boso mɛnɛ Ndjakomba, endelo te bato. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Ndjakomba o bakɔkɔ ba biso asisodja ta bogwa Yesu iyona oowa ino na bomobaka ta ekulusu. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Ndjakomba amodedji ta ebɔ e nde e baami ko amoimedji olongo Kumu ko Moheledji bɛngɛ bo apɛ enɔi ta ekomi e Isalɛlɛ bahombedje mida ko bodia ekutubanedji e pekato dji bobo. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Iso lodii ba temo ba midjɔ mimina, iso na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke imua mopa Ndjakomba ta dii ibia bakamosume.» <verse eid="ACT 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Bato ba Ikita baoka kɛlɛ iyana aoka bo mibalo mimina, ko bapalaka baowodje bapɔsɔlu. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Endelo ta ndanda e bobo edaka na Mopalisai omɔti na kombe e nde Gamaliɛlɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gamaliɛlɛ: adaaka omɔti ta tei e balehi ba mibeko badjebana ta tei Bayudha. Adaka ta tei e bato ba ikita dinɛnɛ di ekomi e nde ko Polo alakamaka na nde(22, 3). </char></note>, molehi o mibeko osumaka bato basusu. Aema ta ndanda e Ikita asɛngɛ bo bapete imanedja bapɔsɔlu sokolu mweka. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />ko abala na Ikita bo: «Bana ba Isalɛlɛ, toma kebani na modjɔ mopalakadea ino bokɔɔ na bato ibi. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Eikɔɔ nongo ekoka Teudasi aso aimana, iyona osakumedjaka moto monɛnɛ; bokimana bato mikama minɛi baputoana na nde. Endelo agwa, ko bato basusu ibia bamokimanaka baso banagana ko pɛpɛ nongo eka emɔti edika. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Ngɔngɔ dji nde, ta ehole e motangi mo bato, Yudhasi o Galileya aimana; apangoa emumu e bato ngɔngɔ dji nde. Endelo iyo pongono agwa, ko bato basusu bamokimanaka banagana. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Edɛdiyeye, naotɔndeakadeani bo: pɛpɛ bokimananioko bato ibibi ko bakinani bakɛe. Modjɔ mo ekadaa malɛno ma bobo ko mikɔ mi bobo midongakadea ta dii bato losusu lodimoadea. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Endelo ekadaa bo midongakadea ta dii Ndjakomba, obwanitini bomibedja. Pɛpɛ bomekadeani oko boanedja Ndjakomba!» Bato ba Ikita badhima ilɛno di Gamaliɛlɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Babea naikina bapɔsɔlu, bababomedja ko babasia bo badae pɛpɛ bolanga kombe e Yesu, ngɔngɔ djimina babakina. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Bapɔsɔlu baimana ta Ikita, ibo basusu badaaka na sepi na modumba mobasakoa Ndjakomba bo badhimi bonɔngɔmɔ ta tina e Kombe e Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Ko masu masusu, balehaka ko batɔndeaka Bwɛndi Bopele bo Yesu Masiya ta tepelo na pɛpɛ boɛmbɛ.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s1">Baami sambo bahɔɔmi tina e bokamoa bapɔsɔlu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Ta ehole emina iyena, motuya mo batingami moiweaka, badhimi ibia babalaka monɔkɔ mo Gɛlɛki basayenaka na bato ibia babalaka monɔkɔ mo Baebele: babalaka bo ta ehole ekabanaka bo mia ma engi busa, badjimaka bali bagwa na baami ibia badaaka ta iputo di bobo. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Iboa bapɔsɔlu doomi na babae badaa polo emɔti na batingami ko babala na bu bo: «Ediiti bopele bo, lokine boleha mobalo mo Ndjakomba bɛngi lokabanake mia ma boyaka. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Na tina emina, baningani, hɔɔni bato sambo ta ndanda e bino, bato ba mida mipele, balumake na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke ko na konga, ko lobapadea mosala momina. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Ko iso lodike oto loadaledja miɔngɔnɔ ko na mosala mo boleha.» <verse eid="ACT 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Ikita isusu idhima ilɛno dimina. Iboa bahɔ Etsiɛni, moto oluma na bodhima ko na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke, ko na Pilipo, Polokole, Nikanɔle, Timoni, Palamenasi ko na Nikolasi, moto o Atiosi, adaaka boso modhimi o Ndjakomba o Bayudha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mat 23, 15 ko na nase.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Ko babaimedja ta boso bo bapɔsɔlu baangɔnɔ ko babakea mɔmɔ. <verse eid="ACT 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Mobalo mo Ndjakomba monanganaka na bonɔ. Motuya mo batingami moiweaka bobuke mɛnɛ ta Yelusalɛmɛ ko banganga ba ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bakakoanakadea bo motsuya mo banganga ba Ndjakomba ba Bayudha ta Yelusalɛmɛ modaaka mbuti na 8000.</char></note> banɛnɛ badhimeaka Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bapei Etsiɛni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Etsiɛni, aluma na ngulu na ngɔlu, akɔkɔ bimbete na bingengo binɛnɛ ta tei e bato. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Bakina bato baisana na nde kitɛ: edaka bato ibia baputoanaka ta ndako e miɔngɔnɔ e Bayudha ebeamaka «Babuli batingoami<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndako e miɔngɔnɔ mi Bayudha e «Babuli batingoami» eputoanedjaka pape dji babuli bayou batombama na mokondji monɛnɛ o basodha o Loma o kombe Pope ta yanga e 63 boso bo bobotama bo Yesu Kilito ko baso batingoama ngɔngɔ. </char></note>», edaka na Bayudha ba Silɛne ko na ba Alɛkɛdjandɛlɛ, ko na Bayudha ba Silisi ko na ba ekenge e mokili mo Adjia. Ko babanga boisana kitɛ na Etsiɛni. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Endelo baimohɔnɔkɔ, modjɔ mo abalaka na konga emopaka Mwembo Mosɛnɔke. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Iboa baputa bato palanga bɛngi babale bo: «Lookaki asinga Mose ko na Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ ta Mat 26, 59-61; Malako 14, 55-58. </char></note>!» <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Bapangoa bato basusu, basuku ko na balehi ba mobeko bɛngi balemoe. Ngɔngɔ djimina bakwa diko di Etsiɛni, bamopea ko bakɛɛ na nde boso bo Ikita dinɛnɛ. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Batomba pongono ba temo babe babala bo: «Moto iyo atakinakadea bobala bobe tina e tepelo e biso esɛnɔke ko na mobeko mo Mose! <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Looka abala bo Yesu iyo o Nadjalɛtɛ abedjadea tepelo ko atikoanedjadea mida mibolodja iso tadii Mose.» <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Bato basusu ibia badaaka ta Ikita, batingea miso ta dii Etsiɛni ko baɛnɛ mbanda e nde ekuanake na mbanda e obwɛndi.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s1">Eleho e Etsiɛni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ amowadja bo: «Mɛko imi mibalakadea bo na wɛ midii sooti?» <verse eid="ACT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Etsiɛni asɔmbedja bo: «Baningani na basange i bato, hokamedjanini. Ndjakomba o ekumu aimanea kɔkɔ o biso Abalayama ta ehole edaka iyo ta Medjopotami, boso bo nde bokɛ adikama ta Halani, <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />ko abala na nde bo: “Kina ekomi e wɛ ko na ibota di wɛ, ko kɛɛ ta ekomi eoinedjadea mbi.” <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Iboa Abalayama akina ekomi e ba Saladeɛ ko akɛɛ adaa ta Halani. Ko, ngɔngɔ dji yogo e sango, Ndjakomba amonɔdjɔ ta Halani ta ekomi ehelamakakadea ino edɛdiyeye. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Ndjakomba aimopa nongo eka emɔti e bosangoa, pɛpɛ nongo moo polo o boisa eko; endelo amodikanedja bo amopabi ekomi ko batitani ba nde baetombabi pongono ngɔngɔ dji nde. Iboa ta ehole emina Abalayama aidaka na mwana. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Indja modjɔ mobala Ndjakomba na nde: “Batitani ba wɛ bahelamabi ta ekomi ebuki, iho baimeabi babuli ko babapeabi ta ibuli bianga mikama minɛi. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Ndjakomba abali bo, endelo napabi etumbu ta ekomi eyena edabi ibo babuli. Ngɔngɔ djimina, badongabi ena ko baangɔnɔkɔbini ta esika iye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta molɔngɔ mo 2 na 7: molɔngɔ mo 2-3: Mba 12, 1. Molongɔ 4: Mba11, 31; 12, 4. Molɔngɔ mo 5: Mba 12, 7; 13, 15; 15, 18; 17, 18. Molɔngɔ m 6-7: Mba 15, 13-14; Boi 3, 12.</char></note>.” <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Iboa Ndjakomba akɔɔ mokongo na Abalayama ko embete e mokongo momina wɛtoko bolena baana baami epole. Na tina emina Abalayama alena mwana o nde Isaka epole ngɔngɔ dji bokokedja masu bomwambe; oko mondumba momina momɔti, Isaka alena mwana o nde Yakobo ko Yakobo alena bana ba nde ibia baimea bakɔkɔ ba mabota doomi na mabae<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mba 17, 10-14; 21, 4. Bakɔkɔ: boindja ta 2, 29 ko na nase.</char></note>.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />«Bakɔkɔ ba biso baokea Yosepu swɛ ko bamotɛkɛ bɛngi aimee mobuli ta Edjipito. Endelo Ndjakomba adaaka na nde; <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />amotingoa ta minɔngɔ mi nde misusu. Apa Yosepu ngɔlu ko konga ta miso ma Palo, mokondji o Edjipito. Palo aimedja Yosepu gupɛlɛnɛlɛ ta Edjipito ko ta ndako e nde esusu. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Enakoboa, ndja enɛnɛ ekwa ta Edjipito esusu ko ta mokili mo Kanana. Saya edaka enɛnɛ na bonɔ ko bakɔkɔ ba biso baidiaka eka e boyaka. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Ehole eoka Yakobo ble djidaka ta Edjipito, aloma bakɔkɔ ba biso ta mbala e boso. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Akɛɛ bo mbala e babae, Yosepu asainedja na baangi nde, ko Palo aso asipoa isɔsi di nde. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Iboa Yosepu aloma bato bakɛe ahomba sange e nde Yakobo, ko denga di nde ibo basusu badaaka bato tuku sambo na batano. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Yakobo akɛɛ ta Edjipito, ko agwa iho na bakɔkɔ ba biso bakina. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Bibembe bi bobo bihula ta Sikɛmɛ ko babapusea ta ikila idii diisombaka Abalayama ta dii bana ba Amɔle<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta molɔngɔ mo 9 mbunoko ta 16: molɔngɔ 9: Mba 37, 11, 28; 39, 2, 21. Molɔngɔ mo 10: Mba 41, 39-41. Molɔngɔ mo 11: Mba 41, 57; 42, 1-2. Molɔgɔ mo 13: Mba 45, 1, 16. Molɔngɔ mo 14: Mba 45, 9-10, 17-18; bato tuku sambo na batano: Mba 46, 27, elangama ta buku eyou e gɛlɛkɛ. Moloɔngɔ mo 15: Mba 46, 1-7; 49, 33. Molɔngɔ mo 16: Mba 23, 3-16; 33, 19; 50, 7-13; Yos 24, 32.</char></note>.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />«Iyana abatama ehole iyena ebwanaka Ndjakomba bokokedja ndikano ekɔɔkɔ iyo na Abalayama, bato ba biso babotana ko baso balumana ta Edjipito. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Iboa mokondji o yeene, atomba bokondji ta Edjipito, aidjebaka Yosepu. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Mokondji omina abanga bokosea bakɔkɔ ba biso ko bobanyɔkɔlɔ na bobaloma badumbe bana ba bobo bɛngi bagwɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta molɔngɔ 17 mbunoko 19: molɔngɔ mo 17-18, Boi 1, 7-8. Molɔngɔ mo 19: Boi 1, 10-11, 22.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Mose abotama ta ehole iyena iyo adaaka mwana mopele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta Boi 2, 2.</char></note>, ta dii Ndjakomba. Abɔkɔmɔ songe basato ta ndako e sango. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Ko, ehole e modumba bo, mwana mwali o Palo amoandoa ko amobɔkɔ oko ondingo mwana moomi onde mɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta Boi 2, 3-10.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Na tina emina Mose aikoa mɛko misusu mi konga e bato ba Edjipito, ko aokamaka na mibalo ko na mikɔ mi nde. <verse eid="ACT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />Ehole ekokedja yo bianga tuku inɛi, Mose atomba meko e bokɛ aindja bangi inde ba makia, ba Isalɛlɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Aɛnɛ moto o Edjipito omɔti anyɔkɔlɔ omɔti o bobo; akɔ lwano ko osɔmbedja moto iyona bobe bo nde, ko aso aowa moto o Edjipito. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Alɛnɛkɛ bo baangi nde basipoadea bo Ndjakomba abatingoadea na ndjea ende; endelo ibo baidjebaka. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Ngɔngɔ dji busa bomɔti, aɛnɛ bana ba Isalɛlɛ babae baanaka ko apalaka boisa bogo ta tei e bobo. Abala na bu bo: “Baangi mbi, ino odiini bwela; oasakɔmeakadea na nu bobe nda?” <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Endelo moto iyo odaaka anyɔkɔlɔ mina nde alinda Mose ko amowadja bo: “Omina osaoisa mokondji ko djudji o biso nda? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Opalakadea oowoni oko ndenge eowaki wɛ moto o Edjipito mɔkɔ?” <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Ta tina e mobalo momina, Mose atia ko akɛɛ ahelama ta ekomi e Madiani. Iho, abota bana baami babae<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta molɔngɔ mo 23 mbunoko ta 29: Boi 2, 11-15, 21-22; 18, 3-4.</char></note>.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />«Ngɔngɔ dji bianga tuku inɛi, obwɛndi omɔti adoa ta dii yo ta edhu e ngomba e Sinai, ta mole mobwanaka mosa. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Mose, akamoa ta ndelo eɛnɛ iyo modjɔ momina. Endelo ta ehole esalindaka iyo bɛngi aindje mbuti, aso aoka kɔpi e Kumu ebalaka bo: <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />“Nadii Ndjakomba o bakɔkɔ ba wɛ, Ndjakomba o Abalayama, o Isaka ko o Yakobo.” Mose aluma na bɔɔ, ko aihɔnɔ bokokoledja. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Iboa Kumu abala na nde bo: “Dongedja sapato ta mako ma wɛ, modjɔ mo esika iye eemi wɛ edii kpɔtɔ djisɛnɔke. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Naɛni mondumba monɔngedjakadea bo bato ba mbi ta Edjipito, ko naoki bio dji bobo natiti tina e bobatingoa. Ko edɛdiybasɛnɔkeeye kɛɛ, napalakadea naolome ta Edjipito<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta molɔngɔ mo 30 mbunoko 34: Boi 3, 1-10.</char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />«Edii oko Mose iyona olona bana ba Isalɛlɛ na bobala bo: “Omina oisi mokondji ko na djudji nda?”, Ndjakomba amolomi ondingo mokondji ko moheledji, na ndjea e obwɛndi iyo oisainedja na nde ta mole imua mobwanaka mosa. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Edii iyo moto obaimedja ta Edjipito na bokɔ bingengo na bimbete ta mokili mo Edjipito, ta dua Ekpetu ta edhu tomba bianga tuku inei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta molɔngɔ mo 35 mbunok ta 36: molɔngɔ mo 35: Boi 2, 14. Molɔngɔ mo 36: Boi 7, 3; 14:21; Mits 14, 33.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Edii Mose iyo obala naikina na bana ba Isalɛlɛ bo: “Ndjakomba aolomeadeani motɛli omɔti ondingo mbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndjakomba aolomeadeani motɛli omɔti ondingo mbi: boindja Dit 18, 15, 18. </char></note>, adadea omɔti ta tei bato ba bino.” <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Ta ndelo eputoana bana ba Isalɛlɛ ta edhu, edii iyo moto odaaka ta tei e bakɔkɔ ba biso na obwɛndi iyona omobaleaka ta ngomba e Sinai; abolodja mibalo mi bomɔ, bɛngi amipɛ na su<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Boi 19, 1-20, 17; Dit 5, 1-33.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />Endelo bakɔkɔ ba biso baipala bomosuma; balemoa na nde ko bapalaka bosɔmbɔ ta Edjipito. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Babala na Alona bo: “Lokɔmea ba ndjakomba ibia badaladea ta boso e biso, modjɔ mo lotadjebakadea eka etanei Mose iyoo oloimedjabi ta ekomi e Edjipito.” <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Iboa ta masu imia balua ekeko e mwana o ngɔmbɛ ko baso bapa mbeka ta dii ekeko elua bo bɛnɛ, ko bakɔ tɛkɛ ta tina mosala mo mɔmɔ ma bobo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta molɔngɔ mo 39 mbunoko ta 41: molɔngɔ mo 39: Mit 14, 3. Molɔngɔ mo 40: Boi 32, 1. Molɔngɔ mo 41: Boi 32, 2-6.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Endelo Ndjakomba ababulɛɛ ko abakina bakumee ndjɔtɔ ba diko, oko mondumba mokomama ta buku dji batɛli bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">“Bana ba Isalɛlɛ, ediiti mbi moto iyona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">obondjea ino tito ko na mbeka djikina</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">tomba bianga tuku djinɛi ta etengelenge?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Otombakani epkangba e Moloke<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Moloke: ndjakomba omɔti o bato bayou ba Kanana. Lepani: kombe e ndjakoma o moyou okumeaka ibo ondingo moswa mokili mo Satuline. Boindja ta molɔngɔ 42-43: Amosa 5, 25-27.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">ko na epoya e ndjakomba o bino mondjɔtɔ Lepani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">bikeko ibia bilua ino bɛngi obikumeakeni. Na tina emina naotombadeani bohali bonɔ Babilɔne.”<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />«Ehole edaka bakɔkɔ ba biso ta edhu, badaaka na ekpangba e buku e mokongo. Ko na iyona obala na Mose amotɔndea aekɔe, oko mondumba moɛnɛkɛ iyo. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Ehole eimea Yosoa modaledji, bana ba bobo bakatoa kpɔtɔ dji bikomi ibia bibenganaka Ndjakomba ta miso ma bobo. Iboa bakwedja ekpangba e masaka edaka na buku e molongo iho, ko eso edikama ena tee mbunoko ehole e Dhapiti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ 44-45: Boi 25, 9, 40; Yos 3, 14-17.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Iyo abolodja ngɔlu ta boso bo Ndjakomba ko awadja ndjea e botonga ndako tina e batitani ba Yakobo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta 2Sa 7, 1-16; 1Kl 17, 1-14.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Endelo, edii Sɔlɔmɔ moto o mopika ndako<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 1Ba 6, 1-38; 2Kl 3:1-17.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Enakoboa, Iyona Onɔi Diko tadae ta ndako idji djitongama na mɔmɔ ma bato, oko mondumba, motɔndeakadea motɛli:<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />“Kumu abala bo: busa bodii kiti e mbi e bokumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">ko kpɔtɔ dji dii ebakeli e mbi e mako.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Obwanini botongeani ndako e mondumba nda?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Esika ndani e dikamadea mbi?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Naikɔ leka ilua losusu na mɔmɔ ma mbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ mo 49-50: Isa 66, 1-2.</char></note>?”<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />«Bato ba melo mipipo, bato ibia badipama milema na matoi, masu masusu tookeeni Mwembo Mosɛnɔke! Odiini ondingo bakɔkɔ ba bino. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Omina motɛli ndani odaa bakɔkɔ ba bino pɛpɛ bonɔngedja? Baowa ibia batɔndeaka bodoa bo Moto omɔti pɛ o bodju; ko edɛdiyeye, edii iyo moto okababi ino ko osaowa ino<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ ta Isa 63:10; 2 Kolnk 36:16; Mat 23:31.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Ino obolodjani mobeko na ndjea e babwɛndi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ ta Gal 3:19; Ebe 2:2.</char></note>, ko oimosumani!»<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yogo e Etsiɛni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Amabo oka mɛko mi mina ko baso baoka kɛlɛ ko bakpɛkɛnɛkɛ mino ta tina e Etsiɛni. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Endelo Etsiɛni aluma na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke, akokoledja miso ta busa aɛnɛ ekumu e Ndjakomba ko na Yesu aemi ta ebɔ e baami e Ndjakomba. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Abala bo: «Hokamedjani, naɛni busa bodipoami ko Mwana o moto aemi ta ebɔ e baami e Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="ACT 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Iboa bagama na ngulu ko baditea matoi. Ibo basusu basadumba ta diko di nde, <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />bamoimanedja sokolu e ngando enɛnɛ ko bamoowa na mobɔkɔ. Batemo bakina bisendja bi bobo ta dii mwenga iyona odaaka sindjili na kombe e Saulu. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Ta ehole iyena emoowaka ibo na mabɔkɔ Etsiɛni aɔngɔnɔkɔ bo: «Kumu Yesu, tomba mwembo mo mbi!» <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Ko akwa na magbunda ko agama na ngulu bo: «Kumu, pɛpɛ bokimanadea oko pekato iyeye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 60 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ ta Luka 23:34.</char></note>!» Ngɔngɔ dji bobala kɔpi emina, aso agwa.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Ko Saulu adhimedjaka yogo e Etsiɛni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 22, 20.</char></note>.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 8:1">Saulu anɔngedji Ekelesa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Oko ta busa bomina ibua monɔngɔ mopipo mokwea ta Ekelesa e Yelusalɛmɛ. Badhimi basusu, banangana ta ekenge e mokili mo Yudhea ko na Samalia dongedja oko bapɔsɔlu. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Endelo bato ba milema mipele bapusea Etsiɛni ko bayea bobuke mɛnɛ ta tina e yogo e nde.<verse eid="ACT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Saulu, aowaka Ekelesa na ingbangba; akweaka ta ndako emɔti na emɔti, apee bali na baami, ko abaisaka ta bɔlɔkɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 22, 4-5; 26, 9-11.</char></note>.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pilipo atɔndei Bwɛndi Bopele ta Samalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Bato ibia bananganaka, badalaka ta ekomi esusu, atondee mobalo mo Bwɛndi Bopele. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Pilipo, anɔɔ ta ngando enɛnɛ emɔti e Samalia, ko abanga botɔndea gala e Kilito. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Emumu e bato baputoana bahokamedjaka bopele mɛnɛ mibalo mi Pilipo ehole eokaka ibo ko eɛnɛkɛ bo bimbete bikɔkɔ iyo. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Modjɔ mo membo mi pita miimanaka na bato banɛnɛ na bogama na ngulu ko na bato ba binama bikatatake ko na bitumbɛ banɛnɛ bahelaka. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Iboa, mongandi moso modaa monɛnɛ ta ngando enɛnɛ emina. <verse eid="ACT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Enakoboa donga ehele moto omɔti adaaka ta ngando enɛnɛ emina kombe e nde Simona. Akɔɔkɔ bonganga ko akamodjaka bato ba Samalia. Asatukoaka moto monɛnɛ, <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />ko bato basusu, bobanga na bɛngɛ mbunoko basuku basapaka na nde. Babalaka bo: «Moto iyo adii na ngulu e Ndjakomba, iye ekabee bo “Ngulu enɛnɛ”.» <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Basapaka na nde, modjɔ mo donga ehele abakamodjaka na mikɔ mi nde mi bonganga. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Endelo ehole edhima bo Bwɛndi Bopele bobatɔndea Pilipo ta tina e Bokumu bo Ndjakomba ko na tina e Yesu Kilito, batomba batisimo na bali na baami. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Simona iyo pongono adhima ko atomba batisimo; adikamaka na Pilipo ko alumaka na bokamoa na boɛnɛ bimbete na midjɔ minɛnɛ mi bokamoa imia mikɔɔmɔkɔ.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Aoka bapɔsɔlu ibia badaaka ta Yelusalɛmɛ bo Samalia edhimi mobalo mo Ndjakomba, babalomea Petelo na Yoane. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Ehole eimea bo ta Samalia, baangɔnɔ tina e badhimi bɛngi badie Mwembo Mosɛnɔke. <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Abo, Mwembo Mosɛnɔke moipetaka tita nongo diko di moto omɔti o bobo; batomba batisimo oko ta kombe e Kumu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Iboa Petelo na Yoane ba babakea mɔmɔ, ko badia Mwembo Mosɛnɔke. <verse eid="ACT 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Ehole eɛnɛ Simona bo Mwembo mopaami ta ndelo ebabakea bapɔsɔlu mɔmɔ, abalwɛ palanga <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />ko abala bo: «Pani mbi pongono bopilo bomina, bɛngi bato ibia babakeabi mbi mɔmɔ babolodje Mwembo Mosɛnɔke.» <verse eid="ACT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Endelo Petelo amosombedja bo: «Kɛɛ agwɛ na wɛ na palanga dji wɛ, modjɔ mo olɛdji bo ikabo di Ndjakomba dibwani bosombama na palanga! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Obolodjiti nongo eka emɔti ta midjɔ imi minɔmɔkɔdea iya, modjɔ mo molema mo wɛ moditi bodju ta boso bo Ndjakomba. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Sandja malɛi imia ma wɛ mabe ko angɔnɔ Kumu, bɛngi ekabɔngɔ, akutubanedjadea malɛi ma molema masadiaka wɛ mabe. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Naɛni bo molema mo wɛ modii molumake na bobe ko odii mobuli o pekato.» <verse eid="ACT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Iboa Simona asɔmbedja bo: «Ino bɛnɛ angɔnɔni Kumu tina e mbi, bɛngi bo eka emɔti edae pɛpɛ bokɔɔmɔ na mbi.» <verse eid="ACT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Ngɔngɔ dji bobala tati ko na boleha mobalo mo Kumu, bapɔsɔlu bamina babae baso basɔmbɔ ta Yelusalɛmɛ. Ndjea ndjea, baleha Bwɛndi Bopele ta ngando djinɛnɛ dji Samalia.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pilipo na moto oowa ibo esendja o Etsiopia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Obwɛndi o Kumu abala na Pilipo: «Okɛdea ta pamba e satina, ta ndjea iyena etitakadea ta pamba e Yelusalɛmɛ ta Gadja. Ndjea emina iyena edii edhu.» <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Na mbala emɔti aso akɛɛ. Na ndjea moto omɔti amoimanea: adaaka moto o Etsiopia, mobanei o palanga ko na leka losusu lo Kandase<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kadase ediiti mɛnɛ kombe emoto, endelo edii kombe e ekumu apama na mokondji mwali o Etsiopia, mondumba mobeaka ibo Palo mokondji o Edjipito.</char></note>, mokondji mwali o Etsiopia; akɛkɛ ta Yelusalɛmɛ akumea Ndjakomba ko moto omina bamoowa esendja <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />ko ayanaka ta ndako e nde. Adaka na mobondo ta diko di ikalo inde, alangaka buku e motɛli Isaya. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Mwembo motɔndea Pilipo bo: «Salinda osongane na ikalo idi.» <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Pilipo asalindi na ebango ko aoka moto Etsiopia alangaka buku e motɛli Isaya. Amowadja bo: «Osipoakadea mɛko imia milangakadea wɛ?» <verse eid="ACT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Moto omina a amosɔmbedja bo: «Nabwani bosipoa midjɔ mimina ndenge nda moto amiti mitɔndeani?» Ko abea Pilipo aiwee ta ikalo bɛngi adae mbuti na nde. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Ikomi idia dilangaka iyo ibalaka bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">«Adaka ondingo bhata opalakadea bo balene dɔli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">ondingo mwana o bhata akadae pɛpɛ boyea boso bo moto iyona omohakadea ngungi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">Aidipoa nongo monɔkɔ.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Bamosambodjaka ko aidia molonga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Omina obwani bobala tina e batitani ba nde nda?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Modjɔ mo ta kpɔtɔ baimedja bomɔ bo nde ta suka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ mo 32-33: Isa 53, 7-8, ebeama ta buku eyou e gɛlɛki.</char></note>.»<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Moto o Etsiopia awadja Pilipo bo: «Naɔngɔnɔkɔdea, tondeani motɛli abalakadea iya tina e nda? Edii tina e nde iyo mɛnɛ kaoko tina e moto okina?» <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Iboa Pilipo atomba kɔpi oko ta Ikomi dimina amotɔndea Bwɛndi Bopele bo Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Iyana amaka bo kɛɛ baimea ta polo emɔti edaka na madiba. moto oyona oowa bo esendja abala bo: «Indja madiba, eka ndani edii bosia bo nadae pɛpɛ botomba batisimo?» <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />[Pilipo amotɔndea bo: «Okadhima na molema momɔti, obwani botomba batisimo.» Iyo asɔmbedja: «Nadhimi bo Yesu Kilito adii Mwana o Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ imu mo 37 modiiti ta mikanga mikina moyou.</char></note>.»] <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Ko aemea ikalo. Ibo basusu babae batitea ta madiba, Pilipo na moto oowa bo esendja, ko amobatisa. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Ndelo eduboa bo ta madiba Mwembo mo Kumu motomba Pilipo moto iyona aiɛnɛ Pilipo naikina akɛɛ mɔɔngɔ mo nde na mosepi mɛnɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Ta tina e Pilipo aɛnɛmɛ ta Adjote<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Adjote: edii ngando enɛnɛ eyou ekabee ibo Asidode e Bapilisitia (boindja 1Sa 5, 1-7).</char></note>, ko anɔɔ ta ngando djinɛnɛ alehe mɔɔngɔ masusu Bwɛndi Bopele mbunoko ehole eimea iyo ta Sedjale.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s1">Saulu ahombedji molema</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22, 6-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26, 12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Ta ehole emina iyena, Saulu, aikinaka boanedja ko na boowa batingami ba Kumu. Aso akɛɛ ta dii nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />ko amowodja mikanda mi bopa bato ba ndako e miɔngɔnɔ e Bayudha e Damasi, bɛngi akatanea bato, bali na baami, bakimanaka Ndjea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndjea emina edii wɛtoko einedjakadea bileho ko na mohelo ta edhimeli tina e Kumu Yesu. Boindja pongono ta 18, 25-26. 19: 9, 23. 22, 4. 24, 14, 22. 25, 3. 24, 14, 22. 25, 3. Boɛngɛ Isa 30, 21; Ndj 27, 11.</char></note>, abwani bobapea ko bokɛɛ na bu ta Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Ehole edaka iyo na ndjea, aimei mbuti na Damasi, mbala emɔti, bohu bomɔti bodonga ta busa, bo mokunda. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Akwa ta kpɔtɔ ko aoka kɔpi emɔti e motɔndeaka bo: Saulu, Saulu, tina enɔngedjakadeani na wɛ nda? <verse eid="ACT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Awadja bo: «Kumu wɛ nda?» Ko kɔpi emina esɔmbedja bo: «Mbi nadii Yesu iyona onɔngedjakadea wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Endelo angɔɔ, kwea ta ngando enɛnɛ, ko baotɔndeadea eka ndani ebwanadea wɛ bokɔ.» <verse eid="ACT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Bato badalaka na nde, baemaka na pɛ bobala nongo kɔpi emɔti; baoka moholi, endelo baiɛnɛkɛ nongo moto omɔti. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Saulu asangɔdjɔ ta kpɔtɔ ko adipoa miso, na nongo miso mande adaaka mo bwase, endelo ainɛkɛ. Bamopea ta ebɔ bɛngi bakɛe na nde ta Damasi. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Akɔɔ masu masato, pɛpɛ boɛnɛ ko aiyaka ko aimwaka madiba. <verse eid="ACT 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Motingami omɔti adaaka ta Damasi na kombe e Ananiasi. Kumu asaɛnɛmedja na nde na ndjɛnɛ ko abala na nde bo: «Ananiasi!» Asɔmbedja: «Kumu mbi iyo.» <verse eid="ACT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Kumu abala na nde bo: «Kɛɛ ta ndjea e Bodju, ko ta ndako e Yudhasi ko wadja moto o Talase na kombe e Saulu. Angɔnɔ ta ehole emina, <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />ko, na ndjea e ndjɛnɛ, aɛnɛ moto omɔti na kombe e Ananiasi akweaka ko abakeaka mɔmɔ ta diko di nde bɛngi aɛnɛ naikina.» <verse eid="ACT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Ananiasi asɔmbedja bo: «Kumu, naoki bato banɛnɛ babali na mbi tina e moto omina ko batɔndeini midjɔ mibe misusu mikɔi iyo badhimi ba wɛ ta Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Ko adoi iya na bokondji bomopi banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ tina e bopea bato basusu babeakadea ta kombe e wɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Endelo Kumu amotɔndea bo: «Kɛɛ, modjɔ mo nahɔi moto iyona adae esaeli e mbi bɛngi adjebedje kombe e mbi ta bikomi bikina ko ta dii bakondji, ko na bana ba Isalɛlɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Namoinedjadea mbi mɛnɛ mondumba motungi na nde boɛnɛ saya tina e kombe e mbi.» <verse eid="ACT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Iboa Ananiasi aso akɛɛ. Akwea ta ndako, abakea mɔmɔ ta diko di Saulu ko amotɔndea bo: «Saulo, mwange mbi, Kumu Yesu osaoimanea na ndjea asadoaka wɛ alomini bɛngi osɔmbe boɛnɛ naikina ko bɛngi olume na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke.» <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Na mbala emɔti, leka lomɔti ondingo poso dji swi loimana ta miso ma Saulu, ko aso aɛnɛ naikina. Aema diko ko atomba batisimo; <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />ko, ayaka, abolodja mogadjo.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 9:19">Saulu alehi ta Damasi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Saulu adaaka baa masu na batingami ibia badaaka ta Damasi. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Na mbala emɔti abangaka boleha ta ndako dji miɔngɔnɔ dji Bayudha, na botɔndea bo Yesu adii Mwana o Ndjakomba. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Bato basusu ibia bamohokamedjaka bakamoaka ko bawadjaka bo: «Iyo te moto onɔngedjaka na ngulu mɛnɛ bato ibia bakabee kombe e Yesu ta Yelusalɛmɛ? Ko asadoa iyo iya bɛngi abapee ko akɛe na bu ta dii banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ?» <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Endelo Saulu alehaka oko na ingbangba: ehole ebainedjaka iyo bo Yesu adii Masiya, Bayudha ibia badikamaka ta Damasi baidiaka eka e bosɔmbedja. <verse eid="ACT 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Ngɔngɔ dji moo ehole, Bayudha batomba meko e boowa Saulu, <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />endelo Saulu asipoa kopolo e bobo. Bulu na moi basɛndjɛlɛ midipe mi ngando enɛnɛ, bɛngi bamoowoe. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Iboa batingami ba Saulu bamoisa ta itunga na bulu bamopendedja ta dɔɔngɔ dikina di ekuka e ngando enɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ mo 23-25: boɛngɛ 2Ko 11:32-33.</char></note>.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saulu ta Yelusalɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Aimea Saulu ta Yelusalɛmɛ, ahomba mwɛngi mo boputoana na batingami; endelo ibo basusu babangaka, modjɔ mo baidhimaka bo aimea motingami. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Iboa Balanabasi amotomba ko akɛɛ na nde ta dii bapɔsɔlu. Abatubana mondumba moɛnɛ Saulu Kumu na ndjea iyona omobalea. Abatubana pongono na swuiya bo Saulu alehaka na kombe e Yesu ta Damasi. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Banga ehole iyena, Saulu akatana na bu, baetetanaka ta Yelusalɛmɛ ko alehaka na swueya na kombe e Kumu. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Abalaka ko babomanaka kitɛ pongono na Bayudha ba monɔkɔ mo Gɛlɛki; endelo ibo bahombaka mwɛngi e bomoowa. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Ehole eoka denga modjɔ momina, bakɛɛ na Saulu ta Sedjale, iho baso bamoloma ta Talase. <verse eid="ACT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Iboa Ekelesa, edaka na bogo ta Yudhea esusu, ta Galileya ko na ta Samalia; epingaka ko edaka na isuma ta dii Kumu, ekandoaka na ngulu e Mwembo Mosɛnɔke.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ene aheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Petelo, moto opukanaka ta ekomi esusu, busa bomɔti akɛɛ ta dii baasɛnɔke bahelamaka ta Lida. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Atanea iho moto omɔti na kombe ende Ene, odaaka asambi ta esambe tomba bianga bomwambe, modjɔ mo adaaka na binama bikatatake. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Petelo amotɔndea bo: «Ene, Yesu Kilito aoheledji ehele! Angɔ ko buluka esambe e wɛ.» Na mbala emɔti, Ene asangɔdjɔ. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Bato basusu ba Lida ko na ibia ba mbuti na esika ebatatake e Salɔni bamoɛnɛ ko baso badhimea Kumu.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bosisoa bo Dolokasi ta bogwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Edaka na motingami mwali omɔti ta Yope kombe e nde Tabita. Kombe emina ta kɔpi e gɛlɛki etingodjakadea «Dolokasi», epalakadea bobala «ndjumba». Akɔɔkɔ seko bopele ko akɔmedjaka bakwali. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Oko ta masu imia, akwa na epeko ko aso agwa. Ngɔngɔ dji bososa mokuku mo nde, bamosambea ta ekenge emɔti e ndako e diko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ekenge e ndako… Ndako: boindja ta 1:13 kona nase.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Iyana aoka batingami bo Petelo adii ta Lida edaka mbuti na Yope<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tomba Lida mbunoko Yope edii mbuti na kilomɛtɛlɛ 20. </char></note>. Bamolomea bato babae amoangɔnɔ bo: «Pɛpɛ boyeyoako doa ta dii iso.» <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Petelo aangɔ ko akɛɛ na bu engbanga emɔti. Ehole eimea bo bakɛɛ na nde ta ekenge e ndako e diko. Bali basusu bagwa na baami baso badoa ta dii iyo ayee; bamoinedja simisi na mikoto mitonga Dolokasi ehole edaka iyo mɔsu. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Petelo aimedja bato basusu sokolu, adaa magbunda ko aangɔnɔ. Ko ahombana ta pamba edaka ebembe ko abala bo: «Tabita, angɔ!» Adipoa miso, ko aso aɛnɛ Petelo, adaa na mobondo. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Petelo amopea ta ebɔ ko aso amoangɔdjɔ. Ngɔngɔ djimina abea badhimi na bali ba bogwa, ko abamoinedja na bomɔ. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Modjɔ momina modjebama ta Yope mosusu ko bato banɛnɛ badhimea Kumu. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Petelo akɔɔ masu manɛnɛ ta Yope, ta ndako e moto omɔti kombe ende Simona iyo odaaka mobɔngedji o yobo dji tito.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Petelo abeami ta dii Kɔnɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Edaka na moto omɔti ta Sedjale kombe e nde Kɔnɛlɛ, adaaka kapita o basodha mokama ta etuluku e basodha ba Loma ebeamaka «etuluku e Itali». <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Kɔnɛlɛ na ibota di nde, basapaka ko basumaka Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ ta Mat 23, 15</char></note>. Apaka mabondja ma ndjokwa ta dii bakwali ba Bayudha ko aɔngɔnɔkɔ Ndjakomba ehole esusu. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Ta ngonga e basato e ngɔngɔ dji midi, aɛnɛ ndjɛnɛ: aɛnɛ obwɛndi omɔti o Ndjakomba na bohu mɛnɛ bokwea ta ndako e nde ko amotɔndea bo: «Kɔnɛlɛ!» <verse eid="ACT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Akokoledja obwɛndi na mongongoma ko amowadja bo: «Modjɔ ndani Kumu?» Andjelu amosɔmbedja bo: «Ndjakomba aoki miɔngɔnɔ mi wɛ ko na leka lokapɛ wɛ bakwali, ko alɛni. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Edɛdiyeye, loma bato ta Yope bɛngi babee Simona iyo okabeebo na kombe e Petelo. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Adikamakadea ta ndako e mosali omɔti okabɔngedje yobo dji tito kombe e nde Simona, ndako e nde edii mbuti na dua enɛnɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Ehole ekɛɛ obwɛndi iyona obalaka na nde, Kɔnɛlɛ abea bato babae ta tei e basali ba nde ko na soda omɔti osapaka na Ndjakomba ta tei e basodha ibia baisaka iyo molema. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Abatubana midjɔ misusu imi minɔkɔ ko aso abaloma ta Yope. <verse eid="ACT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Ngɔngɔ dji busa bomɔti ta ehole edaka bo bakɛkɛdea adale na ndjea ko baimeaka mbuti na Yope, Petelo aiwea ta mbalasani etonga bo diko di ndako, ta ehole e midi bɛngi angɔne. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Aoka ndja ko apalaka ayake. Ta ehole e mokaleeaka bo mia, akwa na Mwembo. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Aɛnɛ busa bodipoami ko eka emɔti ekɛkɛdea atite: ondingo esendja emɔti enɛnɛ epeamake ta mikpɛngɔ minɛi, etitaka ta kpɔtɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Ko ta otei edaka na mindumba misusu mi tito ba mako manɛi ba kpɔtɔ, tito bakasakpakule na sɔpɔ, ko na mbulu ba diko. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Kɔpi emɔti ebala na nde bo: «Petelo angɔ, owa ko yaka!» <verse eid="ACT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Endelo Petelo asɔmbedja bo: «Oo ngasa! Kumu, modjɔ mo napakina yaka eka e pita kaoko e ekiya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta Lew 11, 1-47; Edk4, 14.</char></note>.» <verse eid="ACT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Kɔpi emɔti ebala naikina na nde bo: «Eka esɛnodji Ndjakomba pɛpɛ boɛnɛko eka e pita<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Mal 7, 15, 19.</char></note>.» <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Modjɔ momina mokɔmɔ mbala djisato, ngɔngɔ djimina eka emina esɔmbɔ boiwea ta busa. <verse eid="ACT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Petelo asayekeaka bobuke mɛnɛ eka ebwanaka ndjɛnɛ emina botingodja. Enakoboa ta ehole emine yena, baami baloma Kɔnɛlɛ bawadjaka bɛngi badjebe ndako e Simona ko baso baimeaka ta modipe. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Babeya ko bawadja bo: «Simona iyo okabeebo Petelo adikamakadea iyo iya?» <verse eid="ACT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Ehole edaka Petelo oko alɛnɛ ndjɛnɛ eɛnɛ iyo, Mwembo mobala na nde bo: «Hokamedja baami basato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baami basato: ta mikanda mikina midii oto na bato ko mokina modii na baami babae. </char></note> badii iya baohombakadea. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Ema, tita ko kɛɛ na bu na pɛpɛ bokakoana, modjɔ mo edii mbi moto obalomi.» <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Iboa Petelo atita ko abawadja bo: «Nadii moto iyona ohombakadea ino. Edoi ino akɔɔ nde?» <verse eid="ACT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Basɔmbedja bo: «Kɔnɛlɛ kapita o basodha mokama moto ololomi. Adii moto o bodju, ko akasume Ndjakomba ko ekomi e Bayudha basusu bakabale tati epele tina e nde. Obwɛndi mosɛnɔke o Ndjakomba abali na nde okɛe ta dii iyo bɛngi aoke eka edii na wɛ tina e bomobalea.» <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Petelo abakwedja ko abadedja ta ndako modjɔ mo edaka bulu. Aya busa, akɛɛ engbangba na bu. Ndambo ekina e denga di Yope bamopakea. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Busa ibua bokina, aimea ta Sedjale. Kɔnɛlɛ na bana ba nango ko na badjebani ba nde ba beaka iyo babambaka ena. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Ta ehole eimea Petelo, Kɔnɛlɛ akɛɛ asongane na nde, ko aso akwa magbunda ta mako ma nde bɛngi amopɛ ndese e ekumu. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Endelo Petelo amoangɔdjɔ abala na nde bo: «Angɔ, modjɔ mo mbi pongono nadii oko moto.» <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Ko, adaaka asolana na Kɔnɛlɛ, akwea ta ndako ko atanea bato banɛnɛ baboli. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Abatɔndea bo: «Odjebakadeani bo Moyuda abwaniti bodaa polo emɔti na mokɛndɛli kaoko bokwea ta ndako e nde. Endelo Ndjakomba ainedjini bo nakine bobala bo moto mondumba imu adii na pita kaoko nabwaniti bodaa na nde. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Na tina emina, ehole ebeini ino, nakakoaniti. Endelo edɛdiyeye napalakadea nadjebe tina ebeini na nu.» <verse eid="ACT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Kɔnɛlɛ asɔmbedja bo: «Enɔi edɛdiyeye masu masoto, ta ngonga e basato ta ngɔngɔ dji midi, naangɔnɔkɔbi ta dii mbi. Na mbala emɔti moto omɔti aemai boso bo mbi alwali bisendja bingɛsɛke <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />ko atɔndeani bo: “Kɔnɛlɛ, Ndjakomba aoki miɔngɔnɔ mi wɛ ko alɛni ekamoli ekɔɔ wɛ ta dii bakwali. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Iboa loma bato ta Yope abea Simona iyo okabee ibo Petelo. Adikamakadea ta ndako e moto omɔti okabɔngedje yobo dji tito akadae ta mbuti na dua enɛnɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Oko ta ehole emina iyena nalomi bato aohomba ko wɛ oso apali bodoa. Iboa edɛdiyeye iso basusu lodii boso bo Ndjakomba bɛngi looke mɛko misusu miopi Kumu obale.»<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mibalo mi Petelo ta dii Kɔnɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Iboa Petelo atomba kɔpi aso abala bo: «Sooti mɛnɛ edɛdiyeye nasipoi bo Ndjakomba ta hɔe maso ma bato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Dit 10, 17.</char></note>: <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Endelo ta ekomi esusu, moto okamosume ko okakɔe midjɔ mi bodju, akamodhimee. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Aloma mobalo mo nde ta dii bana ba Isalɛlɛ, imua mo dii Bwɛndi Bopele bo bomwi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ ta Isa 52, 7.</char></note> na Yesu Kilito iyona odii Kumu o bato basusu. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Odjebakadeani modjɔ monɔɔmɔ ta Galileya, ko ta Yudhea esusu, ngɔngɔ djimina Yoane alehaka ko abatisaka. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Odjebakadeani mondumba mosopea Ndjakomba ngulu e Mwembo Mosɛnɔke ta diko di Yesu o Nadjalɛtɛ. Bisika bisusu binɔɔ iyo akɔɔkɔ bopele ko na boheledja bato ibia basusu badaaka ta tei e bokondji bo djabulu, modjɔ mo Ndjakomba adaaka na nde. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Ko iso lodii ba temo ba midjɔ misusu mikɔɔ iyo ta ekomi e Bayudha ko na ta Yelusalɛmɛ. Bamoowa na bomobaka ta ekulusu. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Endelo Ndjakomba amosɔmbedja ta bomɔ ngɔngɔ dji masu masato; amopa ngulu e bosaɛnɛmedja naikina, <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />te ta dii bato basusu, endelo ta dii iso ibia bahɔɔ Ndjakomba ehele ondingo batemo. Loyaka ko lomwaka na nde ngɔngɔ dji bomoangɔdjɔ ta tei e bato bago<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 1, 4; Luka 24, 30, 42.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Aloloma lolehe bato ko loinedje bo adii iyona ohɔɔ Ndjakomba bɛngi asambedje bato ba bomɔ na bago. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Batɛli basusu babalaka tati tina e nde bo, moto obwani bomodhimea adiabi ekutubanedji e pekato dji nde ta kombe e nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Isa 53, 5-6; Yil 31, 34.</char></note>.»<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bato ba bikomi babolodji Mwembo Mosɛnɔke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Ehole ebalaka Petelo naikina, Mwembo Mosɛnɔke motita ta diko di bato basusu baokaka mobalo mo nde. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Badhimi basusu ba ekomi e Bayudha ibia badoa na Petelo baluma na bokamoa aɛnɛ ibo ikabo di Mwembo Mosɛnɔke botitea pongono bato ibia badaaka pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Modjɔ mo, babaokaka babala na kɔpi dji tongono ko na bokumedja bonɛnɛ bo Ndjakomba. Iboa Petelo abawadja bo: <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />«Esiami bonie bato ibi batombe batisimo ba madiba, iya asadia ibo Mwembo Mosɛnɔke odingo iso?» <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Ko aloma batombe batisimo ta kombe e Yesu Kilito. Iboa bamowadja adikama baa masu iyana na bu.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s1">Lisolo ditubana Petelo ta Ekelesa e Yelusalɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Bapɔsɔlu ko denga didaka ta Yudhea baoka bo bato ibia badaaka pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha baasɔkɔ pongono mobalo mo Ndjakomba. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Ehole eyana Petelo ta Yelusalɛmɛ, badhimi ba ekomi e Yudhea bamokotoaka. <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />Babala bo: «Wɛ okwei ta dii bato badii pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha ko oyaki na bu!» <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Iboa Petelo abatubana midjɔ misusu minɔmɔkɔ. Abala na bu bo: <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />«Nadaki ta ngando enɛnɛ e Yope ko ehole eangɔnɔki mbi, naɛni djɛnɛ ndelo ekwaki mbi na Mwembo. Naɛni eka emɔti etiteakini: ondingo esendja emɔti enɛnɛ, epelami ta mikpɛngɔ mi yu minɛi, etitaka ta busa ko edoaki mbuti na mbi. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Nakokoledja ta o tei ko naɛnɛki tito ba mako manɛi ba kpɔtɔ, tito ba esika, tito bakasakpakule na sɔpɔ ko na mbulu ba diko. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Iboa naoka kɔpi emɔti ebalaka na mbi bo: “Petelo, angɔ, owa ko yaka!” <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Endelo nasɔmbedja bo: “Ngasa Kumu, modjɔ mo eka emɔti e ekia kaoko e pita epakina kwea ta monɔkɔ mo mbi.” <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Kɔpi edonga naikina ta busa ko abala bo: “Eka ebali Ndjakomba bo edii esɛnɔke pɛpɛ boɛnɛ oko bo edii eka e pita.” <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Modjɔ momina mokɔmɔkɔ mbala djisato, ko moso mosɔmbɔ ta busa. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Enakoboa, oko ta ehole emina, baami basato baimea ta ndako iyena edaka mbi: balomamaka ta dii mbi badongaka ta Sedjale. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Mwembo Mosɛnɔke mobala na mbi nakɛe na bu na pɛpɛ bokakoana. denga basamano ba Ekelesa ibibi baɛnɛkɛdea ino bapakeakini ta Sedjale ko iso basusu lokweaki ta ndako e Kɔnɛlɛ. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Moto iyo alotɔndea mondumba moɛnɛkɛ iyo obwɛndi ta ndako e nde ko abala na nde bo: “ Loma bato ta Yope bɛngi babee Simona iyona okabee bo Petelo. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Aotɔndɔdea mibalo imia mioheledjadea wɛ na bato ba wɛ basusu.” <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Ehole edaki mbi nabala, Mwembo Mosɛnɔke motita ta tei e bobo, oko mondumba motita mo ta dii iso ta mbangi. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Iboa nalɛnɛki eka ebala Kumu bo: “Yoane abatisaka na madiba, endelo ino obatisadeani na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 1, 5.</char></note>.” <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Eka daa Ndjakomba abapi ikabo oko modumba mopa iyo iso ehole edhimea iso Kumu Yesu Kilito: mbi nadaaki nda bɛngi nasie Ndjakomba?» <verse eid="ACT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Ngɔngɔ dji booka modjɔ momina, ibo basusu bapɔpɔnɔ ko bakumedja Ndjakomba babala bo: «Adii mɛnɛ Ndjakomba o sooti, api pongono ibia badii pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha enɔli e bosɔmbɔtɔnɔ mida ko na bodia bomɔ bo sooti.»<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekelesa e Atiosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Minɔngɔ miimana ta ehole egwa Etsiɛni miloma badhimi banangane. Bakina ta tei e bobo bakɛɛ tee mbunoko ta Penisi, ta Sipele ko na ta Atiosi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Minɔngɔ: Boindja ta 8, 1-4. Atiosi: edii Ngando enɛnɛ ko edikamaka gupɛlɛnɛlɛ ta ekenge e mokili mo Sili, edaka na bato banɛnɛ.</char></note>, endelo balehaka mobalo mo Ndjakomba oko ta dii Bayudha. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Enakoboa, badhimi bakina ba Sipele ko na ba Silɛne, baimea ta Atiosi, ko batɔndeaka pongono Bwɛndi Bopele bo Kumu Yesu ta dii bato ibia bakabale monɔkɔ mo Gɛlɛke. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Ngulu e Kumu edaka na bu, ko bato banɛnɛ baimea badhimi ko baso bahombana ta dii Kumu. <verse eid="ACT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Denga di Ekelesa e Yelusalɛmɛ baoka gala emina. Iboa baso baloma Balanabasi ta Atiosi. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Ndelo eimea iyo iho aɛnɛ ngɔlu e Ndjakomba ta dii badhimi, asepa ko abapingedja ibo basusu basalee Kumu na molema momɔti. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Modjɔ mo Balanabasi adaaka moto mopele, aluma na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke ko na edhimeli. Emumu e bato esapaka ta dii Kumu. <verse eid="ACT 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Ngɔngɔ djimina Balanabasi akɛɛ ta Talase ahomba Saulu. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Iyana amoɛnɛ iyo, akɛɛ na nde ta Atiosi. Bakɔɔ yanga esusu ta Ekelesa emina ko baleha bato banɛnɛ. Edaka mbala e mbangi ta Atiosi, bɛngi batingami babeame na kombe e bakilito. <verse eid="ACT 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Ta ehole emine iyena, batɛli badonga ta Yelusalɛmɛ ko batita ta Atiosi. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Omɔti ta tei e bobo, kombe e nde Agabusi, alomama na Mwembo, abanga botɔndea bo edadea na ndja emɔti enɛnɛ ta ngondo mobimba. Modjɔ momina mokɔmɔ ta ehole edaka Kolode<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Agabusi: Boindja ta 21, 10. Kolode mokondji monɛnɛ o batano o Loma, odaaka ta bokondji ta tei e yanga e 41 ko na 54 ngɔngɔ dji Yesu Kilito. Mikanda mi ehole iyena mibwani boinedja ndja emɔti enɛnɛ ta makono matikoanake ma bokondji bo Loma ta tei yanga e 46 ko na 48 ngɔngɔ dji Yesu Kilito.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Iboa batingami batomba meko bo engi moto apadea eka ebwani na nde bodia bɛngi balome ekamoli ta dii denga di ehelamaka ta Yudhea. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Ekomɔ oko iboa ko baloma bikamoli dji bobo ta dii basuku ba Ekelesa na ndjea e Balanabasi na Saulu.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Baoowoi Djake ko Petelo ta bɔlɔkɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Ta ehole emina iyena, mokondji Elode<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edii Wɛtoko Elode Agilipa 1, mwana moomi o mwange Elode Atipasi; akondja Yudhea mosusu bobanga ta yanga e 41.</char></note> abanga bonɔngedja ndambo e badhimi ba Ekelesa. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Aowedja Djake, o mwange Yoane na mɔmbi. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, ehole eɛnɛ iyo modjɔ mo mina mosepedja Bayudha, apedja pongono Petelo ta ehole e tɛkɛ e mapa ma pɛpɛ levile<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta Boi 12, 1-27.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Elode amopedja ko adumbama ta bɔlɔkɔ, ko apa maputo manɛi ma basodha banɛi banɛi ba mosɛndjɛle. Apalaka bomosambedja ta miso ma bato ngɔngɔ dji tɛkɛ e Pasika. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Ehole edaka Petelo ta bɔlɔkɔ, bato ba Ekelesa baangɔnɔkɔ Ndjakomba na bhingi tina e nde.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo atingoami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Iboa na bulu, Elode apalaka amosambedje ta miso ma bato, Petelo awɛɛkɛ ta ndanda e basodha babae. Anangamaka na mikpulu mi bibende mibae ko basindjili badaa ta esika e bobo ta modipe mo bɔlɔkɔ. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Na mbala emɔti, obwɛndi omɔti o Kumu aimana ko bɔlɔkɔ bongɛsɛ na bohu. Andjelu abɛndjɛ Petelo ta itɛbu, amosisodja ko abala na nde bo: «Angɔ pɛpɛlɛ!» Iboa mikpulu mi bibende misusu mitsueana na nde ta mɔmɔ. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Ko obwɛndi amotondea: «Lwoa kamba e wɛ ko nanga sapato dji wɛ.» Petelo amosuma ko anjelu abala naikina bo: «Lwoa mokoto e wɛ ko kimanani.» <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Petelo aimana ta bɔlɔkɔ ko amokimana. Aidjebaka bo eka ekɔkɔ obwɛndi edaka sooti: alɛnɛkɛ bo edii ndjɛnɛ. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Banɔɔ sindjili o boso, o babae ko baimea ta modipe mo bibende mo boimana ta ngando enɛnɛ. Modipe momina modipoama imo mɛnɛ boso bo bobo ko baso baimana. Ehole eimea bo na ndjea na mbala emɔti, obwɛndi aso akina Petelo. <verse eid="ACT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Iboa ehole ehuleana mayɛlɛ ma Petelo abala bo: «Edɛdiyeye, naɛni bo edii sooti bo: Kumu alomi obwɛndi o nde, ko atingoini ta mɔmɔ ma Elode ko na bobe bosusu bolɛnɛki Bayudha bokɔni.» <verse eid="ACT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Ehole esipoa iyo modjɔ momina, akɛɛ ta ndako e Malia, nange Yoane okabee bo Malako. Bato banɛnɛ baputoanaka iyana tina e boangɔnɔ. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Petelo aboma ta modipe mo ndako ko mosali mwali, na kombe e Lode, asabatea bɛngi ahokamedje. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Adjeba moholi mo Petelo, ta polo e bo adipoe modipe, apota na sepi o tei atɔndea bo Petelo adii sokolu. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Babala na nde bo: «Odii na igboma!» Endelo apingedja na bobala bo edii sooti. Iboa baso babala bo: «Edii obwɛndi o nde.» <verse eid="ACT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Enakoboa, Petelo adaaka oko aboma modipe. Ehole edipoa bo modipe, bamoɛnɛ ko baso bakamoa mɛnɛ. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Abakɔmea embete na ebɔɔ bɛngi bapɔpɔne ko abatubana mondumba momoiwa Kumu ta bɔlɔkɔ. Abala naikina bo: «Djebedjani Djake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Djake: edii wɛtoko Djake mwange Kumu.</char></note> modjɔ momina ko na denga dikina.» Ngɔngɔ djimina aimana ko akɛɛ doongɔ dikina. <verse eid="ACT 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Iyana aya busa, mongangale moso mokwa ta dii basodha: basawadjanaka polo ndani enɔi Petelo. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Elode aloma bamohombe, endelo baimobolodja. Asambedja basindjili ko apa simbisi e bobaowa. Ngɔngɔ djimina, ekɛɛ ta Yudhea ta Sedjale ta polo edikamaka iyo masu makina.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yogo e Elode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Elode alemoa na bato ba Tile na Sidona. Bato bamina batomba meko e baloma bato babwani bokɛɛ asɛngɛɛ bogo ta dii iyo. Modjɔ mo ekomi e bobo ehelamaka na mia ma ekomi e nde; baso baokana na Balasitisi iyo odaaka modaledji o misala ta ndako e mokondji. <verse eid="ACT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Aimea busa bookanaka ibo, Elode alwa esendja e nde e bokondji, adaa ta kiti e nde ekataka iyo makambo ko abala na bu ta miso ma bato. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Bato bagama bo: «Edii kɔpi e Ndjakomba iye ebalakadea ediiti kɔpi e moto<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Edjek 28, 2.</char></note>!» <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Endelo, oko ta ehole emine iyena, obwɛndi o Kumu aboma Elode, modjɔ mo asasisa ta polo e Ndjakomba: ngusu bamonɛlɛkɛkɛ ko aso agwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Dan 5, 20.</char></note>.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Enakoboa mobalo mo Ndjakomba monanganaka ko mokweanaka mɔɔngɔ masusu. <verse eid="ACT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Ehole esidja Balanabasi na Saulu bopa ekamoli ta dii basuku ba Yelusalɛmɛ, badonga iho<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 11, 30.</char></note> ko baso batomba Yoane okombedjake Malako.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s1">Balanabasi na Saulu bahɔɔmi bɛngi bakɛe ta elomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Ta Ekelesa e Atsiosi, edaka na batɛli ko na bato ibia badaaka ena tina e boleha: Balanabasi, Simeona iyona obeakabo Moto mohindo, Lusiusi o Silɛne, Manaɛni iyona okandoaka polo emɔti na Elode<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edii wɛtoko Elode Atipasi (boindja ta Luka 3:1).</char></note>, odaledjaka Galileya, ko na Saulu. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Busa bomɔti badaaka banɔdjɔ ilako di Kumu ko bakiaka boyaka, Mwembo Mosɛnɔke mobala na bu bo: «Kineanini Balanabasi na Saulu bɛngi bakɔe mosala imu mobabeaki na mbi.» <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Iboa, ngɔngɔ dji bokia boyaka ko na boangɔnɔ, babakea mɔmɔ diko di bobo ko babakina bakɛe.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Balanabasi na Saulu ta Sipele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Abo Balanabasi na Saulu balomama na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke, baimea ta Selisi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Selesi edaka ibongu di Atiosi idaka diyɛlɛmɛni na esanga e Sipele.</char></note> iho bakwea ta masuwa bɛngi bakɛe ta esanga e Sipele. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Ehole eimea ibo ta Salamine, babanga boleha kɔpi e Ndjakomba ta ndako djimiɔngɔnɔ dji Bayudha. Badaaka na Yoane Malako bɛngi abakɔmedjake. <verse eid="ACT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Ngɔngɔ dji bobo bodala esanga esusu mbunoko ta Paposi. Iho, basaka na moyudha omɔti nganga o male asaimedjaka motɛli, kombe e nde Bali-Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Adikamaka ta dii gupɛlɛnɛlɛ o esanga kombe e nde Sɛlɛdjiusi Paulusi, iyo adaaka moto omɔti o bowɛi. Iyo aso abea Balanabasi na Saulu, modjɔ mo adaaka na posa e booka mobalo mo Ndjakomba. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Endelo nganga o male Elimasi, kombe emina etingodji bo: nganga; aisanaka na bu kitɛ ko ahombaka mwɛngi mo bobedja edhimeli e gupɛlɛnɛlɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Iboa Saulu, iyona obeamaka Polo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kombe Saulu ebeamaka wɛtoko ta dii Bayudha, ko tadii ba Loma abeamaka na Polo (boindja ta 22:27-29).</char></note>, aluma na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke, amotingea miso <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />ko abala bo: «Moto oluma na boyɛi bobe ko na bokuta, mwana o djabulu, moloni o mɛko misusu mi bodju! Otakina bobedja ndjea dji bodju dji Kumu? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Edɛdiyeye hokamedja: Kumu aopadea etumbu, oimedea moto o miso mago ko otaɛnɛdea modaakabusa naikina.» Na mbala emɔti, miso ma Elimasi modimea ko aɛnɛ modidi: abangaka ahombe moto obwanaka bomopea ta ebɔ bɛngi amodaledje. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Ehole eɛnɛ gupɛlɛnɛlɛ midjɔ imia minɔmɔkɔ, aimea modhimi; akamoaka bobuke mɛnɛ na bileho bi Kumu.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Polo na Balanabasi ta Atiosi e Pisidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Polo na binande bakwea ta masuwa bakɛɛ ta Paposi ko bakɛi ta Pɛlɛdje<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pɛlɛdje: edii ngando enɛnɛ ta mokula mo satina dji Adjia o Mokɛkɛ. Yoane Malako: bondja ta 12:12, 25; 13:5.</char></note> e Papili. Yoane Malako abakina iho ko asɔmbɔ ta Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Bakɛɛ mɔɔngɔ mo bobo bakina Pɛlɛdje ko baimea ta Atiosi e Pisidi. Ta busa bo sabata bakwea ta ndako e miɔngɔnɔ e Bayudha ko baso badaa na mobondo. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Ngɔngɔ dji bolanga mikanda mi mibeko ko na mi batɛli, babanei ba ndako e miɔngɔnɔ babala na bu bo: «Dengani, okadaani na kɔpi e bobala na bato ta tina e bobapindeja, obwanini bobalani edɛdiyeye.» <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Polo aangɔ akɔɔ embete na ebɔ ko abala bo: «Bana ba Isalɛlɛ, ko ino ibia bakasume Ndjakomba, hokamaedjanini! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Ndjakomba o Isalɛlɛ ahɔɔ bakɔkɔ ba biso. Anɛngedja bato ba biso ehole edaka bo ta ekomi e buki, ta Edjipito, ko na ngulu e nde abaimedja ta ekomi emina. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Aika molema mo nde tina e bobo bokimana bianga tuku inɛi ta edhu. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, abedja bikomi sambo ta Kanana ko aso apa mokpɔtɔ mo bobo ta dii bato ba nde bamosangoe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta Dit 7:1; Yos 14:1.</char></note>, <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />ko masu masusu mamina makɔɔ bianga bokimana mikama mi nɛi na tuku itano.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">«Ngɔngɔ djimina, abapa ba djudji tee mbunoko ta ehole e motɛli Samwɛlɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta Djud 2:16 ko na nase. Samwɛlɛ: boindja 1 Sam 3:20.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Ko naikina bawadja mokondji ko Ndjakomba aso abapa Saulu, mwana moomi o Kisi, ta ibota di Bendjame, iyona okokedja bianga tuku inɛi. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Ngɔngɔ dji Ndjakomba bolona Saulu, aimedja Dhapiti ondingo mokondji o bobo. Abala tati ta tina e nde bo: “Nahɔi Dhapiti, mwana o Yese: nasepi na nde bobuke mɛnɛ, akokedjadea midjɔ misusu mipalakadea mbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ mo21-22: 1 Sam 8:5, 19; 10:21; 13:14; 16:12. Boɛngɛ Ndjem 89:21.</char></note>.” <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Yesu adii omɔti o batitani ba nde iyona ohɔɔ Ndjakomba ondingo Moheledji o bana ba Isalɛlɛ, oko mondumba momaka iyo dikana. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Boso bo bodoa bo Yesu, Yoane alehaka tadii bana ba Isalɛlɛ basusu bahombedje mida ko botamba batisimo. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Ta ehole ameaka Yoane ta suka e mosala mo nde, abalaka bo: “Okalɛdjeni bo mbi nadii nda? Nadiiti moto iyona oambakadea ino. Endelo hokamedjani: adoadea ngɔngɔ dji mbi ko nabwaniti nongo bolodja mikpulu mi sapato dji nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta Yoane 1:20; Mat 3:11; Malako 1:7; Luka 3:16; Yoane 1:27.</char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />«Baningani, ino batitani ba Abalayama ko ino bakina ibia bakasume Ndjakomba: kɔpi iyeye elomami wɛtoko ta dii iso bɛngi lohele. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Modjɔ mo, bato ba Yelusalɛmɛ ko na babanei ba bobo baidjeba Yesu, ko baisipoa mibalo mi batɛli milangamaka engi sabata. Endelo bakokedja mibalo mimina na bomotitedja na ikambo. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Na nongo adaa ibo pɛpɛ bodia modjɔ mo bomotitedja ta yogo, bawadja Pilato amoowoe. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Ngɔngɔ dji bokokedjama bo midjɔ misusu mibalama ta Makomi tina e nde, bamotitedja ta ekulusu ko bamoisa ta ikila<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ mo 28-29: boindja ta Mat 27:22-23, 57-61; Malako 15:13-14, 42-47; Luka 23:21-23, 50-56; Yoane 19:15, 38, 42.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Endelo Ndjakomba amosisodja ta tei e bato bago. <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />Masu manɛnɛ, Yesu aimaneaka ibia baiweaka na nde ta Galileya ko ta Yelusalɛmɛ ko ibia badii edɛdiyeye ba temo ba nde boso bo bana ba Isalɛlɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 1:3.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Ko iso, loolwɛini Bwɛndi Bopele ibubu: bodikana Ndajakomba ta dii bakɔkɔ ba biso, <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />edɛdiyeye Ndjakomba akokedja modjɔ momina tina e biso batitani ba bobo, na bosisodja Yesu ta yogo. Modjɔ mo ekomama ta tei e buku e Ndjembo ekenge enɛnɛ e babae bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">“Wɛ moto odii Mwana o mbi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">banga busa ibu, nadii Sange e wɛ.”<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Ndjakomba atɔndɔkɔ bo amoangɔdjɔbi ta tei e bato bago bɛngi adae pɛpɛ bopɔɔ naikina. Ta tina emina abalaka bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">“Naopabi midjongoa misɛnɔke ko na mi sooti imia midikanedja mbi Dhapiti.”<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Ta tina emina abalakadea ta ikomi dikina bo: “Otakinadea Mosɛnɔke owɛ apɔe ta ikila<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ mo 33: Ndjem 2:7. Molɔngɔ mo34: Isa 55:3, elangama ta mokanda moyou mo monɔkɔ mo gɛlɛki. Molɔngɔ mo 35: Ndjem 16:10</char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Enakoboa, ta ehole e nde Dhapiti akɔɔ bopala bo Ndjakomba; ko agwa, ko apuseama mbuti na bakɔkɔ ba nde ko aso apɔɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta 1 Bak 2:10.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Endelo iyona osisodja Ndjakomba ta bogwa aipɔ. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Baningani, etungi odjebeni bo: odiakadeani ekutubanedji e pekato wɛtoko na ndjea e Yesu; mibeko mi Mose mibwanaka boimedjani bato ba bodju. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Ko ta midjɔ mimina misusu, moto omodhimei aimei moto o bodju. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Na tina emina, toma kebani, midjɔ mikomaka batɛli misaka otaneani:<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />“Indjani ino bato bakasɛtodje Ndjakomba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">kamoani ko tiani!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Modjɔ mo ta ehole e bino nakɔdea modjɔ momɔti modadea ino pɛpɛ bodhima na nongo moto omɔti akaotubandeani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abak 1:5, elangama ta mokanda moyou monɔkɔ mo gɛlɛki.</char></note>!” »<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Ehole eimana Polo na Balanabasi ta ndako e miɔngɔnɔ, bato babawadja basɔmbe naikina ta busa bo sabata e ngɔngɔ bɛngi balehe naikina eleho iyena. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Ehole enangana ikita, Bayudha banɛnɛ ko na bato baangɔnɔkɔ Ndjakomba o Bayudha bakimana Polo na Balanabasi. Ibo babala na bu ko babapingedja bo badikame ta tei e bwela bobakɔmea Ndjakomba.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Isu di sabata iyena e ngɔngɔ, bato mbuti na basusu ba ngando enɛnɛ baputoana bɛngi baoke mobalo mo Kumu. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Ehole eɛnɛ Bayudha bimumu bi bato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bimumu bi bato: ebwani pongono bokoma emumu e bato banɛnɛ.</char></note>, baso baluma na swɛ; baisanaka kitɛ na polo ko bamosingaka. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Iboa Polo na Balanabasi babala na bu na bhingi bo: «Etungi boso mɛnɛ bo mobalo mo Ndjakomba molehame ta dii ino. Endelo abo ino omodumbakadeani ko otasabwanedjakadeani bɛngi obolodjeni bomɔ bo kɔbili, iboa iso lokɛkɛdea edɛdiyeye ta dii bato ibia badii pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Modjɔ mo Kumu aloloma bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">“Naohɔɔ ondingo bohu bo bikomi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">bɛngi bo olwɛe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">ngondo esusu mohelo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 49:6.</char></note>!” »<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Ehole eoka bato ibia badaaka pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha modjɔ momina, basepa ko babanga bokumedja mobalo mo Kumu. Basusu ibia bahɔɔmɔkɔ tina e bodia bomɔ bo kɔbili baimea badhimi. <verse eid="ACT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Mobalo mo Kumu monangana ta ekenge e mokili iyena esusu. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Endelo Bayudha basombanedja bali ibia ba gala na basuku ba ngando enɛnɛ ibia bakumeaka Ndjakomba, ko babanga bonɔngedja Polo na Balanabasi ko bababengana ta telitoale e bobo. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Ibo baso babhubhola idutu dji bigbota<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta Malako 6:11 ko na nase.</char></note> bi bobo na kɛlɛ ebobo ko bakɛɛ ta Ikɔniɔmi. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Enakoboa batingami baluma na mongandi ko na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s1">Polo na Balanabasi ta Ikɔniɔmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Ta Ikɔniɔmi Polo na Balanabasi bakwea pongono ta ndako e miɔngɔnɔ e Bayudha ko kɔpi dji bobo djisepedja bato, iboa Bayudha banɛnɛ na bato ba bikomi bikina baimea badhimi. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Endelo Bayudha ibia balona bodhima bapangoa bato ba bikomi bikina badie binabu malɛno mabe boso bo denga. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Na nongo boa, Polo na Balanabasi bayeyoa ta Ikɔniɔmi. Babalaka na swueya ko baisaka milema mi bobo ta dii Kumu. Kumu abapaka bokondji bo bokɔ bimbete na bingengo bɛngi ainedje bo mibalo mi ngɔlu e nde milehaka ibo midii mi sooti. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Bato ba ngando enɛnɛ babɔtɔ: bakina badaaka ta pamba e Bayudha bakina ta pamba e bapɔsɔlu. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Endelo Bayudha na bato ba bikomi bikina, na bakondji ba bobo, basabwanedjaka bɛngi banɔngedje Polo na Balanabasi ko bɛngi babaowoe na mabɔkɔ. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Iyana aoka ibo boa, batia ta ngando djinɛnɛ dji Likaoni, Lisitele, Dɛlɛbɛ ko na mbuti na dju. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />Iho balehaka Bwɛndi Bopele.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Polo na Balanabasi ta Lisitele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Edaka na moto omɔti ta Lisitele adaaka na mobondo , modjɔ mo mako ma nde madaaka makatatake; adaaka etumbɛ donga bobotama bo nde ko aihɔnɔkɔ bodala. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Ahokamaedjaka mɛko mibalaka Polo. Polo amokokoledja ko aɛnɛ bo adaaka na edhimeli bɛngi ahele. <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />Iboa abala na nde na ngulu bo: «Angɔ, saninodja na mako ma wɛ!» Moto omina apimboa na mako ma nde ko oso abanga bodala.<verse eid="ACT 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Ehole eɛnɛ emumu e bato modjɔ mokɔɔ Polo, bagama na monɔkɔ mo ngando mo Likaoni bo: «Ba ndjakomba balwai mikuku mi bato ko batiti ta dii iso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 28:6.</char></note>!» <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Babeaka Balanabasi «Djeusi» ko Polo «Helɛmɛsi»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta ehombeli e ba Gɛlɛkɛ e ba ndjakomba Djeusi adaaka mobanei o ba ndjakomba ko Helɛmɛsi adaaka mwana o elomu o bobo.</char></note>, modjɔ mo Polo adaaka mbaeli. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Ndako iyena eangɔnɔkɔ bo ndjakomba Djeusi edaka ta modipe mo ngando enɛnɛ, nganga o Djeusi atomba ngɔmbɔ baami babayɔi na bipweya bihɔlɔmɔke na mikpulu na pulɛlɛ: iyo na bimumu bi bato, bapalaka batumbee Polo na Balanabasi mbeka. <verse eid="ACT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Endelo ehole eoka bapɔsɔlu Balanabasi na Polo modjɔ momina, baala bisendja bi bobo ko bapota ta ndanda e emumu e bato agame bo: <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />«Baningani tina ekɔkɔdea na nu iboa nda? Iso lodii bato oko ondingo ino. Loolwɛini Bwɛndi Bopele, na bobeani okineni bikeko bi pɛpɛ sɔngi ko ohombaneni ta dii Ndjakomba o bomɔ oyoa busa na kpɔtɔ, dua ko na midjɔ misusu midii ta tei e dju<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta Boi 20:11; Ndjem 146:6.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Ta ehole e boso, akina bikomi bisusu bikimane ndjea dji dju. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Na boa, aitaka boinedja bopele bo nde: akaodumbeeni mbua bodonga ta odiko, okatswɛni mbuma ta bodidi bo yu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Ndjem 147:8; Yil 5:24.</char></note>, akaopɛni mia ko akalumedje molema mo bino na mongandi.» <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Na nongo abala ibo iboa, baɛnɛ saya bɛngi basie bimumu badea pɛpɛ bobatumbea mbeka. <verse eid="ACT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Bayudha badonga ta Atiosi e Pidjidi ko na ta Ikɔniɔmi, ko baso bapangoa emumu e bato. Balaa Polo mabɔkɔ bɛngi bamoowoe, ko bamoimanedja sokolu e ngando enɛnɛ, balɛnɛkɛ bo agwi. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Endelo ndelo iyena eputoana batingami boso bo nde, asangɔdjɔ ko asɔmbɔ ta ngando enɛnɛ. Aya busa, akɛɛ na Balanabasi ta Dɛlɛbɛ.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ihule ta Atiosi e Sili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Polo na Balanabasi batɔndea Bwɛndi Bopele ta ngando enɛnɛ e Dɛlɛbɛ ko baso badia batingami banɛnɛ. Ngɔngɔ djimina baso basɔmbɔ ta Lisitele, Ikɔniɔmi ko na ta Atiosi e Pidjidi. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Bambimbimedjaka milema mi batingami, ko babapingedjaka badikame ta edhimeli ko babalaka na bu bo: «Lotungi loɛnɛ saya enɛnɛ bɛngi lokwee ta Bokumu bo Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Engi Ekelesa, babahɔeya basuku ko ngɔngɔ dji bokɔ mongilo ko na boangɔnɔ, babakina ta mɔmɔ ma Kumu iyona odhimeaka ibo.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Ngɔgɔ djimina, balekedja Pidjidi ko baimea ta Papili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pidjidi: boindja ta 13:14. Papili: edii ekenge emokili e Pɛlɛdje (boindja 13:13 ko na nase) ko na Atali (molɔngɔ mo 25).</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Batɔndea mobalo mo Ndjakomba ta Pɛlɛdje, ko baso bakɛɛ ta Atali. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Iho, bakwea ta masuwa bɛngi bakɛe ta Atiosi e Sili, ngando enɛnɛ iyena e bakinaka ibo ta mɔmɔ ma Ndjakomba na ngɔlu e nde tina e mosala mokɛkɛdea ibo ahule asala edɛdiyeye. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Ehole eimea ibo, baputoanedja bato ba Ekelesa ko baso babatubana midjɔ misusu mikɔɔ Ndjakomba na bu, ko na mondumba modipoa na nde ndjea e bodhima ta dii bato ba dii pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Bakɔɔ masu manɛnɛ na batingami iyana.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ibolea di Yelusalɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">15, 1 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Lew 12:3.</char>
    </note>Ndambo e bato badonga ta Yudhea badoa ta Atiosi ko ba babanga boleha denga bo: «Obwanitini bohelani bamiti olenani epole mondumba molomakadea mobeko mo Mose.» <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Polo na Balanabasi balona bileho bimina baisana kitɛ na bato bamina. Iyana apinga modjɔ momina, batomba meko bo Polo na Balanabasi na badhimi bakina ba Atiosi baiwee ta Yelusalɛmɛ ta dii bapɔsɔlu ko na basuku bɛngi babɔngedje modjɔ momina. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Ekelesa ebakamoa na modjɔ mokambaka na bu tina e mɔɔngɔ momina. Bakatisa Penisi na Samalia, atubane mondumba mohombanaka na bato badii Pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha ta dii Kumu: gala emina esepedjaka denga dinɛnɛ.<verse eid="ACT 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Ehole eimea bo ta Yelusalɛmɛ, basɔɔmɔkɔ na Ekelesa, bapɔsɔlu ko na basuku, ko babatubana midjɔ misusu mikɔɔ Ndjakomba na ndjea e bobo. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Endelo ndambo e bato ba iputo di Bapalisai, ibia baimeaka badhimi, baema ko babala bo: «Etungi bolena bato badii pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha bipole ko bobaloma na ngulu basume mobeko mo Mose.»<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Bapɔsɔlu na basuku baputoana bɛngi baikoe modjɔ momina.<verse eid="ACT 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Ngɔngɔ dji bobo boisana kitɛ enɛnɛ, Petelo aema ko abala bo: «Baningani, odjebakadeani donga ehele Ndjakomba ahɔɔni ta tei e bino bɛngi natɔndee Bwɛndi Bopele ta dii ibia badii pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha baboke ko badhime. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Ko Ndjakomba, iyo okadjebe milema mi bato, ainedja bo abaasɔkɔ na bobapa Mwembo Mosɛnɔke oko mondumba mopa iyo iso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ mo 7-8: boindja 10:44; 11:15.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Ediiti na etikoanelo ta tei e biso na bu: asɛnodja milema mi bobo modjɔ mo badhima. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Edɛdiyeye mɛnɛ, tina emekakadea na nu Ndjakomba na bohomba bolwadja badhimi muna mo bo na bakɔkɔ ba biso na iso bɛnɛ loihɔnɔ bomolwa? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Lodhimakadea bo loheli na ngɔlu e Kumu Yesu, mondumba momɔti na bu!» <verse eid="ACT 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Iboa ibolea isusu iso dipɔpɔnɔ ko bahokamedja Balanabasi na Polo batubana bimbete na bingengo bibakɔmea Ndjakomba ta dii bato ibia badii pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Ehole emadja bo bobala, Djake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta 12:17 ko na nase.</char></note> atomba kɔpi ko aso abala bo: «Baningani hokamedjanini! <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Simona<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Simona: edii kombe Petelo e boso (boindja ta Mat 4:18).</char></note> atubani mondumba mokwea Ndjakomba donga mbangi ta dii bato ibia badii pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha bɛngi ahɔe ta tei e bikomi bato ba nde. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Mibalo mi batɛli mibwani na modjɔ momina, modjɔ mo Makomi malakadea bo: <verse eid="ACT 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />“Kumu abala bo, ngɔngɔ djimina nasɔmbɔdea bɛngi natonge naikina ndako e Dhapiti iyena ekwaka, nangɔdjɔdea bikuka bi yu, ko naemedjadea. <verse eid="ACT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Iboa bato bakina basusu bahombadea Kumu, sooti, bikomi bisusu bibea mbi bɛngi bidae bi mbi. Indja Kumu atɔndeakadea bo, <verse eid="ACT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Iyona odjebedja ko okokedja modjɔ momina tomba ehele mɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ mo 16 mbunoko 18: Ams 9:11-12, elangama ta mokanda mo moyou mo monɔkɔ mo gɛlɛki.</char></note>.” <verse eid="ACT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Na tina emina, naɛni bo lobwaniti bokɔ bobe ta dii bato ibi badii pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha, ibibi basadhimea Ndjakomba. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Endelo lobakomee bo: Pɛpɛ boyakani muni mo tito mo djɛti imu motumbei ibo ekeko mbeka, pɛpɛ bokɔɔ ndukeli, pɛpɛ boyaka tito oowoi ibo na pɛpɛ bomolena dɔli pɛpɛ bomoyakani ko pɛpɛ bomwakani makiya ma nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boidja ta Boi 34:15-16; Lew 17:10-16. Ndukeli iyaya einedjakdea meki mi bali na baami misiamaka ta mobeko mo Bayudha, boindja ta Lew 18:6-2.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Modjɔ mo tomba ehole eyou, bato bakalehe mibeko mi Mose engi ngando enɛnɛ ko bakamilange ta ndako dji miɔngɔnɔ e Bayudha engi sabata.»<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mokanda molomama ta dii badhimi badii pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Iboa bapɔsɔlu na basuku ko na Ekelesa esusu batomba meko e bohɔɔ ndambo e bato ta tei e bobo ko babalome ta Atiosi na Polo ko na Balanabasi. Bahɔɔ Yudhasi obeaka ibo pongono Balasabasi, na Silasi bato babae badaaka na gala ta tei e denga. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Babapa mokanda ta tei bakoma bo: «Denga didii pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha, ko badikamakadea ta Atiosi, ta Sili ko na ta Silisi asɔni ndese edongi ta dii iso denga di bino bapɔsɔlu ko na basuku. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Lookakabi ibo bato ibia badongaki ta dii iso baoyekeini ko babali na nu midjɔ mimina miotungei malɛno ma bino enakoboa iso lobalomakiti. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Na tina emina, iso basusu lookanaki bohɔɔ bato ko lobalome ta dii ino. Badoadea engbanga emɔti na bangi i biso ba epaeli Balanabasi na Polo. <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />Ibo baipabi yogo ta kombe e Kumu o biso Yesu Kilito. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Loolomeini Yudhasi na Silasi ibo bɛnɛ baotɔndeadeani eka ekomi iso iya ta mokanda. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Modjɔ mo iso na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke ko na iso bɛnɛ lotapalakadea boopani muna mokina oko midjɔ imimi tɛtɛ: <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />pɛpɛ boyakani muni mo tito imua motumbei ibo bkeko mbeka; Pɛpɛ boyaka makiya na munu mi tito mopɔlu; pɛpɛ konkɔni ndukeli. Okamakinani mɛko imia okɔini bopele!» <verse eid="ACT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Bakina bato ibia bahɔɔ ibo ko baso bakɛɛ ta Atiosi. Iho baputoanedja badhimi ko babapa mokanda. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Bamolanga ko ibo basusu basepa ko mokanda momina moso mobapingedja. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Yudhasi na Silasi ibo bɛnɛ badaaka batɛli, basola na denga ehole eyai ko babapingedjaka ko bobambimbimedja ta edhimeli. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Ngɔngɔ dji moo ehole mokɛkɛ, denga baso babakina basɔmbe na bogo ta dii bato ibia babalomaka. [<verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Endelo Silasi atomba meko e bodikama ena.] <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Polo na Balanabasi badika ta Atiosi. Na bato bakina banɛnɛ, balehaka ko batɔndeaka Bwɛndi Bopele bo Kumu.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Polo na Balanabasi babɔtɔi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Ngɔngɔ i moo ehole mokɛkɛ, Polo abala na Balanabasi bo: «Losɔmbe aindje denga ta ngando djinɛnɛnɛnɛ djisusu dji tɔndea iso mobalo mo Kumu, bɛngi lopete ɛnɛ mondumba modalakadea ibo.» <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Balanabasi ahombaka atombe Yoane okabee ibo Malako <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Endelo Polo aso alona, modjɔ mo abakinaka ta Papili ko aidaka na bu engbanga emɔti ta mosala mo bobo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta 13:13.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Baanoana bobuke mɛnɛ ko baso babɔtɔɔ. Balanabasi atomba Malako bakwea ta masuwa bakɛɛ ta Sipele, <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Polo ahɔɔ Silasi ko akɛɛ, ko alomama na denga na ngɔlu e Kumu.<verse eid="ACT 15:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Balekedja ta Sili ko na Silisi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Silisi: edii ekenge e mokili mo ngando enɛnɛ e Talasi.</char></note>, ambimbimedje Bikelesa.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s1">Timote adali na Polo na Silasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Polo aimea ta Dɛlɛbɛ, ngɔngɔ akɛɛ ta Lisitele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta 14:8, 21.</char></note>. Motingami omɔti adaaka ena kombe e nde Timote; adaaka mwana moomi o Moyudha mwali omɔti oimeaka modhimi, endelo sango adaaka Mogɛlɛki. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Denga didaaka ta Lisitele ko na ta Ikɔniɔmi babala bo Timote adii moto mopele. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Polo apala amotombe adalake na nde ko aso amotomba. Amolenedja epole ta bolona botuba bɛndɔ ta dii Bayudha ibia badaaka ena, modjɔ mo bato basusu badjebaka bo sango adaaka Mogɛlɛki. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Ta ngando djinɛnɛnɛnɛ djinɔɔkɔ ibo, batɔndeaka badhimi meko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Meko mimina midiama ko mikomama ta mokanada umu molangami ta 15:23-29.</char></note> mipa bapɔsɔlu na basuku ba Yelusalɛmɛ ko babala na bu bamisume. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Bikelesa bimbimbimaka ta edhimeli ko masu masusu bato banɛngɛkɛ.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ta Toloasi, Polo aɛni ndjɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Mwembo Mosɛnɔke mosia Polo na Silasi botɔndea mobalo mo Ndjakomba ta ekenge e mokili mo Adjia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ekenge e mokili mo ba Loma ta Adjia edingaka ngando enɛnɛ e Epeso. Bikenge bi mokili bi Pilidji na Galatia bidaka bikenge bi ndandanda ta Adjia o Mokɛkɛ.</char></note> ta mwɛngi mo bo balekedje ta Pilidji ko na ta Galatia. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Aimea ibo mbuti na Midjia, badia posa e bokɛɛ ta Bitini, endelo Mwembo mo Yesu mo basia. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Iboa balekedja Midjia ko baimea ta ibongu di Toloasi. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Na bulu Polo aɛnɛ ndjɛnɛ: aɛnɛ moto omɔti o Masedoane aemi diko, amoangɔnɔkɔ bo: «Nɔɔ ta Masedoane ko doa olokamoe!» <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Na mbala emɔti ngɔngɔ dji ndjɛnɛ emina, lohomba mwɛngi mo boimea ta Masedoane, modjɔ mo lolɛdjɛkɛ bo Ndjakomba alobeaka aleha Bwɛndi Bopele ta dɔɔngɔ dimina.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A Pilipe, Ludia adhimei Kumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Lokwea ta masuwa ta Toloasi loiyeyoa na ndjea lokɛɛ tee ta esanga e Samotalasi, ko ngɔngɔ dji busa bomɔti, loimea ta Neapolisi. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Lodonga iho ko loso lokɛɛ ta Pilipe, ngando enɛnɛ e boso ta ekenge e mokili e Masedoane iyena e kondjamaka na bato ba Loma. Lokɔɔ masu manɛnɛ ta ngando enɛnɛ emina. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Ta busa bo sabata, loimana sokolu e ngando enɛnɛ, lokɛɛ ta mokula mo dua lolɛnɛkɛ bo lotaneadea esika e miɔngɔnɔ e Bayudha. Iso lodaa na mobondo ena losola na bali ibia badaaka ena. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Mwali omɔti ta tei e bali ibia kombe e nde Ludia; adonga ta ngando enɛnɛ e Tiatile, atɛkɛkɛ bisendja bikpetu binɛnɛ ko akumeaka Ndjakomba. Alohokamedjaka modjɔ mo Kumu adipoa molema mo nde bɛngi aoke bopele mibalo mi Polo. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Atomba batisimo na ibota di nde isusu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 16:33; 18:8. </char></note>. Ngɔngɔ djimina alowadja lokɛe ta ndako e nde ko abala bo: «Okaɛnɛni sooti bo nadhimi Kumu doani adikama ta ndako e mbi.» Ko alokpekpea bɛngi lodhime.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Polo na Silasi ta bɔlɔkɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Busa bomɔti lokɛkɛ ta esika e miɔngɔnɔ, losongana na mosali mwali omɔti: adaaka na mwembo momɔti imua momoinedjaka midjɔ mikɛkɛdea adoe, baswa nde badiaka palanga djinɛnɛ ta midjɔ mitɛlɛkɛ iyo. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Abanga bolokimana na Polo, agamaka bo: «Bato ibibi badii basali ba Ndjakomba Onɔi Diko! Baoinedjakadeani ndjea e mohelo!» <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Akɔɔkɔ modjɔ momina masu manɛnɛ. Ko Polo aso aɛmbɛɛ ahokoa ko abala na mwembo bo: «Ta kombe e Yesu Kilito, naopakadea mitindo imana ta tei e nde!» Oko ta ehole emina iyena mwembo moimana. <verse eid="ACT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Ehole eɛnɛ baswa nde bo batadiadea palanga naikina, bapea Polo na Silasi ko bakɛɛ na bu ta djaando boso bo babanei. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Bakɛɛ na bu ta dii bato bakasambedje makambo ko babala bo: «bato ibibi baisakadea wusuwusu ta ngando enɛnɛ e biso. Badii Bayudha. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Ko balehakadea midaa imia midii pɛpɛ bodaa, iso ibia badii ba Loma lobwaniti bomidhima kaoko bomiisa ta mosala.» <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Emumu e bato pongono elemoa na bu. Bato bakasambedje makambo baloma bakatoe bisendja ko baloma bababome mbalake. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Ngɔngɔ dji bobaboma mbalake, babadumba ta ndandanda e bɔlɔkɔ ko babala na sindjili abasɛndjɛle bopele mɛnɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Iyana ama dia sindjili simbisi emina, abaisa ta ndandanda e bɔlɔkɔ ko aisa mako ma bobo ta masɔngɔ.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Ta ndanda e bulu, Polo na Silasi baangɔnɔkɔ ko baembaka bɛngi bakumee Ndjakomba; babɔlɔkɔ bakina babahokamedjaka. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Na mbala emɔti kpɔtɔ djikumana na ngulu mɛnɛ miboku mi ndako e bɔlɔkɔ mihombaka mibukee. Oko ta ehole emina, midipe misusu midipoama ko mikpulu mi bibende mi babɔlɔkɔ misusu miloloana. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Sindjili asisoa; aɛnɛ midipe mi bɔlɔkɔ midaka midipoamake, atomba mɔmbi mo nde bɛngi asaowoe, modjɔ mo alɛnɛkɛ bo babɔlɔkɔ basiaka botia. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Endelo Polo agama na ngulu bo: «Pɛpɛ bosakɔɔ oko bobe! Iso basusu lodii iya!» <verse eid="ACT 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Iboa sindjili asɛngɛɛ molinda, akwea ta bɔlɔkɔ akɛkɛ angongome na bɔɔ, ko asadumba ta mako ma Polo na Silasi. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Abaimanedja sokolu ko abawadja bo: «Bakumi, eka ebwani mbi bokɔ nda bɛngi nahele?» <verse eid="ACT 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Bamosɔmbedja bo: «Dhimea Kumu Yesu ko oheladea, wɛ na ibota iwɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Ko bamotɔndea mobalo mo Kumu, na bato basusu ibia badaaka ta ndako e nde. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Sindjili abatomba oko ta ehole emina iyena e bulu asosa pola dji bobo. Aso atomba batisimo na bato ba nde basusu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 16:15; 18:8.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Akwedja Polo na Balanabasi ta ndako e nde ko abapa mia. Moomi omina na ibota di nde, baluma na mongandi iyana adhimea bo Ndjakomba.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Iyana aya busa, ba djudji baloma basali ta dii sindjili abala bo: «Tingoa bato ibibi.» <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Sindjili aso akɛɛ atɔndea Polo bo: «Ba djudji balomi naotingoeni. Iboa obwanini boimanani ko okɛeni na bogo.» <verse eid="ACT 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Endelo Polo abasɔmbedja na bato bamina bo: «Balobomaki ta miso ma bato basusu na pɛpɛ nongo bolosambedja, iso ibia badii bato ba Loma! Ko baloisaki ta bɔlɔkɔ. Edɛdiyeye bapalakadea baloimanedje na mbombi? Ediiti iboa! Ibo bɛnɛ badoe aloimanedja!» <verse eid="ACT 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Basali ibia baso bakɛɛ atɔndea bwɛndi ta dii ba djudji. Ibo baso babanga iyana aoka ibo bo badii bato ba Loma. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Bakɛɛ asangɔnɔ na bu, ko babaimanedja ta bɔlɔkɔ na bobaangɔnɔ bo badonge ta ngando enɛnɛ emina. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Ehole eimana bo ta bɔlɔkɔ Polo na Silas bakɛɛ ta dii Ludia. Ngɔngɔ dji boɛnɛnɛ na denga ko babapingedja, baso bakɛɛ.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s1">Polo na Silasi a Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Ngɔngɔ dji bolekedja ta Apipolisi ko na Apoloni, baimea ta Tesalonike ta esika edaka ndako e miɔngɔnɔ e Bayudha. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Polo ekwea iho oko mondumba momɛsɛnɛkɛ iyo. Ekɔɔ sabata djisato, abatingodjaka Makomi, <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />abatingodjaka na bohu bo, Masiya atungi aɛnɛ saya ko asisoe ta tei e bato bago. Abatɔndeaka bo: «Yesu iyona ootɔndeakadeani mbi, iyo moto odii Masiya.» <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Ndambo e bato ta tei e bobo badhima ko baputoana na Polo na Silasi. Edae bato banɛnɛ ba Bagɛlɛki ibia bakakumee Ndjakomba, na bali bakina ba ekumu.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Endelo Bayudha baluma na swɛ. Baputoanedja bato ba mongangale ibia bakakɛe ayengayenge na ndjea, baisa mongangale ta tei e emumu e bato ko na ta ngando enɛnɛ. Bakɛɛ ta ndako e Yasɔni ahomba Polo na Silasi bɛngi bakɛe na bu ta boso e bato basusu. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Endelo baibabolodja, bapea Yasɔni na denga dikina bakɛɛ na bu ta boso bo babanei ba ngando enɛnɛ ko babanga bogama bo: «Bato ibia baisi mongangale ta ngondo mobimba, ko edɛdiyeye baimei iya! <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Ko Yasɔni abasɔi ta ndako e nde! Ibo basusu batasumakadea mibeko mi Kaisala, na bobala bo edii na mokondji okina, kombe e nde Yesu.» <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Mibalo mimina mitungea emumu e bato edae na babanei ba ngando enɛnɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Iboa baputedja Yasɔni na denga idia dikina palanga dji bapea na bu ngɔngɔ babakina.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Polo na Silasi ta Bele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Ehole edipa busa, denga baloma Polo na Silasi ta Bele. Iyana aimea ibo bakwea ta ndako e miɔngɔnɔ e Bayudha. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Bayudha ba Bele badaaka na mida mipele bonɔ ibia ba Tesalonike; basɔɔ mobalo mo Ndjakomba na mongandi mosusu. Masu masusu baikoaka Makomi bɛngi baindje kaoko eka abatɔdeaka ibo edaka sooti. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Bato banɛnɛ ta tei e bobo baimea badhimi, ko ta tei Bagɛlɛki, bali na baami banɛnɛ badhima pongono.<verse eid="ACT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Endelo ehole eoka Bayudha ba Tesalonike bo Polo atɔndeaka mobalo mo Ndjakomba ta Bele, bakimana pongono iho ko babanga boisa isombana ta bimumu bi bato bangale. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Denga banɔdjɔ Polo pɛpɛlɛ ta dua; endelo Silasi na Timote badika ta Bele. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Bato ibia badaledjaka Polo bakɛɛ na nde mbunoko ta Atɛne. Ngɔngɔ Polo abaloma basɔmbe ta dii Silasi na Timote bamokimane pɛpɛlɛ.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Polo ta Atɛne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Iyana adaaka Polo aamba Silasi na Timote ta Atɛne, aoka bobe ta molema na boɛnɛ bo ngando enɛnɛ emina eluma na bikeko. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Alehaka Bayudha ta ndako e miɔngɔnɔ ko na bato badii pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha bakumeaka Ndjakomba ko engi busa alehaka ta djaando bato basakaka na nde. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Ndambo e bato ba bowɛi ibia bakimanaka malɛno ma Epikile<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Balehaka ndjea e boinedja bo ta ngondo minɔngɔ midiiti badhimedjaka bo moto na moto akakɔe eka esusu epalakadea iyo. Sitoisiɛ: bato ba engbanga e bileho bi Djenɔni. Bwanya ta dii ibo, bodaaka ta tina e bodjeba mibeko midaledjaka ngondo ko na boisa bileho bipamaka ta tina e bhingi ta mosala. Yesu ko bosisoa ta bogwa: bato bahokamedjaka Polo batomba kombe mwali emɔti e gɛlɛki baimedja bosisoa ta bogwa ta tina e ndjakomba mwali odabi moputoanaka na Yesu.</char></note> ko na ma Djenoni badoa aisana na nde kitɛ. Bakina bomowadja bo: «Epalakadea bobala mɛko imi nde?» Ko bakina batɔndeaka bo: «Abwani bodaa molehi o ba ndjakomba ba bakɛndɛli», modjɔ mo Polo atɔndeaka Bwɛndi Bopele bo Yesu ko na bosisoa ta bogwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Iboa bamotomba ko bakɛɛ na nde boso bo ikita di bobo djikombedjake Aleopadje ko bamowadja bo: «Lobwaniti lodjebe sɔngi e bileho bi yeene ibia bilehakadea wɛ? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Obalakadea na su mɛko mi yeene ko lopalakadea lodjebe eka epalakadea imo botingodja.» <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Modjɔ mo, bato basusu ba Atɛne, na bakɛndɛli badikamaka ta tei e bobo banɔdjɔkɔ ehole e bobo esusu oko ta botubana kaoko bohokamedja mɛko mi yeene.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Iboa Polo aema ta ndanda e Aleopadje, ko abala bo: «Bato ba Atɛne, naɛni bo odiini bato bakapale mɛko mi ba ndjakomba bobuke mɛnɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Te ngasa, ehole edali mbi ta ngando e bino enɛnɛ ko aindje bikeko bikangɔne ino, naɛni ta etumbelo e mbeka emɔti bakomi bo: “Polo e ndjakomba iyoo okadae pɛpɛ bodjebama.” Na tina emina mbi naolwɛini Ndjakomba iyona okakumee ino na pɛpɛ bomodjeba. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Ndjakomba okɔɔ ngondo na leka losusu lodii otei, adii Kumu o busa na kpɔtɔ, ta daake ta tepelo djikapike ibo na mɔmɔ ma bato. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Tadake na posa e bo bato bamokɔmedjake kaoko bamolwɛe eka emɔti, modjɔ mo edii iyo moto okapɛ bomɔ ta dii bato basusu, mohemano ko na midjɔ misusu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ mo 24-25: boindja ta 7:48; 1 Bak 8:27; Isa 42:5.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Na ndjea e moto omɔti, ayoa bikomi bisusu ko baluma ta ngondo esusu. Akabana madidi ko na mei mi bisika bibwani na bato bodikama<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na ndjea e moto omɔti: Adamu (Mba 1:28). Mei: Boindja Dit 32:8. </char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Enakoboa akɔɔ iboa bɛngi bato bamohombake, ko ta tei e bomohomba bomina, ndelo ekina babwani bomobolodja. Ta bosooti Ndjakomba adiiti bohali na moto omɔti omɔti o biso, <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />modjɔ mo: “Lohelakadea na ndjea e nde, na ngulu edalakadea na su ko iyo moto oloyoa.” Ko bakomi bakina ta tei e bino baemba bo: “lodii pongono bana ba nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta mbangi e molɔngɔ, Polo alangakadea bopele mɛnɛ molɔngɔ mo gɛlɛki Epimenide, iboa ta suka e molɔngɔ edii ikomi di molɔngɔ mo Alatosi.</char></note>.” <verse eid="ACT 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Lokadaa bana ba nde, lobwaniti bolɛnɛ bo Ndjakomba abwani bodaa ondingo ekeko e wolo, palanga kaoko ibanga diluama na iboma ko na bowɛi bo bato. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Enakoboa Ndjakomba aindjaka mɛko imia elɔkɔ e bo bato baidjebaka bobe bokɔkɔ ibo, endelo edɛdiyeye abeakadea bato basusu bahombedje milema. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Modjɔ mo aisa busa bomɔti ibua bosambedjadea iyo ngondo esusu na bodju, na ndjea e moto iyona ohɔɔ iyo. Ainedja moto mosusu embete ebwani na bodhima na bomosisodja ta tei e bato bago!»<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Iyana aoka ibo Polo abala tina e bosisoa ta bogwa, bato bakina bomosɛkɛ ko bakina babala bo: «Lookadea busa bokina.» <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Iboa Polo aimana ta tei e bobo. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Ndambo e bato bamokimana ko baimea badhimi: ta tei e bato bamina edaka, Denisi omɔti o ibolea di Aleopadje, mwali omɔti na kombe e Damalisi, ko na bakina pongono.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s1">Polo ta Kolito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, Polo akɛɛ ta Atɛne ta Kolito<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edaka ngando enɛnɛ edikamaka mokondji o Polovɛse e Akai. Ngando enɛnɛ emina edaka na bato banɛnɛ, edjebana na misala miyu mibe.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Iho asongana na Moyuda omɔti na kombe e Akilasi, abotama ta Pɔti: ahulaka ta Itali na mwali o nde Pilisile modjɔ mo mokondji Kolode<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pɔɔ edaka polovɛse emɔt e pamba e sadiko ta Adjia o Mokɛkɛ, ta mokula mo dua enɛnɛ ehindo. Kolode: boindja ta 11:28 ko na nase. Bokondji bo nde bobengana Bayudha ba Loma ta yanga e 49.50.</char></note> apaka mitindo Bayudha basusu baimane ta Loma. Aputoana na bu, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />ko abo adaaka akɔɔ oko mosala momɔti na bu adikamaka ta dii ibo ko asalaka; mosala mo bobo modaaka mo bokɔɔ bikpangba. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Engi busa bo sabata, Polo alehaka ta ndako e miɔngɔnɔ ko ahombaka mwɛngi mo botuba Bayudha na Bagɛlɛki ta edhimeli. <verse eid="ACT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Ehole ehula Silasi na Timote ta Masedoane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta 17:15.</char></note>, Polo asapa na bosusu ta boleha mobalo; adhimedjaka ta dii Bayudha bo Yesu adii Masiya. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Endelo iyana alona Bayudha mibalo mi nde ko na bomosinga; abhubhola bisendja bi nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ ta Malako 6:11 ko na nase.</char></note> ko abala na bu bo: «Kina bo makiya mabino madae ta molo mo bino bɛnɛ, eindjiti mbi. Edɛdiyeye nakɛkɛdea ta dii ibia badii pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha.» <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Adonga ena ko akɛɛ ta dii moto omɔti na kombe e Titiusi Yusitusi okumeaka Ndjakomba ko ndako e nde edaka mbuti na ndako e miɔngɔnɔ e Bayudha. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Kilisipusi, mobanei o ndako e miɔngɔnɔ, adhimea Kumu, na ibota di nde disusu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 16:15, 33.</char></note>. Bato banɛnɛ ba Kolito bahokamedjaka Polo, badhima pongono ko batomba batisimo. <verse eid="ACT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Bulu bomɔti, Kumu abala na Polo na ndjɛnɛ bo: «Pɛpɛ bobanga oko, endelo bala pɛpɛ bopɔpɔnɔ oko, <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />modjɔ mo mbi na dii na wɛ. Pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti obakeadea ebɔ e nde diko di wɛ bɛngi aokɔe bobe, modjɔ mo banɛnɛ iya ta ngando iye enɛnɛ badii ba mbi.» <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Akɔɔ yanga emɔti na ekenge ta Kolito; abalehaka mobalo mo Ndjakomba. <verse eid="ACT 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Ehole edaka Galiɔni, gupɛlɛnɛlɛ o Akayi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mikanda mi ehole iyena mikakamoe bodjebedja bianga bi 51-52 kaoko 52-53 mosala imua mo Galiɔ ta Kolito.</char></note>, Bayudha baokana bɛngi bakɔe Polo bobe ko baso bakɛɛ na nde ta sambi <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />ko bamopunda bo: «Moto iyo apalakadea apangoe bato bakumee Ndjakomba na mondumba modii ngalingondo e mobeko.» <verse eid="ACT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Polo ahomba abale, endelo Galiɔni asɔmbedja Bayudha bo: «Ekadaa bo moto iyo akɔiki modjɔ mobe kaoko modjɔ momɔti monɔi monɛnɛ, nabwani naohokamedjeni ino Bayudha. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Endelo abo edii wɛtoko kitɛ ta tina e bileho, kombe ko na mobeko mo bino, imua moindji ino. Mbi naloni bodaa djudji o mɛko mi mondumba imua!» <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Ko ababengana ta sambi. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Iboa, ibo basusu bapea Sositɛni, mobanei o ndako e miɔngɔnɔ, ko babanga bomoboma boso bo sambi. Endelo Galiɔni aɛnɛ modjɔ momina ngasa.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Polo asɔmbi ta Atsiose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Polo adikama masu manɛnɛ ta Kolito. Ngɔngɔ djimina akina denga ko akwea ta masuwa aso akɛɛ ta Sili na Pilisile ko na Akilasi. Ta Sakelesi ahaedja ebɛbɛlɛ, modjɔ mo masu ma ndikano<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sakele: edii ibongu di sadiko di Kolito. ta ehole esusu e ndikano, badhimaka badae pɛpɛ bokatedja swee. Boindja ta Mits 6.5-18. </char></note> epa iyo Ndjakomba makoka. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Ehole eimea ibo ta Epeso, abakina ena. Akwea ta ndako e miɔngɔnɔ ko asolanaka na Bayudha. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Bamowadja adikame ndambo e masu ena, endelo aidhima. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Abakina ko abala bo: «Nasɔmbɔdea ta dii ino, Ndjakomba akapala.» Ko akɛɛ ta Epeso na masuwa. <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Ehole esɛmɛɛ ibo ta Sedjale, aiwea boso mɛnɛ ta Yelusalɛmɛ aisea bato ba Ekelesa, ngɔngɔ djimina akɛɛ ta Atiosi. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Anɔdjɔ moo ehole, asɔmbɔ ko alekedja mbala emɔti ta ekenge e mokili mo Galatia ko na Pilidji<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta 16:6 ko na nase.</char></note>, andindimedje bodhima bo batingami basusu.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Apolosi ta Epeso ko ta Kolito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Enakoboa, Moyuda omɔti na kombe nde Apolosi, abotama ta Alɛkɛdjandɛlɛ, aimeaka ta Epeso. Adaka moto omɔti o bowɛi ko adjebaka Makomi na bobuke mɛnɛ. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Aleamaka ta Ndjea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 9:2 ko na nase.</char></note> e Kumu, ko alumaka na ingbangba, atɔndɔkɔ ko elehaka bopele mɛnɛ midjɔ mindjaka Yesu. Endelo adjebaka oto batisimo ba Yoane. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Abanga bobala na swueya ta ndako e miɔngɔnɔ. Ngɔngɔ dji bomohokamedja, Pilisile na Akilasi bamotomba ko bamoleha Ndjea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 9:2 ko na nase.</char></note> e Ndjakomba na mondumba monɔi na bopele. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Ngɔngɔ Apolosi atombaka meko e bokɛɛ ta Akayi. Denga basepa na mbuno emina ko bakoma mokanda ta dii batingami bɛngi bamoasɔe bopele. Iyana aimea iyo iho, akɔmedja ibia baimea badhimi banɛnɛ na ngɔlu e Ndjakomba. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Modjɔ mo na bowɛi bo nde bo kɔpi, ainedjaka ibunga di Bayudha ta miso ma bato: abainedjaka ta Makomi bo Yesu adii Masiya.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s1">Polo ta Epeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Ehole edaka Apolosi ta Kolito, Polo alekedja ta mokili mo ngomba e Adjia, ko aimea ta Epeso. Atanea ndambo e batingami iho. <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />Ko abawadja: «Obolodjani Mwembo Mosɛnɔke ehole eimea ino badhimi?» Bamosɔmbedja bo: «Lopakina oka nongo babala ta tina e Mwembo Mosɛnɔke.» <verse eid="ACT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Polo abawadja bo: «Otombani batisimo ba mondumba nda?» Bamosɔmbedja bo: «Batisimo ba Yoane.» <verse eid="ACT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Iboa Polo abala na bu bo: «Yoane apaka batisimo babohombedja molema ko abalaka na bato badhimee moto iyona odoadea ngɔngɔ dji nde edii wɛtoko Yesu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta Mat 3:11, Malako 1:4, 7-8.</char></note>.» <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Ngɔngɔ dji mibalo mimina, batomba batisimo ta kombe e Kumu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Polo ababakea mɔmɔ ko Mwembo Mosɛnɔke mobatitea; babanga bobala na minɔkɔ mi buki ko na botɛlɛ midjɔ mi Ndjakomba. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Bato bamina badaaka ibo basusu mbuti na doomi na babae.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Polo akwea ta ndako e miɔngɔnɔ e Bayudha, iho abala na swueya songe basato mobimba. Alehaka ta tina e Bokumu bo Ndjakomba ko akɔɔkɔ na ngulu bɛngi alonge bato ibia bamohokamedjaka. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Endelo ndambo e bato, bakɔɔkɔ melo mipipo balonaka bodhima babala bobe tina e Ndjea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 9:2 ko na nase.</char></note> ta boso bo bato. Asatuba na bu, ko adongedja batingami ena ko abalehaka masu masusu ta kalasi e Tilanusi. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Ekɔɔ bianga bibae, na mondumba mo bo bato basusu badikamaka ta ekenge e mokili mo Adjia, Bayudha na bikomi bikina, baso baoka mobalo mo Kumu.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bana ba Sikewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Ndjakomba akɔɔkɔ midjɔ mi bokamoa minɛnɛnɛnɛ na mɔmɔ ma Polo. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Na tina emina balwɛkɛ bato ba bipeko bisendja kaoko miswala imia mipeaka mokuku mo nde: ibo basusu bahelaka ko membo mibe miimanaka. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Ndambo e Bayudha ibia badalaka pamba djisusu abengane membo mibe na bameka bolanga kombe e Kumu Yesu ta dii ibia badaaka na membo mibe, na bobala bo: «Naopakadeani mitindo oimaneni ta kombe e Yesu iyona okalehe Polo!» <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Edaka na bana baami ba moto omɔti na kombe e Sikewa, omɔti o banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ba Bayudha, bakɔɔkɔ modjɔ momina. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Mwembo mobe mobasɔmbedja bo: «Nadjebakadea Yesu ko nadjebakadea Polo. Endelo ino odiini banda?» <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Ko moto odaaka na mwembo mobe asasaba diko di bobo, abalongea ko ababoma na ngulu mɛnɛ batia ta ndako mbundu ko babeneana pola. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Bato basusu ba Epeso, Bayudha ko na bikomi bikina baso baoka modjɔ momina; baoka bɔɔ ko kombe e Kumu Yesu esumama. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Bato banɛnɛ ibia badhimaka badoaka ahuodja midjɔ mibe mi bobo. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Bato banɛnɛ ta tei e ibia bakɔɔkɔ mikɔ mi bonganga badoa na buku dji bobo ko badjitumbaka ta miso ma bato basusu. Balanga motswiya mo dju ko baɛnɛ bo ibwani na pata dji palanga koto Tuku itano<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta Malako 6:37 ko na nase.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Edii wɛtoko na ngulu e Kumu, mobalo monangana ko mosainedja na kpati enɛnɛ.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mongangale ta bomia bo Polo ta Epeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Ngɔngɔ dji midjɔ mimina, Polo, molomamake na Mwembo, atomba meko e bokɛɛ ta Yelusalɛmɛ alekedja ta Masedoane ko na Akayi. Abalaka bo: «Ehole eimeadea mbi iho etungi na mbi nakɛe pongono ta Loma.» <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Aloma bakamoli ba nde babae, Timote na Elasite ta Masedoane, endelo iyo mɛnɛ adika moo ehole ta Adjia. <verse eid="ACT 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Ko ta eholo iyena mongangale monɛnɛ mokwa ta tina e Ndjea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 9:2 ko na nase.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Edaka moto omɔti na kombe Demetiliusi, mosala mo nde bokɔɔ leka lo bibende ko na bikeko bi tepelo bi ndjakomba mwali omɔti kombe e nde Alitemisi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kombe e monɔkɔ mo gɛlɛki e ndjakomba mwali omɔti moyou ta ehole e kona, okumedjaka ibo mɛnɛ ta Adjia o Mokɛkɛ.</char></note> ko na ndenge imina adaaka aputea batuli ba bibende ba nde palanga inɛnɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Abaputoanedja ko na bato bakina ibia badaaka bakɔɔ mosala mo mondumba momina, ko abatɔndea bo: «Baningani, odjebakadeani bo lohelakadea oko na mosala imu. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Enakoboa oɛnɛkɛdeani ko okakadeani bo, ediiti oto ta Epeso, endelo mbuti na Adjia mosusu, moto okombedjake Polo apangoi ko abungedji mbongo o bato na bobala bo ba ndjakomba bakakɔɔme na mɔmɔ ma bato badiiti ba ndjakomba. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Modjɔ momina mobwani bobedja mosala mo biso, endelo mobwani naikina bobedja ekomu e tepelo e ndjakomba monɛnɛ mwali Alitemisi; iboa bato bamoɛnɛdea ngasa iyona okakumee ibo ta Adjia mosusu ko ta ngondo mobimba!»<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Ehole eoka ibo modjɔ momina, baluma na kɛlɛ ko babanga bogama bo: «Alitemisi o Baepeso adii monɛnɛ!» <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Mongangale mokwa ta ngando enɛnɛ esusu. Ibo basusu bakɛɛ ta esika e makou<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bisika bi makou ta epeso bidaka binɛnɛ, bakakoanadea bo bidaka mbuti na 26000 bisika bi bodaa, ta polo djidaka djibɔngedjake. Iyna basapaka makou endelo bakɔɔkɔ pongono maputo makina iyana. </char></note> bapea Gaiusi na Alisitalake, bato ba Masedoane ibia badalaka na Polo. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Polo apalaka asaimedje ta boso bo emumu e bato, endelo badhimi baso bamosia. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Ndambo e basali ba leta ba ekenge e mokili mo Adjia, ibia badaaka badjebani ba Polo bamolomea bwɛndi bo adae pɛpɛ bokɛɛ ta esika e makou.<verse eid="ACT 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Moto na moto adaaka adumbea na ndenge e nde ko mongangale modaaka mopipo ko bato banɛnɛ baidjebaka tina e boputoana bo bobo. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Ta tei e emumu, bato batɔndea moto omɔti na kombe e Alɛkɛdjandɛlɛ modjɔ momina, iyona olindaka Bayudha boso. Angɔdjɔ obɔ: apalaka atombe kɔpi bɛngi atingodje boso bo emumu e bato. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Endelo aokabo bo adii Moyuda, ibo basusu bagama engbanga tomba ngonga dji bae bo: « Alitemisi o Epeso adii monɛnɛ!» <verse eid="ACT 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Ta suka, mokomi o mikanda o ngando enɛnɛ apɔpɔnedja emumu e bato ko abala bo: «Bato ba Epeso, bato basusu badjebakadea bo boto ba Epeso bakabanee ndako e ndjakomba mwali Alitemisi ko na ekeko e nde edonga o diko. <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti obwani boboma kitɛ na modjo momina. Iboa obwanini botitedjani milema mi bino pɛpɛ bokɔɔni oko bobe. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Bato ibibi badoi na nu iya batsioliti ndjakomba mwali o biso ko bamosingiti. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Ekadaa bo Demetiliusi ko na batuli ba nde ba bibende badii na ikambo di bopunda tina e moto omɔti, tibinalo dji dii ko na ba djudji: bakɛe apunda! <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Ko okadaani na ikambo dikina ibɔngedjamadea ta iputo dinɛnɛ di mibeko. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Basaka lopunda na midjɔ imi misa nɔɔmɔ iya busa ibu mi pɛpɛ tɛtɔ loisi mongangale. Modjɔ mo ediiti nongo na mobeko momɔti mosa loloma loputoane iya ko losaka taka eka e bobala.» Ngɔngɔ dji bobala iboa, ayanedja bato.<verse eid="ACT 19:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s1">Mɔɔngɔ mo Polo ta Masedoane ko ta Gɛlɛse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Ehole esia mongangale, Polo abolea batingami ngɔngɔ dji bobapingedja, abaisea ndese e suka ko aso akɛɛ ta Masedoane. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Alekedja ta ekenge emina e mokili ko iho apingedja badhimi ngɔngɔ djimina akɛɛ ta Gɛlɛse <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />iho akɔɔ songe basato. Apalaka akwee ta masuwa bɛngi akɛe ta Sili endelo ta tina e kopolo ekɔɔ Bayudha ta tina e nde, iboa atomba meko e bosɔmbɔ ta Masedoane. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Sopatɛlɛ, mwana moomi o Pilisi, o Bele, akɛɛ na nde ndjea emɔti, na Alisitalake na Sekundusi o Tesalonike, Gaiusi, o Dɛlɛbe, Timote, ko na Tisike na Tolopime bato ba ekenge e mokili mo Adjia. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Bato ibibi basua boso ko baloamba ta Toloasi. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Ta tina e biso, ngɔngɔ dji tɛkɛ e mapa ma pɛpɛ levile, lokwea ta masuwa ta Pilipe ngɔngɔ dji masu matano, lobatanea ta Toloasi iho lokɔɔ eyenga mobimba.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Polo asukedji bokɛɛ ta Tolaosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Isu di mbangi di eyenga loputoana bɛngi lobuke ipa. Polo adaaka na mbuno e bodala ngɔngɔ dji busa bomɔti, asolaka na iputo. Ko atuba molɔkɔ tee mbunoko ta nanda e bulu. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Milinda midaka minɛnɛ iho ta ekenge e ndako e diko edaka iso loboli. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Enakoboa mwenga omɔti na kombe Yutuku adaaka na mobondo ta ininisi. Awɛɛkɛ hiɔ na ngulu mɛnɛ iyana atubanaka Polo molɔkɔ; ta ndanda e hiɔ apinoa iho ta ndako e ekpalaka e basato odiko ko akwa ko aso agwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Iboa Polo aso atita ko angulama ko amopea ta mɔmɔ ko abala bo: «Pɛpɛ bobanganioko: adii na bomɔ!» <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Ehole asɔmbɔ Polo boiwea o diko, akabana mapa ko bayaka. Ngɔngɔ asombɔ bobala naikina tee mbunoko ehuma, aso akɛɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Batomba mwenga iyona mohelake ko modjɔ momina moso mobapingedja bobuke mɛnɛ.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɔɔngɔ mo Toloasi ko ta Milɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Lokɛɛ boso bɛngi lotitee ta masuwa ko loso lokɛɛ ta Asosi, ta polo ebwanaka iso botomba Polo ta ibongu. iyene edii meko etomba iyo, modjɔ mo apalaka akɛe ta Asosi na mako. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Ehole elotanea iyo ta Asosi, loomotomba ta masuwa bɛngi lokɛe ta Mitilɛni. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Lodonga ena, lokɛɛ ko loimea ta boso bo Kio aya busa. Ngɔngɔ dji busa bomɔti, loimea ta Samosi, ko aya busa ibua bokina loimea ta Milɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Modjɔ mo Polo atomba meko e bonɔɔ boso ta Epeso na pɛpɛ bonɔdjɔ ngonga ta ekenge e mokili mo Adjia. Asasweyaka bɛngi ekabɔngɔ aimee ta Yelusalɛmɛ ta busa bo Patekote.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Polo abali na basuku ba Epeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Polo aloma bwɛndi ta Milɛ aloma bwɛndi ta Epeso bɛngi babee basuku ba Ekelesa. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Ndelo eimea bo mbuti na nde, abala na bu bo: «Odjebekadeani bopele mɛnɛ mondumba mohelama mbi na nu ehole esusu, banga busa bo mbi bo mbangi boimea mbi ta ekenge e mokili mo Adjia. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Nasalea Kumu na bosatitedja bosusu, na mbisoli ko na minɔngɔ miɛnɛ mbi ta tina e kopolo dji Bayudha. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Enakoboa naibomba nongo modjɔ momɔti modaaka na tɛtɔ ta tina e bino: naotɔndeani ko naolehani midjɔ misusu, ta miso ma bato ko na ta ndako dji bino. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Nabea Bayudha ko na bato badaaka pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha bahombedje milema mi bobo ta dii Ndjakomba ko badhime Kumu o biso Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Ko edɛdiyeye, nakɛi ta Yelusalɛmɛ, mondumba molindakadeani Mwembo nakɔe, ko na bosi midjɔ mikɔmɔdea na mbi iho. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Nadjebadea bo, engi ngando enɛnɛ, Mwembo Mosɛnɔke motɔndeakadeani bo bɔlɔkɔ ko na minɔngɔ miambakadeani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 21:4.11.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Naɛnɛkɛdea bomɔ bo mbi eka ngasa; etungi na mbi bokɛɛ mbunoko ta suka e elomu e mbi ko bosidja mosala mopani Kumu Yesu: botɔndea Bwɛndi Bopele bo ngɔlu e Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 2 Tim 4:7.</char></note>.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />«Nanɔɔ ta tei e bino alehe Bokumu bo Ndjakomba, endelo nadjebakadea edɛdiyeye bo pɛpɛ nongo omɔti o bino oɛnɛdeani. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Na tina emina naotɔndeakadeani busabubu bo: omɔti o bino akabunga, makiya ma nde mabakiti ta molo mo mbi. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Modjɔ mo naotɔndeani mbuno esusu e Ndjakomba, na pɛpɛ mbombi. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Sabaneanani ko na bhata ibia baopani Mwembo Mosɛnɔke obabaneeni. Baneani Ekelesa iyena edia Ndjakomba ta tina e yogo e Mwana o nde mɛnɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Mbi nadjebakadea ngɔngɔ dji bokɛɛ bo mbi swa ba bobila bakweyadea ta tei e bino ko batabaneadea bhata. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Na nongo ta tei e bino, bato bakina babaladea midjɔ mi bokuta bɛngi batube badhimi babakimane. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Iboa toma sɛndjɛlɛni ko lɛdjɛni bo, bianga bisato itombo, bulu na moi naikina bokebedjani omɔti omɔti o bino edae ta tei e biyo.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />«Ko edɛdiyeye naopini na Ndjakomba ko na mobalo mo ngɔlu e nde. Adii na bokondji bobodaledjani boso ta edhimeli ko boboopani mapele madedja iyo tina ibia basusu badii ba nde. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Naihomba eka e moto, edae palanga, wolo kaoko esendja e moto. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Ino bɛnɛ odjebakadeani bo nasalaka na mɔmɔ ma mbi mɛnɛ bɛngi mbi na bato badalaka na mbi lobolodje eka ekambaka na su<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20, 34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 18:3.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Naoinedjani na bosusu bo etungi osaleni bɛngi okamoeni bakwali, ta bolɛnɛ mobalo mobala Kumu Yesu iyo mɛnɛ bo: “Bokaba bonɔi bodia na mongandi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20, 35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mobalo imu mo Yesu moibombama ta mɛndi mapele.</char></note>!” »<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Ngɔngɔ dji bobala iboa badaa ibo basusu na magbunda ko aangɔnɔ. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Ibo basusu bayeaka ko basadumba ta dɔli di Polo ko bamodingaka ekɔpi. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Badaaka mɛnɛ na ndjokwa modjɔ mo abalaka bo batamoɛnɛdea naikina. Ngɔngɔ djimina badala na nde engbanga mbunoko ta masuwa.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s1">Polo akɛi ta Yelusalɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Ngɔngɔ dji biso bobɔtɔ na bu, lokwea ta masuwa ko lokɛɛ mbala emɔti ta Kosi; ko ngɔngɔ dji isu imɔti loso loimea ta Lodɛsi, lokina ena ko loimea ta Patala. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Iho lotanea masuwa mamɔti mapalaka bokɛɛ ta Penisi; loso lokwea ko lokɛɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Ehole eimea iso mbuti na Sipele, lokina esanga emina ta dɔɔngɔ di ebɔ e bali ko lotindoa ta Sili. Lotita ta Tile ta polo ebwanaka masuwa bodubodja leka lodaaka otei. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Iho lotanea batingami ko lokɔɔ na bu ena masu sambo. Enakoboa batingami balomama na Mwembo ko batɔndea Polo bo adae pɛpɛ bokɛɛ ta Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Ndelo ekoka masu ma biso ma bodaa iyana, loso lodonga ena. Lodala ko batingami basusu bali na bami bakɛkɛ alosukedja, mbunoko ta sokolu e ngando enɛnɛ. Lodaa magbunda iso basusu ta mokula modua enɛnɛ ko loangɔnɔ. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Ko ngɔngɔ dji bosaiseana ndese e suka, lokwea ta masuwa, ko ibo baso basɔmbɔ ta dii ibo. <verse eid="ACT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Iyana asidja iso mɔɔngɔ mo biso ta dua, lokina Tile ko lokɛɛ ta Pitolemaisi. Iho loiseana na ndenga, lokɔɔ na bu isu imɔti. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Ngɔngɔ dji busa bomɔti, lokɛɛ ko loimea ta Sedjale. Iho, lokwea ta ndako e molehi o Bwɛndi Bopele Pilipo iyona odaaka omɔti ta tei e bato sambo bahɔmɔkɔ na Ekelesa ko lodaa ena ta dii iyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sedjale: Ngando enɛnɛ e bokula bo Yudhea ta esika ekadikame gupɛlɛnɛlɛ o Loma. Pilipo: omɔti o bato sambo bahɔmɔ ta Ekelesa: boindja ta 6.5;8.5.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Adaka na bana bali banɛi ba pɛpɛ bodjeba baami batɛlɛkɛ midjɔ mi Ndjakomba. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Lodikama ena masu manɛnɛ, motɛli omɔti adonga ta Yudhea kombe e nde Agabusi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta 11.28.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Adoa ta dii iso ko atomba mosenge mo Polo asananga mako na mɔmɔ ko abala bo: «Mwembo Mosɛnɔke mobali bo: Moswa mosenge imu Bayudha ba Yelusalɛmɛ bamonangadea mbɔti mondumba imu bamokabadea ta dii bato ibia badii pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha.» <verse eid="ACT 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Ngɔngɔ dji booka mibalo mimina, iso bɛnɛ ko na denga di ngando enɛnɛ loangɔnɔ Polo adae pɛpɛ bokɛɛ ta Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Endelo Polo abasɔmbedja bo: «Oyeakadeani ko ohombakadeani botswuani molema tina nda? Nadii mbuti, ediiti oto ta tina e bonangama mbɔti endelo bogwa ta Yelusalɛmɛ ta tina e kombe e Kumu Yesu.» <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Iyana adaa iso pɛpɛ bohɔnɔ bohombedja malɛi ma nde, lokina bomopangoa ko loso lobala bo: «Kina bolulea bo Kumu bokokedjame.» <verse eid="ACT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Ngɔngɔ dji masu, lokɔɔ mosɛlingo ko loiwea ta Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Ndambo e batingami ba Sedjale bakɛɛ na su engbanga emɔti, balotomba bɛngi lodikame ta dii Manasɔni, moto o Sipele odaaka modhimi tomba ehele.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Polo aimei ta Yelusalɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Aimea iso ta Yelusalɛmɛ, denga baso baloasɔɔ na sepi. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Aya busa Polo akɛɛ engbanga emɔti na su ta dii Djake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Djake mwange Kumu, ondingo ta 12.17 ko 15.13.</char></note> ta esika eputoana basuku ba Ekelesa basusu. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Abaisea ko abatubana modjɔ momɔti na momɔti mokɔɔ Ndjakomba ta mosala mo nde ta tei e bato badii pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Ngɔngɔ dji bomohokamedja, bakumedja Ndjakomba. Ko babala na Polo bo: «Maninga, oɛnɛkɛdea, Bayudha banɛnɛ baimea bakilito: ibo basusu batingama ta Mobeko mo Mose. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Enakoboa, baoka bo wɛ olehadea Bayudha ibia badii ta bikomi basundola mobeko mo Mose; obaladea na bu bakine bolena bana ba bobo bipole ko na pɛpɛ bokimana naikina bokɔkɔ bo Bayudha. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Lokɔe bo? Sooti mɛnɛ baokadea bo wɛ osi boimea iya. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Edii bopele! Kɔɔ midjɔ misusu mibaladea iso na wɛ. Lodii iya na bato banɛi bapalakadea basidje masu ma ndikano ekɔɔ ibo ta dii Ndjakomba. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Batomba, kɛɛ na bu ndjea emɔti asasɛnodja ko baputea palanga, bɛngi bakatedje bibɛbɛlɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 18.18 ko na nase.</char></note>. Iboa bato basusu badjebadea bo midjɔ misusu miokaka ibo ta tina e wɛ midiiti mi sooti, ko baɛnɛdea bo okasume Mobeko. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Ta tina e bato badii pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha ibia baimea bakilito, lobadjebedja meko mi biso ta mokanda bo: bawaniti boyaka muni mo tito otumbei bo bikeko mbeka, edae makiya, na muni mo tio odai ibo pɛpɛ bolena dɔli, badae pɛpɛ bokɔɔ ndukeli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 15.20 ko na nase.</char></note>.» <verse eid="ACT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Iboa ngɔngɔ dji busa bomɔti, Polo atomba bato bamina, basasɛnodja na bu. Akwea ta tepelo bɛngi atɔndɔe isu di suka di bosasɛnodja ko na ehole epamadea mabondja tina e moto na moto<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ ta 1 Kol 9.20.</char></note>.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Polo apeami ta tepelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Ta mbuti na suka e masu sambo, Bayudha ba ekenge e mokili mo Adjia baɛnɛ Polo ta tepelo. Basumedja emumu e bato basusu balemoe ko bamopea, <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />bagamaka bo: «Bana ba Isalɛlɛ, doani olokamoeni! Indjani moto olehakadea bobe ta dii bato basusu ko pamba djisusu ta tina e ekomi e biso, Mobeko ko na tepelo iyeye. Ko edɛdiyeye, amei boisa pongono Bagɛlɛki ta tei e tepelo ko aimedji esika iye esɛnɔke esika e pita.» <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Modjɔ mo, baɛnɛ Tolopime o Epeso na Polo ta ngando enɛnɛ ko balɛnɛkɛ bo amokwedjaka ta tepelo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ mo 28 ko 29: boɛngɛ ta Edjek 44.7. Tolopime: boindja 20.4. </char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Mongangale mokwa ta ngando enɛnɛ esusu ko bato badoa mbango ta pamba isusu. Bapea polo ko baimana na nde sokolu e tepelo ko na mbala emɔti badipa midipe. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Ehole ehombaka ibo bamoowoe, gala eimea ta dii tilibɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tilibɛ: edii mokondji o etuluku e basodha koto ba Loma. Endelo iyaya akondjakadea etuluku e basodha mikama sambo.</char></note> Yelusalɛmɛ esusu elumaka na mongangale. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Na mbala emɔti, atomba basodha na kapita ba basodha mokama ko bakɛɛ ebango ta pamba edaka emumu e bato. Iyana aɛnɛ ibo tilibɛ na basodha, bakina boboma Polo. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Iboa tilibɛ asalinda mbuti na nde ko amotomba ko apa motindo bamonange mbɔti na mikpulu mi bibende mibae; awadja eka edaka iyo ko na doi dikɔɔ iyo. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Endelo ta tei emumu e bato, bato na bato bagamaka na mondumba mo bobo. Tilibɛ aisipoaka mɛnɛ eka emɔti ta tina e mongangale mokɔɔkɔ bo; apa mitindo bakɛe na Polo ta bopango bo basodha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bopango bo basodha bobeamaka na kombe e Atonia, botongama na Elode o Monɛnɛ ta pamba e sadiko kona dɔɔngɔ dikasame modabusa ta esika e iheme ta diko di ndako edaka ta tepelo, ekɔmedjaka bopango bo basodha ba Loma, bɔlɔkɔ ko na basodha babaneaka tepelo.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Ehole eimea Polo ta eiweli e ndako, basodha bamongɛngɛtɛ ta tina e mongangale monɛnɛ mokɔɔkɔ emumu e bato, <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />modjɔ mo boto basusu bakimanaka bagamaka bo: «Agwɛ!»<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Polo asambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Ta ndelo iyena ekɛɛkɛ bo akwedja Polo ta bopango bo basodha, awadja tilibɛ ibo: «Obwani bopani ndjea e bobala eka emɔti?» Tilibɛ amosɔmbedja bo: «Okadjebe bobala monɔkɔ mo Bagɛlɛki? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Wɛ te moto o Edjipito iyona, osumedja mongangale masu masa nɔɔ, ko otomba bato koto inɛi ta edhu ibia badaaka baneli ba bila?» <verse eid="ACT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Polo asɔmbedja bo: «Nadii Moyuda, nabotama ta Talase ngando enɛnɛ e Silisi, nadii moto o ngando emɔti enene e gala. Naoangɔni pani ndjea nabale na bato.» <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Tilibɛ aso amopa ndjea. Polo aema diko ta eiweli e ndako, ekɔmea bato embete na ebɔ bɛngi bapɔpɔne. Bato basusu bapɔpɔnɔ ko Polo abala na bu na monɔkɔ mo Baebele bo:<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />«Baningani na ba sangi bato, hokamedjani edɛdiyeye eka epalakadea mbi nasambe.» <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Iyana aokabo abala na monɔkɔ mo Baebele, bapɔpɔnɔ naikina na ngulu mɛnɛ. Iboa Polo abala bo: <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />«Nadii Moyuda nabotama ta Talase e Silisi; endelo nabɔkɔmɔ iya ta ngando enɛnɛ iye, ko molehi o mbi edaka wɛtoko Gamaliɛlɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gamaliɛlɛ: boindja ta 5.34 ko na nase.</char></note> iyona alehani bɛngi nadjebe bopele mɛnɛ mibeko mi bakɔkɔ ba biso. Nasapaka pongono mosusu na Ndjakomba oko mondumba modii ino basusu busa ibubu. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Na nɔngedja bato bakimanaka Ndjea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 9:2 ko na nase.</char></note> tee ta yogo. Napea baami na bali ko na baisa ta bɔlɔkɔ. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ ko na ikita isusu i basuku babwani bobala tati e mbi. Modjɔ mo bapani mikanda ta tina e denga di Damasi ko naso nakɛɛ iho: apea badhimi, bɛngi nakɛe na bu ta Yelusalɛmɛ bɛngi babapɛ etumbu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ mo 4-5: Boindja ta 8.3;9.1-2.</char></note>.»<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Polo atubani isolo di bosɔmbɔtɔnɔ bo nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">9, 1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26, 12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />«Nadaaka na ndjea ko naimeaka mbuti na Damasi, edikaka mweka bɛngi midi miimee, na mbala emɔti bohu bomɔti bonɛnɛ bodonga ta busa bongɛsɛɛni. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Nakwa ta kpɔtɔ ko naoka kɔpi emɔti ebalaka na mbi bo: “Saulu, Saulu, tina enɔngedjakadeani na wɛ nda?” <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Nawadja bo: “Kumu, wɛ nda?” Asɔmbedjani bo: “Nadii Yesu o Nadjalɛtɛ, iyona onɔngedjakadea wɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Bato badalaka na mbi baɛnɛ bohu, endelo baioka kɔpi e moto iyona obalaka na mbi. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Iboa nawadja bo: “Kumu, ebwani mbi bokɔɔ nde?” Ko Kumu asɔmbedjani bo: “Angɔɔ ko kɛɛ ta Damasi, iho baotɔndeadea eka esusu ebwani na wɛ bokɔɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />A bonie, miso ma mbi madimeaka na bohu ibua bongɛsɛɛkani, bato badalaka na mbi bapeani ta ebɔ ko bakɛɛ na mbi ta Damasi.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />«Enakoboa edaka na moto omɔti kombe e nde Ananiasi, moto asapaka na Ndjakomba bobwana na Mobeko iyona osakoaka Bayudha basusu badaaka ena. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Adoa mbuti na mbi, ko abala na mbi bo: “Saulu, mwange mba, kina bo osɔmbe boɛnɛ!” Oko ta ehole emina iyena, nasɔmbɔ boɛnɛ naikina. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Abakea bo: “Ndjakomba o bakɔkɔ ba biso aohɔɔ odjebe bolulea bo nde, ko oɛnɛ Moto o bodju ko ooke kɔpi e nde. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Modjɔ mo otungi bodaa temo o nde bɛngi otɔndee boso bo bato basusu eka eɛni wɛ ko eoki wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Edɛdiyeye eambakadea wɛ naikina nde? Angɔ, otombe batisimo obee kombe e Kumu bɛngi odie ekutubanedji e pekato dji wɛ.” »<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Polo atubani mondumba mo lomamaka yo ta dii bikomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />«Nasɔmbɔ ta Yelusalɛmɛ, ehole eangɔnɔkɔ mbi ta tepelo, na so nakwa na Mwembo. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Naɛnɛ Kumu abala na mbi bo: “Donga pɛpɛlɛ mɛnɛ ta Yelusalɛmɛ, modjɔ mo bato ibibi batadhimadea mɛko mibaladea wɛ ta tina e mbi.” <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Nasɔmbedja bo: “Kumu, badjebakadea bopele mɛnɛ nakweaka ta ndako dji miɔngɔnɔ dji Bayudha bɛngi na bomedje bato bakaodhimee ko na baisa ta bɔlɔkɔ. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Ko ehole esopa bo makiya ma temo, o wɛ Etsiɛni, mbi pongono nadaaka ena. Nadhimea bato ibia bamoowaka ko nabanea bisendja<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta 7.58;8.1.</char></note> bi bobo.” <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Iboa abala na mbi bo: “Kɛɛ, modjɔ mo naolomadea bohali ta dii bikomi bi bakɛndɛli!” »<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Polo na mokondji o basodha ba Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Emumu e bato bahokamedja Polo tee mbunoko ta ndelo ebala iyo mibalo mimina; ta tina emina ibo basusu bagama: «Dimodjani moto iyona! Agwɛ! Abwaniti bohelama ta kpɔtɔ idjidji!» <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Bagamaka, balakaka bisendja bi bobo ko bamaaka iduti o diko. <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Na tina emina, tilibɛ apa mitindo bakwedje Polo ta bopango bo basodha ko bomoboma mbalake ko bomoloma na ngulu abale, bɛngi badjebe tina ndani emumu e bato bagamakadea iboa tina e nde. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Endelo ehole emonanga bo bɛngi bamobome, Polo awadja kapita o basodha mokama odaaka ena bo: «Odii na bokondji boboma moto o Loma iyana odai nongo pɛpɛ bosambedjama<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta 16.37 ko na nase.</char></note>?» <verse eid="ACT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Ta ndelo eoka iyo mɛko mimina, kapita o basodha akɛɛ atɔndea tilibɛ bo: «Ebwani wɛ bokɔɔ nde? Moto iyo adii o Loma!» <verse eid="ACT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Tilibɛ amowadja bo: «Tɔndeani, odii mɛnɛ moto o Loma?» Polo asɔmbedja bo: «Okoboa». <verse eid="ACT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Iboa Tilibɛ abala bo: «Naputa palanga djinɛnɛ bɛngi naimee moto o Loma.» Ko Polo asɔmbedja bo: «Mbi nabotama moto o Loma.» <verse eid="ACT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Na mbala emɔti, bato ibia bapalaka bamobome badonga mbuti na nde; tilibɛ iyo mɛnɛ aoka bɔɔ, ehole edjeba iyo bo Polo adaaka moto o Loma modjɔ mo amonanga mbɔti.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Polo boso bo Ikita inɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Aya busa, tilibɛ apalaka adjebe bopele mɛnɛ eka epunda na Bayudha Polo, abala bamolodje mbɔti ko apa mitindo ta dii banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ko na Ikita dinɛnɛ disusu baputoane. Ngɔngɔ djimina atomba Polo ko amosambedja ta boso bo bobo.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Polo atingea miso ma nde ta dii bato ba Ikita dinɛnɛ ko abala bo: «Denga di mba, ta tina e mbi, nasakɔndɔkɔdea boso bo Ndjakomba na molema momɔti mbunoko busa ibubu.» <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ Ananiasi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ananiasi adaaka nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ tomba yanga e 47 mbunoko ta yanga e 59.</char></note> apa mitindo ta dii bato ibia badaaka mbuti na Polo bamobome ta monɔkɔ. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Iboa Polo amotɔndea bo: «Ndjakomba moto obomadea, ekuka eyou epu esuoi bo mokobo mopu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bikuka bi bato ba Palesitine djidaka na mokobo mopu bɛngi bato bakadala na bulu badae pɛpɛ bolana, mondumba momɔti mobala ibo tina e makila ta bwɛndi bopele bo Matai. 23.27-28. Mokobo mopu: etingodji bo moto mobe.</char></note>! Odii ena bɛngi osambedjeni bobwala na mibeko, endelo obuki mobeko, asapa wɛ mitindo babomeni.» <verse eid="ACT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Bato badaaka mbuti na Polo babala na nde bo: «Osingakadea nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ!» <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Polo asɔmbedja bo: «Denga di mba, nadjebakiti, bo edii wɛtoko nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ. Modjɔ mo, Makomi mabalakadea bo: “Obwaniti bobala bobe na mobanei o bato ba wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boi 22:27.</char></note>!” » <verse eid="ACT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Polo adjebaka bo bato ba Ikita badaaka ta iputo di Basadukai ko na iputo di Bapalisai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta 26:5; Pil 3:5.</char></note>, ta tina emina agama boso bo bobo bo: «Baningani nadii Mopalisai mwana o Bapalisai. Nasambedjakadea oko elɔkee elɛndɛ e biso ta modjɔ moindji bosisoa ta bogwa.» <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Ehole ema iyo bala iboa Bapalisai na Basadukai babanga boisana kitɛ, ko ibolea iso ibɔtɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Modjɔ mo Basadukai bakadhime bo bosisoa ta bogwa bodiiti ko bakabale obwɛndi adiiti, mwembo midiiti, enakoboa Bapalisai bakadhime midjɔ imia misusu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta Mat 22:23; Mal 12:18; Luk 20:27.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Bagama na ngulu ko ndambo e balehi ba mobeko, ba iputo di Bapalisai baema ko baboma kitɛ na kɛlɛ esusu babala bo: «Lotaɛnɛkɛdea nongo bobe bomɔti ta tei e moto iyo. Ehole ekina mwembo kaoko obwɛndi amobalei!» <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Iyana anɛngɛ mongangale, tilibɛ aso abanga basaka kwɛlɛkɛkɛ Polo. Ta tina emina apa mitindo ta dii basodha bakɛe ta ibolea atinoa Polo ta mabɔ ma bobo ko bamohuledja ta bopango bo basodha. <verse eid="ACT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Ta bulu bomina Kumu asɛnɛmedja na Polo ko abala na nde bo: «Sapingedja! oko mondumba mosabala wɛ tati e mbi iya ta Yelusalɛmɛ, etungi pongono okɛe na tati emina ta Loma.»<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inginda tina e boowa Polo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Ngɔngɔ dji ehuma e busa bomɔti, Bayudha bomɔti bakɔɔ inginda: bakata seleka badae pɛpɛ boyaka ko na bomwaka boso bo boowa Polo. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Bato ibia bakɔɔkɔ kopolo badaaka diko di tuku inɛi. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Bakɛɛ ta dii banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ko na basuku, ko babala na bu bo: «Iso lokati seleka bo lotayaka mbunoko ehole eowadea iso Polo. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Iboa edɛdiyeye okanani na bato ba Ikita dinɛnɛ, sɛngɛɛni tilibɛ aolwɛeni Polo, kɔɔni ondingo opalakadeani boindja modjɔ mo nde naikina bopele. Ta tina e biso losi bosabwanedja ehele bɛngi lomoowoe boso bo nde boimea iya.» <verse eid="ACT 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Endelo mwana moomi o ngɛnɛ e Polo, aoka bakɔɔ inginda imina. Akɛɛ ta bopango bo basodha, akwea o tei ko atɔndea Polo. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Iboa Polo abea omɔti o bakapita ba basodha mokama ko abala nde bo: «Tomba mwenga iyo okɛe na nde ta dii tilibɛ adii na modjɔ momɔti mo bomotɔndea.» <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Kapita o basodha amotomba ko akɛɛ na nde ta dii tilibɛ ko amotɔndea bo: «Polo moto bɔlɔkɔ asɛngɛini naolwɛe mwenga iyo adii na modjɔ momɔti mo botɔndea.» <verse eid="ACT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Tilibɛ apea mwenga ta ebɔ akɛɛ na nde ngungusa ko amowadja bo: «Epalakadea wɛ otɔdeeni nde?» <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Amosɔmbedja bo: «Bayudha baokani baosɛngɛe okɛɛ na Polo puma boso bo Ikita dinɛnɛ, bakɔe ondingo baidjakadea naikina modjɔ mo nde bopele. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Endelo pɛpɛ bobadhimea! Modjɔ mo bato bonɔ tuku inɛi ta tei e bobo bamopikeadea elambo. Bakati seleka badae pɛpɛ boyaka ko na bomwaka boso bo bomoowa. Edɛdiyeye basi bosabwanedja ehele ko baambakadea oto bopala bo wɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Tilibɛ amosia bo adae pɛpɛ botɔndea nongo moto omɔti, ngɔngɔ imina amoyanedja.<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Polo alomami ta dii gupɛlɛnɛlɛ Pelikisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Tilibɛ abea kapita ba basodha mokama ba nde babae ko abala na bu bo: «Putoanedjani basodha mikama mibae, ko ibia bakadaledje punda tuku sambo ko na basodha mikama mibae ba makɔngɔ, ko daani mbuti na bokɛɛ ta Sedjale ta ngonga e ibua e mɔkɔmɔkɔ. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Bɔngedjani pongono punda tina e botomba Polo bɛngi aimee ta dii gupɛlɛnɛ Pelikisi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Atonuisi Pelikisi adaaka gupɛlɛnɛlɛ o Yudhea ta pakasa e yanga e 52 ko na 59 (kaoko e 60).</char></note> na pɛpɛ nongo bomokɔɔ bobe bomɔti.» <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Na boa aso akoma mokanda bo: <verse eid="ACT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />«Mokumi gupɛlɛnɛlɛ Pelikisi, asɔɔ ndese edongi ta dii mbi Kolode Lisiasi. <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Moto iyo Bayudha bamopea bahombakabi bamoowoe, ko amabi mbi oka bo adii moto o Loma: nadoa na basodha ba mbi ko namotingoabi. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />A bo napalakabi nadjebe tina e mopunda na bu, nakɛɛkɛbi na nde boso bo Ikita i bobo dinɛnɛ. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Nadoi aɛnɛ bo bamopunadaaka ta tina etingi na mibeko mi bobo bɛnɛ, endelo modjɔ mɛnɛ moidaka na tina ebwani na nde bogwa kaoko bokwea ta bɔlɔkɔ. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Ngɔngɔ nadoi aoka bo Bayudha bamokaneakadea; na mbala emɔti natombi meko e bomoloma ta dii wɛ ko nasɛngɛi ta dii bato bamopundaka tomba ikambo i bobo na nde ta dii wɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Bobwana na mitindo midiaka basodha: baso batomba Polo na bulu ko bakɛɛ na nde ta Atipatilisi. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Aya busa, basodha ibia badalaka na mako basɔmbɔ ta kaa dji bobo ko bakina basodha ibia badalaka na punda bakɛe na Polo. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Ta ehole eimea bo ta Sedjale, basodha badalaka na punda bapa gupɛlɛnɛlɛ mokanda ko bamoinedja Polo. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Ngɔngɔ dji bolanga mokanda, gupɛlɛnɛlɛ awadja ekenge e mokili e botama Polo. Adjeba bo adaaka moto o Silisi, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />amotɔndea bo: «Naowadjadea oko ndelo eimeadea bato ibia baopundi.» Ko apa motindo babanee Polo ta ndako<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndako emina etongamaka ta Sedjale na Elode o Monɛnɛ ko ehɔɔmɔkɔ ondingo esika edikamaka bagupɛlɛnɛlɛ ba Loma.</char></note> e Elode.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s1">Polo boso bo gupɛlɛnɛlɛ Pelikisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Ngɔngɔ dji masu matano, Ananiasi, nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ atita ta Sedjale na ndambo e basuku ko na mbaeli omɔti, kombe e nde Tɛlɛtulusi. Apunda Polo ta dii gupɛlɛnɛlɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta 23:24 ko na nase.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Babea Polo ko Tɛlɛtulusi amopunda bo: «Mokondji, lokadaa na bogo edii tina e wɛ, modjɔ mo obɔngedjakadea midjɔ misusu mi ekomi e biso. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Mokumi Pelikisi, loopi misakoa minɛnɛ ta tina e midjɔ minɛnɛ misusu mikabolodje iso ndelo esusu pamba na pamba. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Endelo nitapalakadea bonɔdjɔ ngonga e wɛ, na tina emina nasɛngɛkɛdea ngɔlu ta dii wɛ olohokamedje moo mweka. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Modjɔ mo iso loɛni bo moto iyo anɔi bobe: aisakadea mongangale ta dii Bayudha basusu ta ngondo mobimba, adii mokondji o iputo di bato ba Nadjalɛtɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta Mat 2:23 ko na nase.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Ameka bosɛtodja tepelo. Ko loso lomopea. [Lopalaka lomosambedje bobwana na mibeko mi biso, <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />endelo tilibɛ Lisiasi akwea ta modjɔ momina ko amokatoa ta mabɔ ma biso na ngulu. <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Ko Lisiasi apa mitindo lodoe amopunda ta dii wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ikomi edjidji idii ta tei e kolosɛ ta suka e molɔngɔ mokɛkɛ 6 ta mbangi e molɔngɔ mokɛkɛ mo 8, modiiti ta mikanda minɛnɛ miyou.</char></note>.] Okamadea wadja moto iyo, odjebadea tina e midjɔ mimopundakadea na su.» <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Bayudha baisa mɔmɔ ta pundi emina ko badhimedja bo edaka sooti.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Polo asambi boso bo Pelikisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Gupɛlɛnɛlɛ akɔɔ Polo embete bɛngi abale ko aso abala bo: «Nadjebakadea bo okɔi bianga binɛnɛ ta mosala mo djudji ta ekomi e biso; nasambakadea ta boso bo wɛ na pɛpɛ bɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Wɛ mɛnɛ kutu obwani bokɔtɔlɔ, enɔi masu doomi na mabae naiweakabi ta Yelusalɛmɛ akumea Ndjakomba. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti otaneani ta tepelo, ta ndako e miɔngɔnɔ e Bayudha, ko na ta ngando enɛnɛ, naisana kitɛ na moto omɔti kaoko naisa sumedja bakɔe monganga nongo mbala emɔti ta tei e emumu e bato. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Bato ibibi babwaniti nongo boinedja embete emɔti ta modjɔ imu mopundakadeani na bu. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Ta tina emina, nadhimakadea ta boso bo wɛ bo: nakasalee Ndjakomba o bakɔkɔ ba biso ta Ndjea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta 9:2 ko na nase.</char></note> iyena ebalakadea bo ebe; ko nakadhime midjɔ misusu mikomama ta Mobeko ko na buku dji Batɛli. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Mbi na bu lodii na elɛndɛ ta dii Ndjakomba bo, bato ba bodju na bato babe, basisoabi ta bogwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Dan 12.2.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Ta tina emina mbi pongono nakɔkɔdea na ngulu bɛngi na dae na molema mosɛnɔke ta boso bo Ndjakomba ko ta boso bo bato.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />«Ta ngɔngɔ dji bianga binɛnɛ, nadoa ta ekomi e mbi tina e bokamoa bakwali ko bopa mabondja. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Iyana ataneani bo ta tepelo edaka ta ehole e bosasɛnodja bo mbi: bato baidaka banɛnɛ ko mongangale moidaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ mo 17-18: boindja 21: 17-28.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Ebwani bodaa wɛtoko ndambo e Bayudha ba ekenge e mokili mo Adjia badaaka ena ko edii ibo bato babwanaki bopundani ta dii wɛ, iyana adaaka ibo na modjɔ momɔti mobe tina e mbi. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Kaoko, bato ibibi, batɔndee modjɔ mobe moɛni bo ehole esambaki mbi ta boso bo Ikita dinɛnɛ. <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />Dongedja oko kɔpi emɔti egamabi mbi ena naemi diko ta ndanda e bobo bo: “Osambedjakadeanini boso bo bino<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 23:6.</char></note> oko elɔkɔe nakadhime bo bato bagwa basisoabi!” » <verse eid="ACT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Pelikisi iyo adjebaka bopele mɛnɛ modjɔ mo Ndjea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta 9:2 ko na nase.</char></note>, iboa alindaka modjɔ momina ngɔngɔ ko abala na bu bo: «Ehole etitabi tilibɛ Lisiasi, nakatabi modjɔ mo bino.» <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Apa mitindo ta dii kapita o basodha mokama asɛndjɛle Polo ta bɔlɔkɔ, ko na bokinea moo enɔli ko na bopa ndjea ta dii bato ba nde ibia babwanaka bomokɔmedja.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Polo boso bo Pelikisi ko na Dulisile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Ngɔngɔ dji masu Pelikisi adoa na mwali o nde Dulisile<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pelikisi: boindja 23:24 ko na nase. Dilusile: mwana mwali o suka o mokondji Elode Agilipa (boindja ta 12:1); Pelikisi amokatoa ta dii moomi o nde o boso, mokondji o Emɛse.</char></note>, iyona odaaka Moyudha. Aloma bahombe Polo ko amohokamedja abalaka iyo tina etingi na edhimeli ta dii Yesu Kilito. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Endelo iyana abalaka Polo ta tina e bohelama ta bodju, na mondumba mo bosagbindea ko na sambi ekɛkɛdea adoe, Pelikisi aluma na bɔɔ ko abala na nde bo: «Edɛdiyeye obwani bopeta kɛɛ naolɛdjedjadea ngɔngɔ nakadiadea ngonga.» <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Alɛndɛkɛ bo Polo abwani bomopa palanga; Ta tina emina amobeaka mandɛli mandɛli bɛngi basolake. <verse eid="ACT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Enɔɔ bianga bibae, Pɔlɔsiusi Pesitusi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pɔlɔsiusi Pisitusi amea gupɛlɛnɛnɛ o Yudhea ta yanga e 59 kaoko 60.</char></note> atitana Pelikisi. Iyo apalaka bosepedja Bayudha, akina Polo oko ta bɔlɔkɔ.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s1">Polo awadji asambedjame na Kaisala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Ngɔngɔ dji masu masato iyana aimea iyo ta ekenge e mokili, Pesitusi adonga ta Sedjale ko akɛɛ ta Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ko na bakumu ba Bayudha bapunda Polo ta dii yo. Bamowadja na ingbangba bo <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />abakɔmedje na boloma Polo ta Yelusalɛmɛ; modjɔ mo bakɔɔkɔ inginda imɔti ta tina e nde ko bapalaka bamoowoe na ndjea. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Endelo Pesitusi abasɔmbedja bo Polo adaaka ta bɔlɔkɔ ta Sedjale ko iyo mɛnɛ apalakadea asɔmbe iho. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Abakea bo: «Kina bo bakondji ba bino bakɛe na mbi engbanga emɔti ta Sedjale bakɛe apunda moto omina iho, ekadaa bo akɔɔ modjɔ momɔti mobe.» <verse eid="ACT 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Pesitusi akɔɔ ta dii ibo oto masu bomwambe kaoko doomi, ko atita ta Sedjale. Aya busa, adaa ta kiti e nde ekataka iyo makambo ko apa mitindo badoe na Polo. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Iyana aimea iyo, Bayudha ibia batitaka donga ta Yelusalɛmɛ bamohika ko bamopunda pundi djinɛnɛ djinɔɔke djidaka na pɛpɛ mwɛngi mo bosamba. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Endelo Polo asamba ko abala bo: «Nakɔɔti nongo modjɔ momɔti mobe, edae ta tei e mibeko mi Bayudha, edae ta tina e tepelo, edae ta tina e Kaisala.» <verse eid="ACT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Abo Pesitusi apalaka bosepedja Bayudha, awadja Polo bo: «Opalakadea oiwee ta Yelusalɛmɛ asamba ta tina e modjɔ momina iho ta dii mbi?» <verse eid="ACT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Polo asɔmbedja bo: «Na dii ta boso bo sambi e Kaisala ko asambadea mbi oko ena. Nakɔmeiti Bayudha nongo bobe bomɔti, wɛ mɛnɛ kutu odjebakadea bopele mɛnɛ. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Ekadaa bo nakɔi bobe ko nakakɔɔ bobe bobwani na yogo, natalonakadea bogwa. Endelo ekadaa midjɔ mipundakadeani na bu midiiti sooti, pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti obwani bokabani ta dii ibo. Nasɛngɛi ta dii Kaisala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nakasɛngɛɛ ta dii Kaisala: einedjakadea bo nasɛngɛi nasambe ta dii Kaisala, ta Loma.</char></note> akate ikambo i mbi.» <verse eid="ACT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Iboa, ngɔngɔ dji Pesitusi bosolana na bato ba nde bakamopɛ bileho, abala bo: «A bo osɛngɛi osambe ta dii Kaisala, okɛɛdea ta dii Kaisala.»<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Polo boso bo Agilipa ko na Belenise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Ngɔngɔ dji masu, mokondji Agilipa ko na Belenise, baimea ta Sedjale bɛngi baisee Pesitusi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Agilipa: edii mokondji Agilipa o II, mwana moomi o mokondji iyona olangami ta ekenge enɛnɛ e 12. Adaka mokondji o Kalisisi, ekenge e mokili edii ta dɔɔngɔ du sadiko dji Palesitine, ko na telitoile dji mbuti. Dilusille (24:24) ko na Belenise badaaka bangɛnɛ ba nde ba bali. Pesitusi: boindja 24:27 ko na nase.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Abo bakɔɔ masu manɛnɛ ena, Pesitusi atɔndea mokondji modjɔ mo Polo abala bo: «Edii na moto omɔti iya Pelikisi amokina ta bɔlɔkɔ. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Ehole ekɛɛ mbi ta Yelusalɛmɛ, banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ko na basuku ba Bayudha bamopunda ko basɛngɛɛni namopɛ etumbu. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Mbi nabasɔmbedja bo ta momɛsɛno mo Baloma te bapɛ moto etumbu boso bo nde bosamba na moto o mopundi ta sambi. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Iboa badoa na mbi ndjea emɔti. Nainɔdjɔ ngonga, aya busa nadaa ta kiti e ekakate mbi makambo ko naloma babee moto omina. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Bapundi ba nde badoa, endelo nalɛnɛkɛ bo babwani bomodosa na midjɔ mikina minɔi mibe. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Baisanaka na nde oto kitɛ ta tina e mondumba mo bobo mo bohomba Ndjakomba o bobo bɛnɛ ko na Yesu omɔti iboa ogwa ko Polo adhimedjaka bo adii na bomɔ. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Ta tina e mbi, nitaɛnɛkɛdea nongo eka e bokɔ ta modjɔ mondumba imua, ta tina emina nabalabi na Polo aiwee ta Yelusalɛmɛ bɛngi akɛe asamba iho ta tina e modjɔ momina. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Endelo Polo asɛngɛi bo: ikambo i nde isukee oko ta dii mokondji monɛnɛ o Loma. Iboa mbi napi simbisi e bomobanea ta bɔlɔkɔ mbunoko namolome ta dii Kaisala.» <verse eid="ACT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Agilipa abala ba Pesitusi bo: «Mbi nadii na posa naoke moto omina mbi mɛnɛ.» Pesitusi asɔmbedja bo: «Omokadea puma.» <verse eid="ACT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Iboa aya busa, Belenise na Agilipa badoa na ekumu esusu ko bakwea ta ndako e sambi na bakondji ba basodha na basuku ba ngando enɛnɛ. Pesitusi, aloma babee Polo. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Iboa Pesitusi abala bo: «Mokondji Agilipa ko ino basusu ibia badii na su iya, oɛnɛkɛdeani moto iyo: Bayudha basusu ba Yelusalɛmɛ ko ba iya badoaki esayea iya ta dii mbi ta tina e moto iyo, na bogama bo abwaniti adaa ta bomɔ. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Ta tina e mbi naɛni akoiti nongo modjɔ mobwani na nde bogwa. Abonie iyo mɛnɛ asɛngei mokondji monɛnɛ o Loma akate ikambo; Natombi meko e bomoloma ta dii iyo. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Nitadjebakadea nongo eka ebwani mbi bokomea mokondji monɛnɛ o Loma ta tina e nde; ta tina emina nadoi na nde iya ta boso bo bino basusu, ko na bonɔɔ ta dii wɛ mokondji Agilipa, ngɔngɔ dji mawadja, nadie eka ebwani na mbi bokɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Modjɔ mo nitaɛnɛkɛdea tina ebwani na mbi bolomea mokondji monɛnɛ o Loma mobɔlɔkɔ na pɛpɛ bodjeba modjɔ mo mopundi na bu.»<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s1">Polo asambi boso bo Agilipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Agilipa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Agilipa: boindja 25:13 ko na nase.</char></note> abala na Polo bo: «Obwani bosamba modjɔ mo we.» Iboa Polo angɔdjɔ ebɔ ko asamba bo: <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />«Mokondji Agilipa, na dii na sepi busa ibubu bosamba ta boso bo wɛ ta tina e midjɔ misusu mipundakini na Bayudha, <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />modjɔ mo wɛ odjebakadea midaa mi Bayudha ko na mondumba mokabome bo kitɛ. Naɔngɔnɔkɔdea ohokamedjeni na molema motitake.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />«Bayudha basusu badjebakadea eka edaka bomɔ bo mbi, donga bwɛngɛ bo mbi; badjebakadea mondumba mohelama mbi ta tei e bato ba mbi ko ta Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Babwani kutu bodaa batemo ba mbi, elɔkɔ ebo badjebakadeani tomba ehele, nadaaka omɔti ta tei e iputo di Bapalisai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 23:6; Pil 3:5.</char></note> disapaka na ngulu ta mondumba mo biso mo bohomba Ndjakomba. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Nakaimea edɛdiyeye ta sambi, edii tina e bo naisi elɛndɛ ta ndikano ekɔɔ ndjakomba na bakɔkɔ ba biso. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Mbota doomi na ibae djikalɛnde djiɛnɛ bokokedjama bo ndikano emina na bosalea Ndjakomba bulu na moi. Ko mokondji Agilipa, Bayudha bapundakadeani ta tina e elɛndɛ emina! <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Ino badii iya, tina ndani obwanitini bodhima bo Ndjakomba akasisodje bato bago? <verse eid="ACT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />Mbi mɛnɛ nalɛnɛkɛ bo ebwanaka na mbi nanedje kombe e Yesu o Nadjalɛtɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Iyena edii eka ekɔɔkɔ mbi ta Yelusalɛmɛ. Naisa bato basɛnɔke banɛnɛ ta bɔlɔkɔ; bobwana na bokondji ibua bodiaka mbi ta dii banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ, mbi nadhimaka ta ehole etombamaka meko e bobaowa. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Mbala inɛnɛ nabapaka etumbu ta ndako djisusu dji miɔngɔnɔ mi Bayudha, ko nabalomaka na ngulu balone bodhima. Nadaaka na kɛlɛ na bu ko nabanɔngedjaka tee mbunoko ta ngando djinɛnɛnɛnɛ dji bakɛndɛli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molongɔ mo 9-11: boindja 8:3; 9:1-2; 22:4-5.</char></note>.»<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Polo atubani bosɔmbɔtɔnɔ bo nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">9, 1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22, 6-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />«Iyena edii mondumba mokɛɛ mbi ta Damasi na bokondji ko na elomu lopani banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Mokondji Agilipa, nadaaka na ndjea, ta ehole e midi, naɛnɛ bohu bomɔti bodongaka ta busa, bongɛsɛkɛ bonɔ modaakabusa, ko bokundakani na bato badalaka na mbi engbanga. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Iso basusu lokwa ta kpɔtɔ ko mbi naoka kɔpi ebalaka na mbi na monɔkɔ mo Baebele bo: “Saulu, Saulu, tina enɔngedjakadeani na wɛ nda? Ediiti na tina e bokɔ molo mobe ondingo ngɔmbɛ okalone bosuma mobalake mo mobanei o nde.” <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Mbi nawadja bo: “Kumu, wɛ nda?” Ko Kumu asɔmbedjani bo: “Mbi nadii Yesu iyona onɔngedjakadea wɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Endelo donga ta kpɔtɔ, ema diko. Mbi nasaɛnɛmedji na wɛ bɛngi osaleeni; odadea temo o mbi bɛngi otɔndee mondumba moɛnini na wɛ ko na midjɔ mi oinedjadea mbi naikina. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Naobaneadea pamba isusu iolomedea mbi edae ta dii Bayudha kaoko ta dii bato badii pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha. <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />Badipoa miso, badongedja ta modidi baimane ta bohu ko badongedja ta bokondji bo Satana badoe ta dii Ndjakomba. Bakamadhimeani badiadea ekutubanedji e pekato ko badie polo ta tei e bato ibia bahɔɔ Ndjakomba.” »<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Polo abali tina e mosala mo nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />«Ta tina emina, mokondji Agilipa, naimea bosuma ndjɛnɛ enɛ mbi bodonga ta busa. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Endelo nalehaka boso mɛnɛ bato ba Damasi ko na bato ba Yelusalɛmɛ, ngɔngɔ djimina bota basusu ba Yudhea ko na bato ba bikomi bikina; nabatɔndea basɔmbɔtɔne midaa ko badoe ta dii Ndjakomba ko misala mi bobo miinedje sooti mɛnɛ bo basɔmbɔtɔni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bosɔmbɔtɔnɔ: ta mohombedja mokina bosandja modaa. Boindja 9:20, 28-29; boɛngɛ Mat 3:8; Luk 3:8.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Iboa ta tina emina Bayudha bapeakabini ta tepelo ko bahombakabi baowoeni. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Endelo Ndjakomba abaneini tee mbunoko busa ibu ko nadii oko natɔndea mwako mo nde ta dii bato basusu, bobanga na bato ngasa mbunoko ta dii bakumi. Nitabalakadea modjɔ mokina, oko modjɔ mobala batɛli na Mose motungi mokɔɔme: <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />Kilito aɛnɛbi saya, asisoabi moto o boso ta tei e bato bago ko atɔndeabi bohu ta dii bato ba biso ko na bikomi bikina<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 1 Kol 15:20; Isa 42:6; 49:6.</char></note>.»<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Polo abei Agilipa ta ndjea e bodhima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Ehole edaka Polo asamba boa, Pesitusi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pesitusi: boindja ta 24:27 ko na nase.</char></note> agama bo: «Polo odii na igboma! Bodjeba bobuke bo wɛ bokɔnedji igboma!» <verse eid="ACT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Polo asɔmbedja bo: «Mokumi Pesitusi, nadiiti na igboma. Mɛko misabala mbi midii mi sooti ko midii na tɛtɔ. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Mokondji Agilipa adjebakadea midjɔ mimina misusu na tina emina namibalakadea na swueya esusu boso bo nde. Nadhimakadea bo atabungeakadea nongo eka emɔti, modjɔ mo doi dimina dibalama ta mbombi. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Wɛ mokondji Agilipa, okadhime modjɔ mobala batɛli? Nadjebakadea bo okamodhimee!» <verse eid="ACT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Agilipa abala na Polo bo: «Ediki mweka ohombedje malɛno ma mbi tina e boimea mokilito?» <verse eid="ACT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Polo asɔmbedja bo: «Ekadika ehole ekɛkɛ kaoko ehole eyai, naangɔnɔkɔdea Ndjakomba ta tina e wɛ ko na ino basusu ibia bahokamedjakadeani busa ibubu, oimeeni ondingo mbi, dongedja oko mikpulu mi bibende imi minangini na bu!» <verse eid="ACT 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Iboa mokondji, gupɛlɛnɛlɛ, Belenise ko na bato basusu ibia badaaka na bu, baangɔ <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />ko basatuba ngungusa, basabaleana bo: «Moto iyo aikɔ nongo bobe bomɔti bobwani na nde bogwa kaoko bokwea ta bɔlɔkɔ.» <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Ko Agilipa abala na Pesitusi bo: «Aso adaa pɛpɛ bosɛngɛ Kaisala akate ikambo di nde bakaki motingoa.»<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s1">Polo alomami ta Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Iyana atomba bo meko e bo lokɛkɛdea na masuwa ta Itali, bapa Polo na bato bakina ba bɔlɔkɔ ta mabɔ ma kapita o basodha mokama kombe e nde Djuliusi, ta tei etukuluku e basodha ba Loma ebeamaka «etukuluku e Ogisite.» <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Lotitea ta masuwa madonga ta ngando enɛnɛ e Adalamite<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Adalamite: edii ngando enɛnɛ ta dɔngɔ ta bokula bo ekenge e mokili mo Adjia o Mokɛkɛ, mbuti na Toloasi. </char></note>, imia makɛɛkɛ asɛmɛe ta mabongu ma ekenge e mokili mo Adjia. Alisitalake, moto o Masedoane e Tesalonike, adaaka na su engbanga. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Aya busa, loimea ta Sidona. Djuliusi okɔmeaka Polo bopele, amopa ndjea e bokɛɛ ta dii binande bɛngi adie losusu lodaaka na nde na posa. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Lokina ena, lonɔɔ mbuti na esanga e Sipele, modjɔ mo mopɛpɛ modaaka moalosɔmbedja ngɔngɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Ngɔngɔ dji bomela dua enɛnɛ mbuti na Silisi ko na Papili, loso loimea ta Mila, ta ekenge e mokili mo Lisia. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Iyana, kapita o basodha mokama ba Loma atanea masuwa mamɔti ma Alɛkɛdjandili makɛɛkɛ ta Itali ko aso alokwedja ta tei e mu. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Masu manɛnɛ, masuwa madalaka bopɛtɛ bopɛtɛ ko loimea mbuti na Kinide na ikamba mɛnɛ. Abo mopɛpɛ mooloyekeaka, lonɔɔ ta dɔɔngɔ di Salamone ta satina dji esanga e Kɛlɛte ta esika edaka pɛpɛ bodaa na mopɛpɛ monɛnɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Iho lodala oko na ikamba ko loimea ta polo emɔti ekabee bo Mabongu Mapele, mbuti na ngando enɛnɛ e Ladje. <verse eid="ACT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Lonɔdjɔ ehole enɛnɛ, ko bodala na masuwa eimeaka naikina bopipo, modjɔ mo isu di Mongilo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mongilo mo ehole e piɔ: kombe ekina e tɛkɛ e Bayudha e ekutubanedji e pekato, iyena etumbaka nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ mbeka ta tina e pekato dji bana ba Isalɛlɛ (boindja ta Lew 16:29-30). Ekɔmɔkɔ ta songe o ibuwa, kaoko ta mbangi e songe o doomi ta ehole eimeaka mɛɛngɔ mi dua na mongangale.</char></note> di ehole e piɔ esiaka bonɔ. Ta tina emina Polo akebedja bato bo: <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />«Denga i mba, naɛnɛkɛdea mɔngɔ imu modii mopipo: masuwa na leka ilu lodii otei lobehadea na iso pongono lobwani bogwa.» <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Endelo kapita o basodha alona booka monɔkɔ mo Polo aoka monɔkɔ mo modaledji o masuwa na moswa masuwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Abonie ibongu dimina iidaka ipele ta tina e bodaa ta ehole e piɔ, ta tina emina bato banɛnɛ batomba meko e bodonga iyana bapalaka ekabɔngɔ baimee ta Penikisi, ibongu imɔti di Kɛlɛte iyɛlɛmɛni na dɔɔngɔ di satina dikasaame modaakabusa ko na dɔɔngɔ du sadiko ta pamba ekasaame modaakabusa, bɛngi badae iho ta ehole e piɔ.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pwea ko na bodinda bo masuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Epoi poi e dɔɔngɔ di satina ebanga boboma, bato ba masuwa balɛnɛ bo babwanaka bokokedja midjɔ mipalaka bo bokɔɔ. Bangɔdjɔ longo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Longo: edii ebende e mandi ekadumbe ibo ta madiba bɛngi emedjake bwato kaoko masuwa madae pɛpɛ bodala.</char></note> ko badala baimea mɛnɛ mbuti na mokula mo Kɛlɛte. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Ekahia ngɔngɔ dji moo ehole mokɛkɛ, pwea emɔti edonga ta ngomba dji esanga kombe e yu «elakilɔni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elakilɔni: mopɛpɛ mo sadiko ta dɔɔngɔ dikaimane modaakabusa.</char></note>.» <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Mopɛpɛ mosɔmbedja masuwa ngɔngɔ: mwɛngi mo boana na mu moiboloa ko loso lokina molodaledje. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Lonɔɔ a dɔngɔ di moesanga omɔti na kombe Koda, iye elobaneaka ta mopɛpɛ. Iboa loso lohela wɛtoko na bwato ibua bokakalee ibo bɛngi boheledje bato ta ndelo e ikama. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Boto ba masuwa baetuba ta okula, ko baso baenanga na ngɔli djipele bɛngi mbonge edae pɛpɛ boebuka. Abo badaaka babanga bolana na djɛlɔ ta dɔɔngɔ di Silite, batitedja longo etepaki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Longo e tepaki: edii ekenge e mole e mandi ekadae ta masuwa ko ekakamoe mosuwa bɛngi makimanake ndjea e mopɛpɛ.</char></note> ko basakina mopɛpɛ mobadaledje. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Enakoboa pwea ebomaka na ngulu mɛnɛ a mɛti na bo, aya busa, babanga bodumba leka ta madiba <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />ko, ta busa bo basato, badumba na mɔmɔ ma bobo bɛnɛ leka losusu lodaledjaka masuwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Masu manɛnɛ, loiɛnɛkɛ modaakabusa, loiɛnɛkɛ djɔtɔ ko pwea edaka eaboma oko na ngulu. Loilɛndɛkɛ naikina mohelo. <verse eid="ACT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Enɔɔkɔ masu manɛnɛ pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti oyakaka. Iboa, Polo aema boso bo bobo ko abala na bu bo: «Dengani osokeanini ndelo ebalaki mbi na nu bo lodae pɛpɛ bokina Kɛlɛte; ka leka lobwanakiti loname. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Endelo edɛdiyeye, nabalakadea na nu sapingedjani, modjɔ mo pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti obungedjadea bomɔ; egwadea oto masuwa imo mɛnɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Modjɔ mo, nadii oo Ndjakomba, iyona okasalee mbi ko alomeakini obwɛndi o nde na bulu <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />ko abala na mbi bo: “Polo, pɛpɛ bobanga! Etungi na wɛ boema boso bo Kaisala, ko Ndjakomba aheledjadea bato basusu ibibi badii na wɛ ta masuwa.” <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Sambingedjani denga i mba, modjɔ mo naisakadea molema mo mbi ta dii Ndjakomba: edadea oko mondumba mobali iyo na mbi. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Endelo lotungi lokwɛe ta dɔɔngɔ di esanga emɔti.» <verse eid="ACT 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Ngɔngɔ dji biyenga bibae na bulu pwea edaka oko ealoloma ta dua enɛnɛ e Adiliatike. Ta ndanda e bulu bato ba masuwa balɛnɛkɛ bo loimei mbuti na ngondo. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Basɔngɛ ko baɛnɛ edaka na ba mɛtɛlɛ tuku isato na sambo; basalinda mweka basɔngɛ naikina ko baɛnɛ mɛtɛlɛ tuku djibae na bomwambe. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Babangaka masuwa masalana na mabanga, ta tina emina badumba longo djinɛi ta sangɔngɔ ko bambaka busa boyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Endelo basali ba masuwa bapalaka batie; batitedja bwato bokakalee ibo ta madiba ko bakɔɔ ondingo bakɛkɛ ananga longo ta boso bo masuwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Polo abala na kapita na basodha ba nde bo: «Bato ibibi bamitadea dikama iya ta masuwa, otaheladeani.» <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Iboa basodha balena ngɔli idjia djipeaka bwato bokaleaka ibo ko bakina bokɛe. <verse eid="ACT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Boso bo busa boyɛ, Polo aloma bato basusu bayake mia, na bobala bo: «Indjani lokɔi busa ibubu masu doomi na manɛi loamba pwea esie ko otayakakadeani nongo eka emɔti. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Naolomakadeani oyakeni mia, modjɔ mo okiakini bɛngi oheleni. Pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti o bino obungedjadea nongo moswee momɔti ta molo mo nde.» <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Ngɔngɔ dji bobala iboa, atomba ipa, asakoa Ndjakomba boso bo bato basusu, ko aibuka ko abanga boyaka. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Iboa ibo basusu badia mogadjo ko baso bayaka pongono. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Iso basusu ta tei e masuwa lodaaka bato mikama mibae na tuku sambo na basamano<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27, 37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mikama mibae na tuku sambo na basamano: makina makomi madii na mikama mibae na tuku samabo na itano ko makina madii bokimana tuku sambo na basamo.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Iyana ayaka ibo moto na moto bobwana na ndja e nde, badumba mbuma dji ble ta madiba bɛngi masuwa mahahane.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Masuwa madindi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Aya busa, bato ba masuwa baiedjeba baɛnɛ bo baimea mbuti na ngondo, endelo baɛnɛ polo emɔti eakwea madiba ta djɛlɔ ko batomba meko e boemea masuwa iyana. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Batingoa mikpulu mi longo ko bamikina mikɛe ta madiba; balodja oko ta ehole emina mikpulu mi djenda. Ngɔngɔ djimina bangɔdjɔ kapo boso bo masuwa bɛngi mopɛpɛ mobalindake ta pamba e ibongu di djɛlɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Endelo baimea ta polo emɔti e djɛlɔ masuwa maso makakama. Ebɛi e masuwa e boso ebikama ta djɛlɔ ekumanaka, iboa molo mo masuwa mobukeana na mbonge. <verse eid="ACT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Basoda bapalaka baowoe bato babɔlɔkɔ, basaka tia anane. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Endelo kapita o basodha opalaka boheledja Polo, abasia badae pɛpɛ bobaowa. Apa mitindo ta dii bato ibia badjebaka bonana basasabe ta madiba boso bɛngi baimee o ngondo; <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />bakina banana na bipasa bi mabaya kaoko na bikenge bi masuwa. Na tina emina eiyena, bato basusu baso baimea o ngondo bahelake.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s1">Polo ta esanga e Malete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Iyana ahela iso, looka bo esanga emina kombe e yu Malete. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Bato ba esanga emina balokɔmea bopele mɛnɛ: abonie mbuwa adaaka akwa ko piɔ ekɔɔkɔ balanedja mosa monɛnɛ ko iso basusu lomohika ta polo eloasɔkɔ ibo. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Polo aandoa kata e ndjɛlɛ bɛngi aesabe ta mosa, endelo mombitɔ omɔti na saya e mosa aimana ko atingama na nde ta ebɔ. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Ehole eɛne bato ba esanga emina ndjɔ atingi na Polo ta ebɔ, basabaleana bo: «Sooti mɛnɛ moto iyo adii mooweli o bato, modjɔ mo na nongo asahela iyo ta dua enɛnɛ bodju bo Ndjakomba batamopakadea ndjea bo ahelame.» <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Endelo Polo apukusa ebɔ ende ndjɔ akwa ta mosa ko aioka nongo saya emɔti. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Ibo baambaka baɛnɛ ahaloe kaoko akwɛe mbala emɔti ko agwɛ. Endelo batukea tee ko baiɛnɛ nongo modjɔ momɔti mobe bokɔmɔ na nde; basandja malɛno babala bo adaaka ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 14:11.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Mbuti na esika edaka iso, edaka na kpɔtɔ dji mobanei o esanga, kombe e nde Pubiliusi, aloasɔ na bwela ko lowɛɛ ta dii iyo masu masato. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Sange e Pubiliusi adaaka asambi apekaka na pɛpɛlɛ ko na mosoa mo makia. Polo akɛɛ ta dii iyo, angɔnɔ na bomobakea mɔmɔ ko amoheledja. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, bato bakina ba esanga badaaka na bipeko badoa pongono ko bahela. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Baloinedja isuma na modumba mosusu ko ehole ekonda iso ta masuwa, balopa leka losusu lotakaka tina e mɔɔngɔ mo biso.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Polo aimei ta Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Loyeyoa ta esanga e Malete songe basato. Ngɔngɔ djiimina, lokwea ta masuwa ma Alɛkɛdjandili kombe e mu «Diosikule»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Diosikule: edii kombe e bamapasa Kasitɔlɔ na Polukisi, badjebamaka bobuke na masolo ma ba ndjakomba ba Bagɛlɛki ko bato ba dua babaɛnɛkɛ olongo babanei ba bato ba mɛɛngɔ mi dua. </char></note>, imia manɔdjɔkɔ ehole e piɔ iho. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Loimea ta ngando enɛnɛ e Silakidje iyana lodikama masu masato. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Adonga iso ena lokimana mokula bɛngi loimee ta ngando enɛnɛ e Legio. Aya busa mopɛpɛ mo satina mobanga boboma ko ngɔngɔ dji masu mabae loimea ta Pudjole. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Ta ngando enɛnɛ iyena losongana na denga balowadja lodikame na bu eyenga emɔti. Iyena edii mondumba moimea na su ta Loma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Denga di Loma baokaka gala e biso ko baso badoa asongana na su ta djaando e Apuisi ko na ta polo ekabee ibo Ndako Djisato. Ehole e baɛnɛ Polo, asakoa Ndjakomba ko aso aoka mokuku ngulu. <verse eid="ACT 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Ngɔngɔ dji boimea bo biso ta Loma, bapa Polo ndjea e bodaa iyo mɛnɛ e nde polo, na soda omɔti iyona omosɛndjɛlɛkɛ.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Polo alehi ta Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Ngɔngɔ dji masu masato, Polo abea ba babanei ba Bayudha. Ehole eputoana ibo, abala na bu bo: «Dengani, nongo adai mbi pɛpɛ bokɔɔ bobe bomɔti ta tei e ekomi e biso ko ta midaa mi bakɔkɔ ba biso, napeama ta Yelusalɛmɛ ko nakabama ta dii bato ba Loma. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Ngɔngɔ dji bato ba Loma bosambedjani bapalaka batingoeni, modjɔ mo baitaneani na modjɔ mobe mobwani na mbi bogwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Endelo Bayudha baidhima iboa mbi nasɛngɛɛ bo Kaisala akate ikambo di mbi, na pɛpɛ bobedja gala e ekomi e mbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 25:11 et la note.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Indjani modjɔ mokambaki na mbi naoɛnɛni ko naotɔndeani. Modjɔ mo banangini mikpulu mi bibende ta tina e mbuno e Ndjakomba ekalɛnde bana ba Isalɛlɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Ibo bamosɔmbedja bo: «Iso lobolodjiti nongo mokanda momɔti modongi ta Yudhea bɛngi losambedje ikambo di wɛ ko pɛpɛ nongo mwange biso omɔti odongi iho bɛngi alotɔndee modjɔ momɔti kaoko bobala bobe ta tina ewɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Endelo lopalaki olotɔndee modjɔ molɛnɛkɛdea wɛ, modjɔ mo lodjebakadea ibo pamba isusu balonakadea iputo idia idii wɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Bahɔɔ busa bo bosongana na Polo, ko aimea busa bomina, badoa ibo banɛnɛ ta ndako edhikamaka iyo. Polo abatɔndeaka Bokumu bo Ndjakomba donga ehuma mbunoko mɔkɔmɔkɔ, ko ahombaka abapangoe badhime Yesu na bolanga Mobeko mo Mose ko na buku dji Batɛli. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Bato bakina badhima mibalo mi nde, bakina baidhima. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Iboa banangana na pɛpɛ mookano ta tei e bobo, Polo abala na bu na bokue bo: «Mwembo Mosɛnɔke modaaka na molonga ehole ebala imo na bakɔkɔ ba bino na ndjea e motɛli Isaya! <verse eid="ACT 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />Mobala bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">“Kɛɛ atɔndee bato ibia bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Okakadeani bopele, endelo otasipoadeani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">oindjakadeani bopele, endelo otaɛnɛdeani.<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Modjɔ mo milema mi bato ibibi midii mipipo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">baditei matoi ko badipi miso, bɛngi madae pɛpɛ boɛnɛ, matoi ma bobo madae pɛpɛ booka, badae pɛpɛ bodia bowɛi bo bosipoa ta tina emina iyena badae pɛpɛ bohombedja milema ta dii mbi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">bɛngi nabaheledje<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ 26-27: Isa 6:9-10, elangama ta buku eyou e gɛlɛki.</char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Djebani bopele bo, Ndjakomba aloma bwɛndi bo mohelo ta dii bato badii pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Ndjem 67:3; Luk 3:6.</char></note>: ibo bamookɛadea!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 28:28">[ <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Ama bala Polo iboa, Bayudha baimana aisane kitɛ enɛnɛ mɛnɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ imumu modiiti ta mikanda minɛnɛ mi you.</char></note>]<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Polo akɔɔ bianga bibae itombo ta ndako e boputela. Iho asɔkɔ bato basusu bakɛkɛ amoindja. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Alehaka mɛko mi Bokumu bo Ndjakomba ko alehaka midjɔ miindji Kumu Yesu Kilito na sweya enɛnɛ ko moto o bomosia aidaka.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>